      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body"
               font-size="10.5pt"
               line-height="12.5pt"
               font-family="Ludolfus"
               text-align="justify"
               hyphenate="true"><!-- CATALOGUE     -->
         <fo:block-container>
            <fo:block id="BDLaethc14"
                      text-align="center"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid"
                      space-before="3mm">
               <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. c. 14</fo:block>
               <fo:block>(<fo:inline>Juel-Jensen 46</fo:inline>)</fo:block>
               <fo:block/>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Four Gospels</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Parchment codex, composite, 313×265×95 mm, 130 fols, 18, 1 quires.  Unit 1: . Unit 2: . </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                              The book is bound in wooden boards which were previously covered with brown blind-tooled leather.
                              A decorated textile inlay is glued on the inner side of the upper board.
                            
                              The boards are cut to the same size as the bookblock and have external shallow bevels. The grain runs vertically.
                            
                                Of the leather cover, only the turn-ins are preserved. Concentric frames of blind-tooled triple straight lines outline the borders of straight trimmed turn-ins.
                              The edges of turn-ins meet to form butt mitres.
                            4
                              Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern. <!-- Four --> S-plied threads are used.
                              The ends of the threads are knotted in the centrefold of the last quire.
                          
                              Threads of various colours are inserted in the outer margins for navigating the text.
                              More specifically, a red leaf string marker is inserted in the lower margin of fol. 86 and a
                              uncoloured leaf string marker is inserted in the upper margin of fols 104, .
                              Disjoint bifolios have been repaired with overcasting, e.g. Fols 51–53 or by sewing parchment guards with side stitches
                              along the spine fold of the quires, e.g. quire 18.
                              The manuscript is wrapped in a modern textile embroidered with two lions and probably purchased by <fo:inline id="d1e336PRS5782JuelJen">
                  <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:basic-link>
               </fo:inline>.
                          </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 1</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e392LIT1560Gospel">
                  <fo:inline>I) Fols 1ra–123vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Four Gospels (አርባዕቱ፡ ወንጌል፡), incomplete, CAe 1560.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The introductory materials to the Four Gospels, i.e. the Synopsis of the class, the Letter of Eusebius
                                    to Carpianus and the Eusebian Canons, are missing.</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e400LIT1558Matthew">
                  <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 1ra–35ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Matthew’ (ወንጌል፡ ዘማቴዎስ፡), CAe 1558.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e406LIT1558Matthew#TituliMatthew">
                  <fo:inline>I-1-1) Fols 1ra–1va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Matthew’ (ወንጌል፡ ዘማቴዎስ፡), CAe 1558.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The first three lines are blank, in correspondence of the first three <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">tituli</fo:inline>.
                                            The <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">tituli</fo:inline> are numbered from 1 to 63.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ፩  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ቅዳ​ሜ፡ ​ትም​ህር​ት፡
                                             ፪  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ብፁ​ዓን።
                                             ፫  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘለ​ምጽ።
                                             ፬  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ወልደ ​መስ​ፍን፡
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ፷  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ግብ​አቱ፡ ​ለክ​ርስ​ቶስ።
                                             ​፷፩  ​በእ​ንተ፡
                                             ​፷፪  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ነስ​ሐ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ።
                                             ​፷፫  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስእ​ለተ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ <fo:inline>[​ለእግ]</fo:inline>​ዚእ​ነ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e472LIT2709Matthew">
                  <fo:inline>I-1-2) Fols 2ra–35ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Matthew’ (ብስራተ፡ ማቴዎስ፡), CAe 2709.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                                            A stichometric note, that states that the Gospel of Matthew has 2700 lines (according to the
                                            meaning of <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቃል፡</fo:inline> in
                                            this context), is added at the end of the text on fol. 35ra: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ፡ ​ቃሉ፡ ​፳፻​ወ፯​፻።</fo:inline>.
                                        </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​በስ​መ፡ ​ኣብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​አሐ​ዱ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡  ​ብስ​ራተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ማቴ​ዎስ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​ዘዜ​ነወ፡
                                            ​ወን ​ጌለ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ጸሎ ​ቱ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ቱ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                             ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ለደ​ቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ኢ ​የሱ​ስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡  ​ወል​ደ፡ ​አብ​ርሃ​ም። ​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡  ​ወለ​ዶ፡
                                            ​ለይ​ስሐ​ቅ። ​ወይ​ስሐቅ ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ዶ፡ ​ለያ​ዕቆ​ብ። ​ወያ​ዕቆብ ​ኒ፡ ​ወለ​ደ፡ <fo:inline>ይሁዳ፡ ሃ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወአ​ኃዊ​ሁ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ወቀ​ረቦ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ወነ​በቦ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ተው​ህበ፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ስል​ጣን፡ ​በሰ​ማይ፡ ​ወበ​ምድ​ር፡ ሑ<fo:inline>[ሩ]</fo:inline>​ኬ፡
                                            ​እን​ከ፡ ​ወመ​ሀሩ፡ ​ለኵ​ሉ፡ ​አሕ​ዛብ፡ ​ወአ​ጥም​ቅዎ​ሙ፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ። ​ወመ​ሀር​ዎሙ፡ ​ይዕ​ቀቡ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዘአ​ዘዝ​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​ወና​ሁ፡ ​አነ፡
                                            ​ሀለ​ውኩ፡ ም  (fol. 35r)   (a)  ​ስሌ​ክሙ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕል፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ኅል​ቀተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም። ​=።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e535LIT1882MarkGo">
                  <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 35rb–60vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Mark’ (ወንጌል፡ ዘማርቆስ፡), CAe 1882.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e541LIT1882MarkGo#TituliMark">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-1) Fols 35rb–35va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Mark’ (ወንጌል፡ ዘማርቆስ፡), CAe 1882.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">tituli</fo:inline> are numbered from 1 to 48.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ፩  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘጋ​ኔን።
                                             ፪  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሐማ​ተ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ።
                                             ፫  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ተፈ​ውሱ፡ ​እም​ብዙ​ኅ፡ 
                                            ፬  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘለ​ምጽ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​፵፭  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ፋሲ​ካ።
                                             ​፵፮  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኣግ​ብኦ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ።
                                             ​፵፯  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ክሕ​ደ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ።
                                             ​፵፰  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስእ​ለተ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​እነ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e607LIT2711Mark">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-2) Fols 36ra–60vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Mark’ (ብስራተ፡ ማርቆስ፡), CAe 2711.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                                            A stichometric note, that states that the Gospel of Mark has 1700 lines, is added at the end of the text on fol. 60vb:
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘማ​ርቆ​ስ፡ ​ቃሉ፡ ​፲፻፡፯፻</fo:inline>.
                                        </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወን​ጌል። ​ዘ። ​ማር​ቆስ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ቀዳ​ሚሁ፡ ​ለወ​ንጌ​ል፡ ​እግዚ ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ጽ ​ሑፍ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት፡
                                                ​ናሁ፡ ​አነ፡ ​እፌ​ኑ፡ ​መል​ኣክ​የ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡  ​ገጽ​ከ፡ ​ዘይ​ጻይ​ሕ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተከ። ​ቃለ፡ ​ኣዋ​ዲ፡ ​ዘይ​ሰብ​ክ፡ ​በገዳ ​ም፡ ​ወይ​ብል፡ ​ጺሑ​አ፡ ​ፍኖ​ቶ፡
                                                    ​ለእ​ግዚ​አ፡ ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወዐ​ርዩ፡ መ ​ጽያ​ሕቶ። ​ወሀ​ሎ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​ያጠ​ምቅ፡ ​በገ​ዳም፡ ​ወይ​ሰብ​ክ፡ ​ጥም​ቀተ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይነ​ስሑ፡ ​ወይ​ትኀ​ደግ፡ ​ሎሙ፡
                                            ​ኃጢ​ኣቶ​ሙ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​በስ​መ፡ ​ዚኣ​የ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ያወ​ፅኡ፡ ​ወበ​ካል​እ፡ ​ልሳ​ን፡ ​ይት​ናገ​ሩ፡ ​ሐዲ​ሰ። ​ወኣ​ራዊ​ተ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ይእ​ኅዙ፡ ​ወዘ​ሂ፡ ​ይቀ​ትል፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሰት​ዩ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ዘይ​ነክ​ዮሙ።
                                            ​ወዲ​በ፡ ​ድዉ​ያን፡ ​እደ​ዊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ያነ​ብሩ፡ ​ወይ​ሜጥ​ኑ። ​ወእ​ግዚ​እነ​ሰ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ተና​ገሮ​ሙ፡ ​ዐር​ገ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወነ​በረ፡ ​በየ​ማነ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ፡
                                            ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ኣቡ​ሁ። ​ወወ​ፂኦ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ህየ፡ ​እሙ​ንቱ፡ ​በኵ​ለሄ፡ ​ሰበ​ኩ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ይረ​ድእ፡ ​ወቃ​ሎ፡ ​ያጸ​ንዕ፡ ​በተ​ኣም​ር፡ ​ዘይ​ተሉ፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e654LIT1812GospelLuke">
                  <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 61ra–100rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Luke’ (ወንጌል፡ ዘሉቃስ፡), CAe 1812.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e660LIT1812GospelLuke#TituliLuke">
                  <fo:inline>I-3-1) Fols 61ra–61vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Luke’ (ወንጌል፡ ዘሉቃስ፡), CAe 1812.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">tituli</fo:inline> are written over erasure up to 83.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                        <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ጸሕ​ፍ። ፪ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ኖሎ​ት።
                                            <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን።  ፬  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሐና፡ ​ነቢ​ት።
                                            <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ኃበ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ።
                                            <fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተመ​ከረ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ፹  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኣስ​ተኣ​ከዮ፡ ​ሄሮ​ድስ።
                                              (b) 
                                            ​፹፩  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይበ​ክያ፡ ​አን​ስት።
                                             ​፹፪  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ነስ​ሐ፡ ​ፈያ​ታዊ።
                                             ​፹፫  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስእ​ለተ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e721LIT2713Luke">
                  <fo:inline>I-3-2) Fols 62ra–100rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Luke’ (ብስራተ፡ ሉቃስ፡), CAe 2713.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">
                                            A stichometric note, that states that the Gospel of Luke has 2800 lines, is added at the end of the text on fol. 100rb:
                                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘሉ​ቃስ፡ ​ቃሉ፡ ​፳፻​፰፻።</fo:inline>.
                                        </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘሉ​ቃስ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​እስ​መ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃን፡ ​እለ፡ ​አኃ​ዙ፡ ወ ​ጠኑ፡ ​ይግ​በሩ፡ ​ወይ​ምሀ​ሩ፡ ​በእ ​ንተ፡ ​ግብ​ር፡ ​ዘኣ​ምኑ፡ ​በላ​ዕሌ​ነ፡  ​በከ​መ፡
                                            ​መሀ​ሩነ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ቀደ​ሙ፡  ​ርእ​ዮቶ፡ ​ወተ​ልእ​ኩዎ፡ ​በቃ​ሉ፡  ​ወረ​ትዓ​ኒ፡ ​ሊተ​ኒ፡ ​እት​ልዎ፡ ​እም ​ጥን​ቱ፡ ​ወእ​ጠይ​ቆ፡
                                                ​ለኵ​ሉ፡ ​በበ፡  ​መት​ልዉ። ​እጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ዓዚ​ዝ፡  ​ቴዎ​ፍሊ፡ ​ለኣ​ኃዚ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ታእም ​ር፡ ​ጥዩ​ቀ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ነገ​ር፡
                                            ​ትም​ህር​ተ፡ ​ዘተ​መሀ​ርከ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ወና​ሁ፡ ​አነ፡ ​እፌ​ኑ፡ ​ተስ​ፋሁ፡ ​ለአ​ቡየ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌክ​ሙ። ​ወአ​ንት​ሙሰ፡ ​ንበ​ሩ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ትለ​ብሱ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​እም​ኣር​ያም። ​ወኣ​ውፅ​ኦሙ፡ ​ኣፍ​ኣ፡
                                            ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ቢቲ​ንያ። ​ወአ​ንሥ​አ፡ ​እዴ​ሁ፡ ​ወኣ​ንበ  (b)  ​ረ፡ ​ወባ​ረኮ​ሙ። ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ይባ​ርኮ​ሙ፡ ​ተራ​ሐቆ​ሙ፡ ​ወዐ​ርገ፡ ​ሰማ​የ። ​ወእ​ሙን​ቱሰ፡ ​ሰገ​ዱ፡ ​ሎቱ፡
                                            ​ወተ​ሰው​ጡ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​በዐ​ቢይ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሓ፡ ​ወነ​በሩ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​መቅ​ደስ፡ ​ዘል​ፈ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይሴ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ወይ​ባር​ክዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ወለ​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                            ​ኣሜ​ን።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e776LIT1693John">
                  <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 100vb–123vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John (ወንጌል፡ ዘዮሐንስ፡), incomplete, CAe 1693.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e782LIT1693John#TituliJohn">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-1) Fol. 100vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John (ወንጌል፡ ዘዮሐንስ፡), CAe 1693.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">tituli</fo:inline> are numbered from 1 to 19.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ፩  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ከብ​ካብ፡ ​ዘቃ​ነ።
                                             ፪  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘሰ​ደደ፡ ​እም​ኵራ​ብ።
                                             ፫  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ኒቆ​ዲሞ​ስ።
                                             ፬  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​አጥ​ህሮ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​፲፮  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እለ፡ ​መጽ​ኡ፡ ​አረ​ሚይ።
                                             ​፲፯  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኃፀ​በ፡ ​እግ​ረ፡ ​አር​ዳኢ​ሁ።
                                             ​፲፰  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ጰራ​ቅሊ​ጦስ።
                                             ​፲፱  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስእ​ለተ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​እነ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e845LIT2715John">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-2) Fols 101ra–123vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John (ብስራተ፡ ዮሐንስ፡), incomplete, CAe 2715.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text terminates abruptly at John 16,18.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ፡
                                        </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ቀዳ​ሚሁ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ውእ​ቱ። ​ወውእ ​ቱ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ኃበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወእ​ግዚ​አ፡ ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ውእ ​ቱ፡
                                            ​ቃል። ​ወከ​ማሁ፡ ​ቀዳ​ሚሁ፡ እ ​ምቅ​ዲሙ፡ ​ኃበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ፡ ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​ውእ​ቱ። ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ቦቱ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ወዘእ ​ንበ​ሌሁ​ሰ፡
                                                ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ወኢ​ምን ​ትኒ። ​ወዘ​ሂ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​ኣሁ፡ ​ቦቱ፡  ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ውእ​ቱ። ​ወሕ​ይወ​ትሰ፡  ​ብር​ሃኑ፡ ​ለእ​ጓለ፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡
                                            ​ውእ​ቱ።
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዘቦ፡ ​አቡ​የ፡ ​ዚአ​የ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ። ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​እቤ፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ዚአ​የ፡ ​ይነ​ሥእ፡ ​ወይ​ነግ​ረክ​ሙ። ​ሕዳ​ጠ፡ ​ወኢ​ትሬ​እዩ​ኒ፡ ​ወካ​ዕበ፡ ​ሕዳ​ጠ፡ ​ወት​ሬእ​ዩኒ።
                                            ​ወቦ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይቤ​ሉ፡ ​እም​ኣር​ዳኢ​ሁ፡ ​በበ​ይና​ቲሆ​ሙ፡ ​ምን​ተኑ፡ ​ዘይ​ብለ​ነ፡ ​ሕዳ​ጠ፡ ​ወኢ​ትሬ​እዩ​ኒ፡ ​ወካ​ዕበ፡ ​ሕዳ​ጠ፡ ​ወት​ሬእ​ዩኒ፡ ​ወአ​ሓወ​ር፡ ​ኃበ፡ ​ኣብ። ​ወይ​ቤሉ፡
                                            ​ምን​ትኑ፡ ው
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         space-before="2mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 4v: Note crudely written in deep vermilion in the upper margin of the folio.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">Incipit:  ​ተዘ​ከር​ነ፡ እ ​ግዚ ​ኦ፡ ​በሣ​ህል​ከ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ፡ ​ወተ​ሰሀ​ለነ፡ ​በአ​ድህ​ኖት​ከ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 64rb: 
                                            Note crudely written in the right margin in Amharic, mentioning <fo:inline id="d1e1446PRS13183Tasamma">ʾAlaqā Tasammā</fo:inline>
                                             (possibly a later owner of the manuscript), <fo:inline id="d1e1451PRS13182WaldaSe">ʾAbbā Walda Śǝllāse</fo:inline>,
                                            and the church of <fo:inline id="d1e1456LOC7349DabraMi">Dabra Mikāʾel</fo:inline> (on which see colophon 1).
                                            </fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">
                                            የ<fo:inline id="d1e1467LOC7349DabraMi">​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline> ​ዛፍ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1470PRS13183Tasamma">​ያለ​ቃ፡ 
                                                ​ተሠ​ማ፡</fo:inline> ​ነው፡ ​ዙካ​ው፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1475PRS13182WaldaSe">​አባ፡  ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ሥላ​ሴ፡</fo:inline> ​ናቸ​ው፡
                                        </fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         space-before="2mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>A white sticker is glued to the inner side of the front board, on the top. The name of <fo:inline id="d1e1486PRS5782JuelJen">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> is printed on it
                                            (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡ ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>) and the signature ‘MS. Aeth. c. 14’ is written in pencil.
                                            An additional sticker, with the signature ‘Ms 46’ on it, is glued on the bottom of the same side.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>The numbers and titles of the gospel chapters are regularly written in red ink in the upper margin, in correspondence of the beginning of the chapters.
                                            They are sometimes written in the lower margin, e.g. on fols 24va, 29va, 64vb, .
                                            Additional titles are written in the upper margin black ink, in the same hand as that of the main text, e.g. on 30v, 59v, 97r.
                                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Aids for identifying monthly readings are written in the upper margin, sometimes within a frame:
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘጥ​ር፡</fo:inline> (fol. 4r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘጥ​ር፡ <fo:inline>ዘጌወርጊስ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline> in red ink (fol. 5r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">Incipit:  ​ዘማ​ቴዎ​ስ፡ ​ምስ​ማክ፡ ​ዘመ​ጋቢ​ት፡ ​ወዘ​ሐም​ሌ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 16v),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘሐ​ምሌ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ለም​ላእ​ክቲ​ሁ፡ ​ይኤ​ዝዞ​ሙ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይሰ​ቀቡ​ከ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ፍና​ዊከ፡ ​ወበ​እደ​ዊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ያነ​ሥሆ​ሙ፡ ​ፈጸ​ሞ፡</fo:inline> in purple ink in the left margin (fol. 16va),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              <fo:inline>ዘማዝያ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline> (fol. 46va),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​ዘታ​ሕሣ​ሥ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 51va),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ምን​ባብ፡ <fo:inline>ዘጌወርጊስ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ዘነ​ሀሴ፡ ​ዘማ​ርቆ​ስ፡</fo:inline> in red ink in the right margin (fol. 54rb),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘማ​ርቆ​ስ፡ ​ምን​ባብ፡ ​ዘመ​ስከ​ረም፡ ​ባህ፡ ​ስር​ቀ፡ <fo:inline>ዘጌወርጊስ፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline> in red ink in the right margin (fol. 55rb),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘግ​ንቦ​ት፡ <fo:inline>ተፍስሁ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ጻድ​ቃን፡</fo:inline> (fol. 55va),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘኅ​ዳር፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ዓዲ፡ ​ዘይ​ረስ​ዮሙ፡ በ<fo:inline>[ዓ]</fo:inline>​ል፡</fo:inline> (fol. 79va),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              <fo:inline>ዘጌወርጊስ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ዘሀ​ምሌ፡ ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘሉ​ቃስ፡</fo:inline> crudely written in deep vermilion (fol. 82r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">Incipit:  ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘሉ​ቃስ፡ ​ዘየ​ካቲ​ት፡ ​ምስ​ማክ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 85r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">Incipit:  ​ዘመ​ሥከ​ረም፡ ​ምስ​ማክ፡ ​ግነ​ዩ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline> (fol. 86rb),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">Incipit:  ​ዘግ​ንቦ​ት። ​ሕቀ፡ ​አህ​በጽ​ኮ፡ ​እመ​ላእ​ክቲ​ከ፡ ​ክብ​ረ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 115r).

                                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Aids for identifying liturgical readings concerning the passion of Jesus are written in the upper margin in the main hand:
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊዜ፡ ፫ ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​አኀ​ዝዎ፡ ​ለኢ​የሱ​ስ፡ ​ወወ​ሰድ​ዎ፡ ​ይስ​ቅል​ዎ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 32v),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊዜ፡ ፮ ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​አል​በስ​ዎ፡ ​አል​ባሲ​ሁ፡ ​ወወ​ሰድ​ዎ፡ ​ይስ​ቅል​ዎ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 33r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊዜ፡ ​ተስ​ዓቱ፡ ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ጸር​ኀ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​በቃ​ሉ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ኤሎ​ሂ፡ ​ኤሎ​ሂ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 33v),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊዜ፡ ፫ ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ቀሠ​ፎ፡ ​ጲላ​ጦስ፡ ​ለኢ​የሱ​ስ፡ ​ወወ​ሰድ​ዎ፡ ​ይስ​ቅል​ዎ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 59r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊዜ፡ ፫ ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​አሕ​የወ፡ ​ሎሙ፡ ​በር​ባን​ሃ፡ ወ  (fol. 98)  ​ወሀ​ቦሙ፡ ኢ<fo:inline>[የ]</fo:inline>​ሱስ​ሃ፡ ​ይስ​ቅል​ዎ፡</fo:inline> (fols 97v–98r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊዜ፡ ፮ ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ሰቀ​ልዎ፡ ​ለኢ​የሱ​ስ፡ በ ​መካ​ን፡  ​ቀራ​ንዮ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 98r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጊዜ፡ ፱ ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ገዓ​ረ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​በቃ​ሉ፡ ​ወወ​ፅአ​ት፡ ​መን​ፈሱ፡ ​ሶቤ​ሃ።</fo:inline> (fol. 98v).
                                            </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Small writings crudely executed and sometimes poorly legible:
                                             <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              <fo:inline>ክንክሣር፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline> in blue pen (fol. 27vb),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">ወ<fo:inline>[ን]</fo:inline>​ጌል፡ ​ዘሉ​ቃስ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 27vb),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጻድ​ቃን፡ ​ይወ​ርስ​ዎ፡ ​ለም​ድር፡</fo:inline> crudely written in deep vermilion in the lower margin (fol. 71r),
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">Incipit:  ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​ምስ​ማክ፡ ​ሠረ​ገላ​ቲሁ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​ብሔ​ር፡</fo:inline> written in a recent hand in the upper margin (fols 119r, ).
                                            Other poorly legible small writings in blue or vermilion ink are found in the margins, e.g. on fols 46v, 52rb, 82r.
                                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-after="3mm">
                                            Quire marks were written in the upper inner margin of the first folio and in the upper inner margin of the last folio of most of the original quires.
                                            The position of the signatures no longer coincides with the beginning and end of the current quires.
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፩</fo:inline> is found in the upper inner margins of fol. 108v;
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፪</fo:inline> is found in the upper inner margins of fols 69r, 76v, 109r, 115v;
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፫</fo:inline> is found in the upper inner margins of fols 18r, 25v, 54r, 77r, 116r;
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፬</fo:inline> is found in the upper inner margins of fols 26r, 68v;
                                            <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">፭</fo:inline> is found  in the upper inner margin of fols 93r, ;
                                            remains of illegible quire marks are found in the upper inner margin of fols 31v, 85r.
                                        </fo:block>
            <fo:block>18 quires. I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">2 (fols 1–2)</fo:inline> – X<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8+1 (s.l. 2 stubs between and/fols 54–62, , fol. 61, fol. 62)</fo:inline> – XI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">4 (fols 63–67)</fo:inline> – XII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">9 (fols 68–76)</fo:inline> – XIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 77–84)</fo:inline> – XIV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+2 (s.l. 3, 6/fols 85–92)</fo:inline> – XV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">9 (fols 93–101)</fo:inline> – XVI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">7 (fols 102–108)</fo:inline> – XVII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">5+1 (s.l. stub between and/fols 109–114, , fol. 113, fol. 114)</fo:inline> – XVIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">9 (fols 115–123)</fo:inline>II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 3–10)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (fols 11–16)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 17–24)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (fols 25–30)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">5 (fols 31–35)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+2 (s.l. stub between and stub between and/fols 36–44, , fol. 38, fols 39, , fol. 41, fol. 42)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (fols 45–50)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">3 (fols 51–53)</fo:inline> – </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 1ra–123vb: 2
                                    columns (24 written lines)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling pattern</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 1ra–123vb: Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
               <fo:table>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
                  <fo:table-body>
                     <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->
                              <fo:inline>
                                        Fine and trained hand. Characters are regularly spaced.
                                    </fo:inline>
                              <fo:block>Ink: Black, red or deep vermilion</fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                        Several groups of lines on the incipit page of each Gospel, alternating with black lines;
                                        the stichometric note at the end of the Gospel of Matthew, on fol. 35ra; holy names;
                                        the captions <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማር​ቆስ፡</fo:inline> on 35vb, <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ስዕ​ለ፡ ​ሉቃ​ስ፡</fo:inline> (partly illegible)
                                        on 61v, and <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዮሐ​ንስ፡</fo:inline> on 100va;
                                        the numbers of the chapters in the list of the <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">tituli</fo:inline> at the beginning of each Gospel;
                                        the numbers of the Eusebian Canons to which the Ammonian sections, penned in black ink in the left margins immediately above those numbers, belong;
                                        the numbers and titles of the chapters are written in the upper or lower margin, in correspondence of the beginning of the chapters;
                                        elements of the numerals and of the punctuation signs, including text dividers and caesura signs
                                        (the <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">crux ansata</fo:inline> is entirely rubricated on 65va; the <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">coronis</fo:inline> sign is
                                        entirely rubricated on 62vb, 63ra; the word <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቁም፡</fo:inline> is rubricated on e.g. 5rb, 56ra, 97ra.
                                    </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-body>
               </fo:table>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
            <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm">The manuscript contains four unframed Evangelist portraits
                                    executed in the Italianate style characteristic of a period between <fo:inline>1480-1540</fo:inline>. The miniatures occupy the
                                    full height and the width of one column of text.
                                    <fo:basic-link internal-destination="bm_JuelJensen1996MikaelZata">
                  <fo:inline id="d1e1312bm_JuelJensen1996MikaelZata">
                     <inline xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Format">Juel-Jensen 1996</inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>
                                    believed that these were painted by the Italian artist <fo:inline id="d1e1314 PRS2887Brancale">
                  <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu// PRS2887Brancale">Nicolò Brancaleone</fo:basic-link>
               </fo:inline>, but a closer analysis of their
                                    style and iconography (<fo:basic-link internal-destination="bm_2019GnisciGospel">
                  <fo:inline id="d1e1317bm_2019GnisciGospel">
                     <inline xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Format">Gnisci 2019</inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>) does not support this attribution.
                                    Small ornamental bands with arabesque or interlace patterns mark the end of paragraphs throughout the manuscript.
                                    These fill the empty space left at the end of a paragraph or are placed between columns.
                                    They often cover punctuation marks or chapter divisions and it is difficult to establish when they were added.</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>7)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1v: <fo:inline> A standing
                                        Evangelist portrait of <fo:inline id="d1e1329PRS6902Matthew">Matthew</fo:inline> with a hand cross
                                        in his right hand and a codex in the other. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሥዕ​ለ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1340PRS6902Matthew">​ማቴ​ዎስ፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>8)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 35v: <fo:inline> An
                                        Evangelist portrait of <fo:inline id="d1e1354PRS6751Mark">Mark</fo:inline> seated on a wicker chair under a canopy.
                                        He has a halo and is inscribing a codex. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              <fo:inline id="d1e1361PRS6751Mark">​ማር​ቆስ፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>9)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 61v: <fo:inline> A standing
                                        Evangelist portrait of <fo:inline id="d1e1375PRS6387Luke">Luke</fo:inline> with a hand cross
                                        in his right hand and a codex in the other. He wears an unusual tiara. <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሥዕ​ለ፡  <fo:inline id="d1e1386PRS6387Luke">​ሉቃ​ስ።</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>10)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 100v: <fo:inline> A standing
                                        Evangelist portrait of <fo:inline id="d1e1400PRS5695John">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5695John">John</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> with a hand cross
                                        in his right hand and a codex in the other.
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              <fo:inline id="d1e1409PRS5695John">​ዮሐ​ንስ</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>11)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 2r, 36r, 62r, 101r: <fo:inline>Polychrome ornamental bands with arabesque decorations mark the beginning of each gospel.</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
               <fo:block>Holes resulting from parchment making are found on e.g. Fols 1, 40, 85, . Tears on several folios have
                                            been repaired both at the moment of parchment production, e.g. on 106, 118,
                                            and at a later stage, e.g. Fol. 2.</fo:block>
               <fo:block/>
               <fo:block/>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                                        The bookblock has been resewn together and parchment guards have been placed around all quires.
                                        Fols 51r–62v have been stitched together at a later stage.
                                        The bookblock has been damaged by humidity, especially in the outer margins, and water stains are present (e.g. on fols 37, 104v, ).
                                        Wax stains are visible on 31v, 72v. The parchment is stained and crumpled on fol. 74.
                                       </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm"/>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Unit 2</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e1715LIT1693John">
                  <fo:inline>I) Fols 124ra–130va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John (ወንጌል፡ ዘዮሐንስ፡), incomplete, CAe 1693.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e1721LIT2715John">
                  <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 124ra–130va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John (ብስራተ፡ ዮሐንስ፡), incomplete, CAe 2715.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text begins abruptly from John 16,20. The stichometric note at the end is missing.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​አማ​ን፡ ​አማ​ን፡ ​እብ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትበ​ክዩ፡ ​ወት​ላህ​ዉ፡ ​አን​ትሙ፡ ​ወዓ​ለም​ሰ፡ ​ይት​ፈሣ​ሕ፡ ​ወአ​ንት​ሙሰ፡ ​ተኃ​ዝኑ። ​አላ፡ ​ኃዘ​ንክ​ሙ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ይከ​ውነ​ክሙ፡
                                        ​ለክ​ሙ። ​በከ​መ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ትቴ​ክዝ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​አል​ፀቀ​ት፡ ​ትለ​ድ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​በጽ​ሐ፡ ​ጊዜ​ሃ። ​ወእ​ምከ​መ፡ ​ወለ​ደት፡ ​እጓ​ለ፡ ​ኢት​ዜከ​ሮ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​ለሕ​ማማ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡
                                        ​ፍሥ​ሓሐ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ወለ​ደት፡ ​ብእ​ሴ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ወአ​ንት​ሙነ፡ ​ትቴ​ክዙ፡ ​ይእ​ዜ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ግዚ​እ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡  ​ይቤ፡ ​ኢይ​መው​ት፡ ​አላ፡ ​ይቤ​ሎ፡ ​እመ​ኬ፡ ​ፈቀ​ድኩ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​እመ​ጽእ፡ ​ሚላ​ዕሌ​ከ፡ ​ወዝ​ንቱ፡
                                        ​ረድ​እ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕተ፡ ​በእ​ንተ​ዝ፡ ​ወጻ​ሐፎ፡ ​ወን​ሕነ፡ ​ነአ​ምር፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ጽድ​ቁ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ስም​ዑ። ​ወዘ​ንተ፡ ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ 
                                        ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​አር​ዳኢ​ሁ፡ ​ወባ​ዕደ​ኒ፡ ​ግብ​ራተ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃ። ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ተጽ​ሐፈ፡   (fol. 130v)   (a)   ​ኵሉ፡ ​በበ፩ ​እም​ኢያ​ግመ​ሮ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ጥቀ፡ ​መጻ​ሕፍ​ቲሁ፡
                                        ​ዘተ​ጽሐ​ፈ፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ሜን።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e1752LIT1693John#Postscript">
                  <fo:inline>I-2) Fol. 130va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John (ወንጌል፡ ዘዮሐንስ፡), CAe 1693.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The note includes information on the circumstances of the writing of the Gospel of John, namely the dating and the place of completion.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​መል​ዓ፡ <fo:inline>ጽሕፈቱ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ብስራ<fo:inline>[ተ]</fo:inline> ​ለዮ​ሐን​ስ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ዘ<fo:inline>[ብ]</fo:inline>​ዴዎ​ስ፡
                                        ​፩እ​ም፲​ወ፪ ​ሰባ​ክያ​ን፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ጸሐ​ፎ፡ ​በዮ​ናኒ፡ ​ለሰ​ብአ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ኤፌ​ሶን። ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ዕር​ገቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​በሥ​ጋ፡
                                        ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​በ፴ ​ዓመ​ት፡ ​በ፰ ​ዓመ​ተ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ቱ፡ ​ለጢ​ባር​ዮስ፡ ​ቄሣ​ር፡ ​ወስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Colophon</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block font-family="Ludolfus">Fol. 130va: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">The colophon is undated. It states that the manuscript belongs to <fo:inline id="d1e1800LOC7349DabraMi">Dabra Mikāʾel</fo:inline>
                                        of the city of <fo:inline id="d1e1803LOC6450Zatta">Zāttā</fo:inline> in <fo:inline id="d1e1806LOC6573NorthWallo">Northern Wallo</fo:inline>.
                                        It also states that the scribe was <fo:inline id="d1e1809PRS13184WaldaHe">Walda Ḥǝḍān</fo:inline> and the patron was
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e1812PRS13185WaldaMi">Walda Mikāʾel</fo:inline>.
                                    </fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዝመ​ጽሐ​ፍ፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡  ​ሚካ​ኤል፡  ​ዘሀ​ገረ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1786LOC6450Zatta">​ዛታ፡</fo:inline> ​ተጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​በሢ​መተ፡ ​አካ​ሉ፡ ​ጸሐ​ፊሁ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e1789PRS13184WaldaHe">​ወል​ደ፡ ​ሕፃ​ን፡</fo:inline> ​ወአ​ጽሐ​ፊሁ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e1793PRS13185WaldaMi">​ወል​ደ፡   ​ሚካ​ኤል።</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Colophon</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block font-family="Ludolfus">Fol. 130va: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">The colophon is undated. It states that the manuscript belongs to <fo:inline id="d1e1800LOC7349DabraMi">Dabra Mikāʾel</fo:inline>
                                        of the city of <fo:inline id="d1e1803LOC6450Zatta">Zāttā</fo:inline> in <fo:inline id="d1e1806LOC6573NorthWallo">Northern Wallo</fo:inline>.
                                        It also states that the scribe was <fo:inline id="d1e1809PRS13184WaldaHe">Walda Ḥǝḍān</fo:inline> and the patron was
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e1812PRS13185WaldaMi">Walda Mikāʾel</fo:inline>.
                                    </fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዝመ​ጽሐ​ፍ፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡  ​ሚካ​ኤል፡  ​ዘሀ​ገረ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e1786LOC6450Zatta">​ዛታ፡</fo:inline> ​ተጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​በሢ​መተ፡ ​አካ​ሉ፡ ​ጸሐ​ፊሁ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e1789PRS13184WaldaHe">​ወል​ደ፡ ​ሕፃ​ን፡</fo:inline> ​ወአ​ጽሐ​ፊሁ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e1793PRS13185WaldaMi">​ወል​ደ፡   ​ሚካ​ኤል።</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         space-before="2mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Aids for identifying readings concerning the passion of Jesus are written in the upper margin in deep vermilion ink:
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘአ​ግብ​አ፡  <fo:inline>ተግብር፡ (!)</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline> (fol. 124va),
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘነ​ግህ፡ ​ወወ​ሰድ​ዎ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 125rb),
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘ፫ ​ሰዓ​ት፡</fo:inline> (fol. 126vb),
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘቀ​ትር፡</fo:inline> (fol. 127rb),
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘሰ​ዓት፡</fo:inline> (fol. 127vb),
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘሰ​ርክ፡</fo:inline> (fol. 128ra),
                                        <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘእ​ሁድ፡ ​ሰን​በት፡</fo:inline> (fol. 128rb).
                                    </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
            <fo:block>1 quire. XIX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+1 (s.l. 1/fols 124–130)</fo:inline>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 124ra–130va: 2
                                    columns (27 written lines)</fo:block>
                        <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">text area
                                            225 × 206mm (fol. 124r)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling pattern</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 124ra–130va: Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
               <fo:table>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
                  <fo:table-body>
                     <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline>Hand 2:</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->
                              <fo:inline>Fine and trained hand. Characters are regularly spaced.</fo:inline>
                              <fo:block>Ink: Black, red</fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    Incipits of few chapters and of the postscript; holy names; the word <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቁም፡</fo:inline>, written in a later
                                    hand on fol. 127vb; elements of the numerals and of the punctuation signs, including text dividers.
                                </fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                                provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                                start-indent="cm">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​ምዕ፡ for ​ምዕ​ራፍ፡ (e.g. on fols 128ra, 128va)
                                    </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-body>
               </fo:table>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                                    The unit consists of one quire subsequently sewn to the textblock of the first unit. The unit is in good state of preservation.
                                    Some letters are illegible on fol. 124r due to faded ink. The verso of the last folio displays traces of intensive use and erasures.
                                </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                      page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethc14">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethc14</fo:basic-link>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="BDLaethd20"
                      text-align="center"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid"
                      space-before="3mm">
               <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. d. 20</fo:block>
               <fo:block>(<fo:inline>Arch. O. d. 44</fo:inline>
                  <fo:inline>Juel-Jensen 15</fo:inline>)</fo:block>
               <fo:block/>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">
               <fo:inline font-style="italic">Malkǝʾ</fo:inline>-hymns, Excerpts from the New Testament, Miracles of Mary, Miracles of Jesus, Homily by Jacob of Serug on the Angel and the Thief</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Parchment codex, 277×225×65 mm, 123 fols, 17 quires. , eighteenth century.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
                  <fo:inline>I) Fols 1va–2rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Hymns</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2273LIT3093RepCh373">
                  <fo:inline>I-1) Fol. 1va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘worship Thee, O my Lady, Holy Virgin Mary, Mother of Jesus Christ the Almighty’ (እሰግድ፡ ለኪ፡ ኦእግዝእትየ፡ ቅድስት፡ ድንግል፡ ማርያም፡ ማሪሃም፡ እሙ፡ ለኢየሱስ፡ ክርስቶስ፡ ከሃሊ።), CAe 3093.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን ​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ማ<fo:inline>ረ (!)</fo:inline>​ሃም፡ ​እሙ፡ ​ለኢ​የሱ​ስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ከሀሊ ፨ 
                                    ​ኀበ፡ ​ይት​ነበ​ብ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ተአ​ምር​ኪ፡ ​አክ​ናፈ​ኪ፡ ​ጸልሊ ፨  ​ወዘ​ሰማ​ዕነ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>
                                    ​በል​ብነ፡ ​አብ​ቍሲ ፨  ​አዕ​ፁቂ​ሁ፡ ​አል​ዕሊ ፨  ​ወሕ​ንባ​ባቲ​ሁ፡ ​አፅ​ድሊ ፨</fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በዝ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​እም​ኔነ፡ ​ኢት​ሰሰሊ ፨  ​ወበ​ዘይ​መጽ​እ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ነፍ​ስነ፡ ​እም​ነፍ​ስኪ፡ ​ኢይ​ሌሊ ፨ 
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2330LIT5443Salamlaki2">
                  <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 1va–2rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Salutation to you, o my Lady, Holy Virgin Mary, Mother of Light’ (ሰላም፡ ለኪ፡ ኦእግዝእትየ፡ ቅድስት፡ ድንግል፡ ማርያም፡ እመ፡ ብርሃን፡ ), CAe 5443.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ሰላ​ም፡ ለ ኪ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​የ፡
                                 ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​እመ፡   (b)   ​መድ​ኅን፡ ​ወእ​መ፡ ​ብር​ሃን ፨ 
                                ​እመ፡ ​ቍር​ባን ፤  ​ወእ​መ፡ ​ዕጣን ፤  ​እመ፡ ​ነድ ፤  ​ወእ​መ፡
                                ​ዋሕድ ፨  ​እመ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​ወእ​መ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​እመ፡ ​መሲሕ ፤  ​ወእ​መ፡ ​መለ​ኮታ​ዊ፡ ​መፍ​ርህ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ወን​ጹሓ​ን፡ ​ድን​ግል​ናኪ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይሴ​ብሑ ፨  ​ኀበ፡ ​ሥእ​ልኪ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ይጸ​ርሑ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ገጽ​ኪ፡ ​ይት​ሞጥሑ ፨ 
                                ​ኀበ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​መር​ዓሁ፡ ​ለወ​ልድኪ ፤  ​ያን​ፈር​ዕፁ፡ ​ወይ​ትፌ​ሥሑ ፤  ​ለዓ​ለመ ፤ 
                                ​ዓለም ፤  ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
                  <fo:inline>II) Fols 7ra–19rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Excerpts from the New Testament</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2412LIT3517Epistle">
                  <fo:inline>II-1) Fols 7ra–7vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Second Epistle to the Corinthians (መልእክተ፡ ጳውሎስ፡ ዳግማዊ፡ ኀበ፡ ሰብአ፡ ቆሮንቶስ።), incomplete, CAe 3517.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ወእ​ነግ​ረክ​ሙ፡ ​አኃ​ዊነ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ ​ር፡ ​ዘተ​ውህ​በ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዘመ​ቂዶ​ንያ ፨ 
                                ​እስ​መ፡ ​እም​ብዙ​ኀ፡ ​መከ​ራ፡ ​ሕማ​ሞሙ፡ ​ፈድ​ፈደ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐሆ​ሙ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ዕመ​ቀ፡ ​ንዲ​ቶሙ፡ ​ፈድ​ፈደ​ት፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ብዕ​ሎሙ ፨ 
                                ​እስመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለል​የ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕቶ​ሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​በአ​ምጣ​ነ፡ ​ኃይ​ሎሙ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​እስ​መ፡ ​ተረ​ፈ፡ ​ዚአ​ክሙ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ንት​ጋ፡ ​እል​ክቱ፡ ​ይከ​ውን ፨  ​ወተ​ረፈ፡ ​ዚአ​ሆሙ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ንት​ጋ፡ ​ዚአ​ክሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ሀል​ዎት​ክሙ፡
                                ​ዕሩ​የ፡ ​በኵሉ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ከመ​ዝ፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፍ፡ ​ዘቦ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃ፡ ​ኢያ​ትረ​ፈ፡ ​ወዘ​ቦ፡ ​ውሑ​ድ፡ ​ኢያ​ሕፀፀ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2458LIT3507Epistle">
                  <fo:inline>II-2) Fols 8ra–9rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, incomplete, CAe 3507.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​አኃ​ዊነ፡ ​ኢታ​ንክ​ርዋ፡ ​ለእ​ንተ፡ ​ትመ​ጽአ​ክሙ፡  ​መከ​ራ፡ ​ከመ፡
                                    ​ዘነ​ኪር፡ ​ግብ​ር፡ ​ዘይ​ከው​ን፡ ​ብክ​ሙ፡ ​ዳእ​ሙ፡ ​መከ​ራ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ወዘ​ኢት​ለም​ዱ፡ ​ይበ​ጽሐ​ክሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትሳ​ትፍ​ዎ፡
                                    ​በሕ​ማሙ፡ ​ለክ​ርስ​ቶስ ፨  ​ወተ​ፈሥ​ሑ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ያስ​ተር​ኢ፡ ​በስ​ብሐ​ቲሁ፡
                                    ​ትት​ሐሠ​ዩ፡ ​ፍሡ​ሐኒ​ክሙ ፨  ​ወእ​ምሶ​በ፡ ​ዘተ​ዓየ​ሩሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስሙ፡
                                    ​ለክ​ርስ​ቶስ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወአ​ጽን​ዑ፡ ​ቀዊ​መ፡ ​በሃ​ይማ​ኖት​ክሙ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ተአ​ምሩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ሕማ​ሙ፡ ​ለዝ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ትረ​ክቦ​ሙ፡ ​ለኵ​ሎሙ፡
                                    ​አኃ​ዊክ​ሙ፡ ​አጽ​ንዕ​ዋ፡ ​ለተ​ፋቅሮ ፤  ​ወእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ዘበ​ኵሉ፡ ​ክብ​ር፡
                                    ​ጸው​ዓክ​ሙ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዘለ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲ​ሁ፡ ​በኢ​የሱ​ስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨ 
                                    ​ኅዳ​ጠ፡ ​ሐሚመ  (b)  ​ክሙ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ይፈ​ጽም፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ወያ​ጸን​ዓክ​ሙ፡ ​ወያ​ሌብ​ወክ​ሙ፡ ​ዘሎ​ቱ፡
                                    ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወኃ​ይል፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፤
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2504LIT1019Actsof">
                  <fo:inline>II-3) Fols 9rb–9vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Acts of the Apostles’ (ግብረ፡ ሐዋርያት፡), incomplete, CAe 1019.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወበ​ጊዜ፡ ​መን​ፈቀ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ጸለ​ዩ፡ ​ጳው​ሎስ፡ ወ ​ሲላ​ስ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሕ​ዎ፡
                                    ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወሙ​ቁሐ​ን፡ ​ይሰ​ምዕ​ዎሙ ፨  ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​አድ​ለቅ​ለቀ​ት፡
                                    ​ዓቢ​ይ፡ ​ድል​ቅል​ቅ፡ ​ወአ​ንቀ​ልቀ​ለ፡ ​መሠ​ረተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ሞቅሕ ፨  ​ወተ​ርኀ​ወ፡
                                    ​በጊ​ዜሃ፡ ​አና​ቅጽ፡ ​ወተ​ፈት​ሐ፡ ​መዋ​ቀሕ​ቲሆ​ሙ፡ ​ለኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ነቅ​ሐ፡ ​ዓቃ​ቤ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ሞቅ​ሕ፡ ​ወር​እየ፡
                                    ​ኵሎ፡   (fol. 9v)   (a)   ​አና​ቅጸ፡ ​ወመ​ልሑ፡ ​መጥ​ባሕ​ቶ፡ ​ወፈ​ቀደ፡ ​ይት​ረገ​ዝ፡ ​ለሊ​ሁ፡ ​እስ​መ፡
                                    ​መሰ​ሎ፡ ​ዘአ​ምሰ​ጡ፡ ​ሙቁ​ሐን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወይ​ቤል​ዎ፡ ​እመ​ን፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ። ​ወተ​ሐዩ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ቤት​ከ፡ ​ወነ​ገር​ዎ፡ ​ቃአ፡
                                    ​እግዚ  (b)  ​አብ​ሔር ፨  ​ወለ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሰብ​ኡ፡ ​ወነ​ሥኦ​ሙ፡ ​ሶቤ​ሃ፡
                                    ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​ወሐ​ፀቦ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ቅሥ​ፈቶ​ሙ፡ ​ወተ ጠ ​ምቀ፡ ​ውእ​ቱኒ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ሰብ​ኡ፡ ​ወቤቱ ፨ 
                                    ​ወበ​ጊዜ​ሃ፡ ​አዕ​ረጎ​ሙ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​መሠ​ርዓ፡ ​ማዕ​ደ፡ ​ወተ​ፈሥ​ሐ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ቤቱ፡ ​በአ​ሚነ፡
                                    ​እግ​ዚእነ ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2562LIT2709Matthew">
                  <fo:inline>II-4) Fols 9vb–10va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gospel of Matthew’ (ብስራተ፡ ማቴዎስ፡), incomplete, CAe 2709.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​አሜ​ሃ፡ ​ይእ​ተ፡ ​አሚ​ረ፡ ​ትመ​ስል፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡  ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​አሥ​ርን፡ ​ለደ​ናግ​ል፡ ​እለ፡
                                    ​ነሥ​አ፡ ​መኃ​ትዊ​ሆን፡ ​ወወ​ፅአ፡ ​ወሖ​ራ፡ ​ለቀ​በላ፡ ​መር​ዓዊ፡ ​ኃም​ስ፡ ​እም​ውስ​ቴቶ​ን፡ ​አብ​ዳት፡ ​እማ​ንቱ፡
                                    ወ  (fol. 10r)   (a)  ​ኃም​ስ፡ ​ጠባ​ባት ፨  ​አብ​ዳት​ሰ፡ ​ነሢ​ኦን፡
                                    ​መኃ​ትዊ​ሆን፡ ​ወኢ​ነሥ​አ፡ ​ቅብ​ዓ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሆን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​መጽ​አ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ተር​ፋ፡ ​ደና​ግል፡ ​ወይ​ቤላ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አር​ኅወ​ነ። ​ወአ​ውሥ​አሆ​ን፡
                                    ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ን፡ ​አማ​ን፡ ​እብ​ለክ​ን፡
                                    ​ኢየ​አምረ  (fol. 10v)   (a)  ​ክን፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ስእ​ንክ​ን፡ ​ምስ​ሌየ፡ ​ተጊ​ሃ፡ ​ምስ​ሌየ፡ ​አም​ስዮ፡ ​ትግ​ሁ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​እስ​መ፡
                                    ​ኢተ​አም​ሩ፡ ​ዕለ​ታ፡ ​ወሰ​ዓታ። ​እን​ተ፡ ​ባቲ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እጓ​ለ፡ ​እመ​ሕያው ፨
                                    ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2606LIT3524Epistle">
                  <fo:inline>II-5) Fols 10va–11vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (መልእክተ፡ ጳውሎስ፡ ኀበ፡ ሰብአ፡ ዕብራዊያን፡), incomplete, CAe 3524.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ንፍ​ራህ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​ወኢ​ንኀ​ድግ፡ ​ትእ​ዛዘ፡ ​ከመ፡ ን ​ባእ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዕረ​ፍተ፡ ​ለእ​መቦ፡ ​እን​ጋ፡
                                    ​ዘይ​ትረ​ከብ፡ ​እም​ኔክ​ሙ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ልማ​ድ፡ ​ወይ​ጸን​ዕ፡ ​ዘየ​ኃድ​ግዎ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይባ​እ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዕረ​ፍቱ ፨ 
                                    ​ወኢ​ይመ​ሰሎ፡ ለ ፩  ​እም​ኔክ​ሙ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ስሙ​ዓን፡
                                    ​ንሕ  (b)  ​ነ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ሰም​ዑ፡ ​እል​ክቱ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​ኢን​ደቅ፡ ​ከማ​ሆሙ፡ ​ለእ​ሙን​ቱ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ዓለ​ዉ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወጽ​ኑዕ፡ ​ወይ​በል​ሕ፡ ​እም​ኵሉ፡
                                    ​ሰይ​ፍ፡ ዘ ፪ ​ኤ፡ ​አፉ​ሁ፡ ​ወይ​ፈል​ጥ፡ ​ነፍ​ሰ፡ ​እም​ነፍ​ስት፡ ​ወይ​ሌሊ፡
                                    ​ሥርወ  (fol. 11v)   (a)   ​እም​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ወየ​ኃሥ​ሥ፡ ​ሕሊ​ና፡ ​ወፍ​ትወ​ተ፡ ​ወም​ክረ፡ ​ልብ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ልቦ፡ ​ዘተ​ፈጥ​ረ፡ ​ዘኢ​ኮነ፡ ​ክሡ​ተ፡ ​በቅ​ድሜሁ ፨  ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ክሡ​ት፡ ​ወስ​ጡሕ፡ ​በቅ​ድመ፡
                                    ​አዕ​ይን​ቲሁ፡ ​ወሎ​ቱ፡ ​ናወ​ሥእ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘገ​በርነ ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በረ​ከቱ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e2663PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2681LIT3512Epistle">
                  <fo:inline>II-6) Fols 11vb–12rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, incomplete, CAe 3512.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ንዑ፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​አብ​ዕል​ት፡ ​ወብ​ክዩ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ት ​ግዕ​ሩ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ኅር​ትም​ናክ​ሙ፡
                                    ​እን​ተ፡ ​ሀለ​ወት፡ ​ትም​ጻእ​ክሙ ፨ 
                                    ​ብዕ​ልክ​ሙኒ፡ ​ነቅ​ዘ፡ ​ወአ​ልባ  (b)  ​ሲክ​ሙ፡ ​ቈን​ቈነ፡ ​ወር​ቅክ​ሙኒ፡ ​ወብ​ሩር​ክሙ​ኒ፡ ​ዝኅለ ፨ 
                                    ​ወዛ​ኅሉ፡ ​ስም​ዓ፡ ​ይከ​ውን፡ ​ላዕ​ሌክሙ ፨  ​ወይ​በል​ዖ፡ ​ለሥ​ጋክ​ሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡
                                    ​ዘገ​በር​ክሙ፡ ​ለደ​ኃሪ፡ ​መዋ​ዕል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወኦ​ሆ፡ ​ኢይ​ብለ​ክሙ፡ ​ተዓ​ገሡ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​አኃ​ዊነ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ደኃ​ሪት፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​አመ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ክሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ሐረ​ሳዊ፡
                                    ​ዘይ​ጸን​ሕ፡ ​ፍሬ​ሃ፡ ​ለም​ድር፡ ​ክብ​ርት፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይት​ዔገ​ሣ፡ ​ሰር​ከ፡ ​ወነ​ግሀ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ትሰ​ዊ፡ ​ወት​ፈሪ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ወት​ትዓ​ፀድ ፨ 
                                    ​ተዓ​ገሡ​ኬ፡ ​አን​ትሙ​ኒ፡ ​ወአ​ጽን​ዑ፡ ​ልበ​ክሙ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ቀርበ  (b)  ​ት፡ ​ምጽ​አቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እክሙ ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​አም​ላኩ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሩ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e2734PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2750LIT1019Actsof">
                  <fo:inline>II-7) Fols 12rb–13ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Acts of the Apostles’ (ግብረ፡ ሐዋርያት፡), incomplete, CAe 1019.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ጥዩ​ቀ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​ያእ​ምሩ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ከ ​መ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ኒ፡ ​ወመ​ሲሐ​ኒ፡ ​ረሰ​ዮ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ለው​እቱ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ዘአ​ንት​ሙ፡ ​ሰቀ​ልክ​ምዎ ፨  ​ወሰ​ሚዖ​ሙ፡
                                        ​ተከ​ሥተ፡ ​ልቦ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ቤል​ዎሙ፡ ​ለጴ​ጥሮ​ስ፡ ​ወለ​ቢጹ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት፡ ​ምን​ተ፡ ​ንግ​በር፡ ​አኃ​ዊነ ፨ 
                                    ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ጴጥ​ሮስ፡ ​ነስ​ሑ፡ ​ወተ​ጠም​ቁ፡ ​በስ  (fol. 12v)   (a)  ​ሙ፡ ​ለኢ​የሱ​ስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወየ​አኵ​ቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብሔ  (fol. 13r)   (a)  ​ር፡ ​ወቦ​ሙ፡ ​ሞገ​ስ፡ ​በኀ​በ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሰብእ ፨ 
                                    ​ወእ​ንተ፡ ​ጸብ​ሐት፡ ​ይዌ​ስክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ዲቤ​ሆሙ፡ ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​የሐ​ይዉ ፨ 
                                    ​መል​ዓ፡ ​ወዓ​ብየ፡ ​ወተ​ለዓ​ለ፡ ​ወተ​ወሰ​ከ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያኑ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት ፨ 
                                    ​ወበ​ዝኑ፡ ​እለ፡ ​አም​ኑ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በረ​ከቱ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e2794PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2808LIT2715John">
                  <fo:inline>II-8) Fols 13rb–15rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John (ብስራተ፡ ዮሐንስ፡), incomplete, CAe 2715.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ። ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅረ​ዝ፡ ​ኮነ፡ በ ​በዓ​ሎሙ፡ ​ለአ​ይሁ​ድ፡ ​ዓር​ገ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡
                                    ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም ፨  ​ወቦ​ቱ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ምጥ​ማቃ​ት፡ ​ዘጵ​ሩጳ​ጥቄ፡
                                    ​ቅል​ንብ​ትራ፡ ​ስማ፡ ​በዕ​ብራ​ይስ​ጥ፡ ​ይብ​ልዋ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ሣህል ፨  ​ወይ​እቲ፡ ​ቀላ​ይ፡ ​ምሕ​ማሰ፡
                                    ​አባ​ግዕ፡ ​ብሂል ፨  ​ወባ​ቲ፡  ፭  ​ህዋ​ራት፡ ​ወህ​የ፡ ​ይሰ​ክቡ፡
                                    ​ብዙ​ኃን<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                    ​ድው​ያን፡ ​ዕው​ራን፡ ​ወሐ​ንካ​ሳን፡ ​ወይ​ቡሳ​ን፡ ​ወይ​ጸን​ሑ፡ ​ሁከ​ተ፡ ​ማይ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወወ​ሀቦ፡ ​ሥል​ጣነ፡ ​ወመ​ባሕ​ተ፡ ​ይግ​በር፡ ​ኵነ​ኔ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እጓ​ለ፡ ​እመ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ውእቱ ፨ 
                                    ​ወበ​እን​ተ፡ ​ዝን​ቱሰ፡ ​ኢታ​ንክ​ሩ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ይበ​ጽሕ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ዘይ​ሰም​ዕዎ፡ ​ቦቱ፡ ​ቃሎ፡ ​ለወ​ልደ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፨ 
                                    ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​እለ፡ ​መቃ​ብር።
                                    ወ  (b)  ​ይወ​ፅኡ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ሠና​የ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ትን​ሣኤ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት ፨  ​ወእ​ለሰ፡ ​እኩ​የ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ሩ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ትን​ሣኤ፡ ​ዘለ​ደይን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በረ​ከቱ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e2865PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፤
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2879LIT3516Epistle">
                  <fo:inline>II-9) Fols 15rb–16ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (መልእክተ፡ ጳውሎስ፡ ቀዳማዊ፡ ኀበ፡ ሰብአ፡ ቆሮንቶስ፡፡), incomplete, CAe 3516.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እስ​መቦ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ዘነ​ፍስ፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​ዘመ​ንፈ​ስ፡  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​ይቤ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                    ​መጽ​ሐፍ፡ ​ተፈ​ጥረ​አ፡ ​አዳ​ም፡ ​ቀዳ​ሚ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘነ​ፍስ፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ወደ​ኃራ​ዊ፡ ​በመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​የሐዩ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ኮ፡ ​ቀዳ​ሚ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ዘነ​ፍስ፡ ​ቀደ​መ፡ ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ዘመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቀዳ​ማዊ፡
                                    ብ  (fol. 15v)   (a)  ​እሲ፡ ​እም​ድር፡ ​መሬ​ታዊ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                   ​ወቀ​ኖቱ​ሰ፡ ​ለሞ​ት፡ ​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ወኃ​ይለ​ኒ፡   (fol. 16r)   (a)  
                                    ​ለኃ​ጢአ​ት፡ ​ኦሪት ፨ 
                                    ​ወለ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አኰ​ቴት፡ ​ዘወ​ሀበ​ነ፡ ​ንማ​ዕ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨ 
                                    ​ወይ​እዜ​ኒ፡ ​አኃ​ዊነ፡ ​ፍቁ​ራን፡ ​ኩኑ፡ ​ጽኑ​ዓነ፡ ​ወድ​ልዋ​ነ፡ ​ወኢ​ታን​ቀል​ቅሎ፡ ​እም​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​ወአ​ብዝ​ኁ፡ ​ገቢ​ረ፡
                                    ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ዘል​ፈ፡ ​ተአ​ምሩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢኮ​ነ፡ ​ለከ​ንቱ፡ ​ዘፃ​መው​ክሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእነ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​አም​ላኩ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e2927PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e2947LIT3509Epistle">
                  <fo:inline>II-10) Fols 16rb–16vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, incomplete, CAe 3509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​መል​እክ​ተ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ዘብ​ዴዎ ​ስ፡ ​ቀዳ​ማዊ፡ ​ንዜ​ንወ​ክሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                    ​ዘሀ​ሎ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዘሰ​ማዕ​ናሁ፡ ​ውእቱ ፤  ​ወር​ኢና​ሁ፡ ​በአ​ዕይ​ንቲ​ነ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                    ​ወዘ​ገሰ​ሰሁ፡ ​እደ​ዊነ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ትዓ​ውቀ​ት፡ ​ለነ ፨ 
                                    ​ወር​ኢና​ሁ፡ ​ወስ​ምዓ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ወን​ዜን​ወክ​ሙ፡ ​ንሕ​ነ፡ ​ሕይ​ወተ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ሀለ​ወት፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​አብ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወዘ​ንተ፡ ​ንጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትፍ​ሥሕ​ትነ፡ ​ፍጽ​ምተ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ብክሙ ፨ 
                                    ​ወዛ​ቲ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ዜና፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕና​ሃ፡ ​እም​ኔሁ፡ ​ወን​ዜን​ወክ​ሙ። ​ከመ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ውእቱ ፨ 
                                    ​ወጽ​ልመ​ትሰ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሁ፡ ​ወኢ​አሐ​ተኒ ፨  ​ወእ​መሰ፡ ​ንቤ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ብነ፡ ​ሱታ​ፌ፡
                                    ​ምስ​ሌሁ፡ ​ወው​ስተ፡ ​ጽል​መት፡ ​ነሐ​ውር፡ ​ንሔ​ሱ፡ ​ወኢ​ንገ​ብራ፡ ​ለጽ​ድቅ፡ ​ወለ​ርት​ዕ።
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    በ  (b)  ​ረከ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላኩ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​ለፍ​ቁሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e2990PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3010LIT1019Actsof">
                  <fo:inline>II-11) Fols 16vb–17vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Acts of the Apostles’ (ግብረ፡ ሐዋርያት፡), incomplete, CAe 1019.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወበ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​እሑ​ድ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ጉቡ​አን፡ ​ንሕ​ነ፡ ​ከመ፡  ​ንባ​ርክ፡ ​ማዕ​ደ፡ ​ወይ​ነግ​ሮሙ፡ ​ጳው​ሎስ፡ ​እስ​መ፡
                                    ​በሳ​ኒታ፡ ​ይገ​ይስ፡ ​ወአ​ንኃ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​መን​ፈቀ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​ወብ​ዙኀ፡ ​መኃ​ትው፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ጽር​ሕ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሀሎ​ነ፡
                                    ​ጉቡ​አን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወእ​ሴር​ሕ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ሕማ​ም፡ ​ወአ​ንብ​ዕ፡ ​በመ​ንሱ​ት፡ ​ዘረ​ከበ​ኒ፡ ​እም​አይ​ሁድ፡
                                    ​ወአ​ልቦ፡ ​ዘሰ​ወር​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘይ​ደል​ወክ​ሙ፡
                                    ዘ  (b)  ​ኢነ​ገር​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​ወዘ​ኢመ​ሐር​ኩክ​ሙ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​አሰ​ምዖ​ክሙ፡ ​ለአ​ይሁ​ድ፡ ​ክሡ​ተ፡ ​ወለ​አረ​ሚኒ፡ ​በአ​ፍአ​ኒ፡
                                    ​ወበ​ውሥ​ጥኒ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይነ​ስሑ፡ ​አው​ይት​ጋነ​ዩ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወከ​መ፡ ​ይእ​መኑ፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡
                                    ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በረ​ከቶ​ሙ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሮሙ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e3041PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3051LIT2715John">
                  <fo:inline>II-12) Fols 17vb–19rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Gospel of John (ብስራተ፡ ዮሐንስ፡), incomplete, CAe 2715.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወን​ጌል፡ ​ዘዮ​ሐን​ስ። ​ወሀ​ሎ፡ ፩ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ፈ ​ረሳ​ውያ​ን፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ኒቆ​ዲሞ​ስ፡ ​መል​አኮ​ሙ፡
                                    ​ለአ​ይሁ​ድ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​መጽ​አ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡
                                    ኢ  (fol. 18r)   (a)  ​የሱ​ስ፡ ​ሌሊተ ፨  ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡ ​ረቢ፡ ​ነአ​ምር፡
                                    ​ከመ፡ ​እም​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​መጻ​እከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትኩ​ን፡ ​መም​ህረ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​አል​ቦ፡ ​ዘይ​ክል፡
                                    ​ይግ​በር፡ ​መኑ​ሂ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ዘአ​ንተ፡ ​ትገ​ብር፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምስ​ሌሁ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወአ​ፍቀ​ሎ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ለዓ​ለም። ​ወአ​ብደ​ረ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ጽል​መተ፡ ​ፈድ​ፋደ፡ ​እም​ብር​ሃን፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​እኩ​ይ፡
                                    ​ምግባ  (b)  ​ሪሁ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘእ​ኩይ፡ ​ምግ​ባሩ፡ ​ይጸ​ልእ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ወኢ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ከመ፡
                                    ​ኢይ​ትከ​ሠቶ፡ ​ምግ​ባሩ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​እኩ​ይ፡ ​ውእቱ ፨  ​ወዘ​ሰ፡ ​ጽድ​ቀ፡ ​ይገ​ብር፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡
                                    ​ኀበ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያስ​ተር​ኢ፡ ​ምግ​ባሩ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይገ​ብር ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e3095PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፤
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3106LIT2384Taamme">
                  <fo:inline>III) Fols 21ra and following: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Miracles of Mary’ (ተአምረ፡ ማርያም፡), CAe 2384.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
                  <fo:inline>III-1) Fols 21ra–29rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Introductory texts and hymns to the Miracles of Mary</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3120LIT1968Mashaf">
                  <fo:inline>III-1-1) Fols 21ra–25vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Canon of al-Muʿallaqa (መጽሐፈ፡ ሥርዓት፡ ዘወጽአ፡ እመንበረ፡ ማርቆስ፡ ሐዋርያ፡ እመካነ፡ መዓልቃ፡ ), CAe 1968.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text does not correspond exactly to either the edition
                                    (<fo:basic-link internal-destination="bm_TasfaGiyorgis1956Taammera">
                        <fo:inline id="d1e3127bm_TasfaGiyorgis1956Taammera">
                           <inline xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Format">[Tasfā Gabra Śǝllāse] 1963</inline>,  15–20</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>)
                                    or the translation (<fo:basic-link internal-destination="bm_Budge1923Miracles">
                        <fo:inline id="d1e3132bm_Budge1923Miracles">
                           <inline xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Format">Budge 1923</inline>,  xlvi–liv</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>).
                                    While it corresponds to the more complete form of the text attested in <fo:basic-link internal-destination="bm_Budge1923Miracles">
                        <fo:inline id="d1e3137bm_Budge1923Miracles">
                           <inline xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Format">Budge 1923</inline>,  xlvi–liv</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>,
                                in the latter part of the work, there are several transpositions as compared to the translation.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                     (fol. 21r)   (a) 
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ፩ አ ​ምላ​ክ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፍ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡
                                    ​እም ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ያን​ብቡ፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በክ​ልኤ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ሥር​ዓት፡ ​ዘወ​ፅአ፡ ​እመ​ንበ​ረ፡ ​ማር​ቆስ፡ ​ሐዋ​ርያ፡ ​እመ​ካነ፡ ​መዓ​ልቃ፡ ​ዘም​ስር ፨ 
​ዘአ​ንበ​ሩ፡ ​መም​ህራ​ነ፡ ​ሊቃ​ነ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ክቡ​ራን፡ ​መጋ​ብያ ​ነ፡ ​ምሥ​ጢር፡ ​ርቱ​ዓነ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት። ​ትት​ናገሮ ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ኤ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                    አ  (b)  ​ምላ​ክ፡ ​ዘል​ፈ፡ ​ቦአ​መ፡ ​ትት​ናገ​ሮሙ፡ ​በሕል ​ም፡ ​ወቦ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ትት​ናገ​ሮሙ፡ ​በራ​እይ፡ ​ወቦ፡  ​አመ፡ ​ትት​ናገ​ሮሙ፡ ​በገ​ሃድ፡ ​እሉ፡ ​እሙ​ንቱ፡  ​አባ፡ ​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡ ​ወአ​ባ፡ ​ማቴ​ዎስ፡
                                    ​ወአ​ባ፡ ​ማር​ቆስ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወብ​ነሂ፡ ​በሰ​ይፈ፡ ​ቃል​ነ፡ ​አባ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ወአ​ባ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​ውቁ​ያነ፡ ​ወው​ጉዛ​ነ፡ ​ይኩኑ ፨ 
                                    ​እስ​መ፡ ​ንሕ​ነኒ፡ ​ነሣ​እነ፡ ​ሥል​ጣነ፡ ​ዚአ​ሆሙ ፨
                                     (b)   ​አው​ገዝ​ነ፡ ​ወአ​ሠር​ነ፡ ​በማ​ዕሠ​ር፡ ​ዘኢ​ይት​ፈታ​ሕ፡ ​ለዘ​ኢያ​ከብ​ር፡ ​በዓ​ላ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ከመ፡ ​እሑ​ድ፡ ​ሰን​በት፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​በስ​ብሐ​ቲሁ፡
                                    ​አሜን ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3227LIT3584Intro">
                  <fo:inline>III-1-2) Fols 25vb–27va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3584.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡
                                    ፩  ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ንነ​ግረ​ክሙ፡ ​አኃ​ዊነ፡ ​ፍቁ​ራን፡ ​ውሉ​ደ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ይባ​ርክሙ ፨ 
                                    ​ወያ​ብርዝ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​አዕ​ይን​ተ፡ ​አል​ባቢ​ክሙ፡
                                    ​ለሰ​ሚዓ፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ኤ፡
                                      (fol. 26r)   (a) 
                                    ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘበ​ዕብ​ራይ​ስጢ፡ ​ማሪ​ሃም፡ ​ጥዕ​ምተ፡ ​ስም፡ ​ውድ​ስተ፡ ​ስም፡ ​ቤዛ​ዊተ፡
                                    ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለም ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ተል​እክ​ዋ፡ ​ሠና​የ፡ ​መል​እክ​ተ፡ ​ተአ​መን​ዋ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ልብ​ክሙ፡ ​ወኢ​ትና​ፍቁ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትክሙ ፨ 
                                    ​ወቅ​ድመ፡ ​ሥዕ​ላ፡ ​ስግ​ዱ፡ ​ዘኢ​ሰገ​ደ፡ ​ላቲ፡ ​ይደ​ምሰ​ስ፡ ​እም​ቅዋሙ ፨  ​ወኢ​ይት​ዓወ​ቅ፡ ​ዝክ​ረ፡ ​ስሙ፡
                                    ​ወይ​በሉ፡ ​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​አሜን ፨  ​ወአ​ሜን ፨  ​ለይ​ኩን፡
                                    ​ለይ​ኩን፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3291LIT3058RepCh338">
                  <fo:inline>III-1-3) Fols 27va–28va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘I worship you, I worship you, I worship you and I praise you...’ (እሰግድ፡ ለኪ፡ እሰግድ፡ ለኪ፡ እሰግድ፡ ለኪ፡ ወእዌድሰኪ፡ ), CAe 3058.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ገቢ​ዓከ፡ ​በል።
                                      (b) 
                                    ​እሰ​ግድ፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ወእዌ ​ድሰ​ኪ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​የ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ወ ​ደሰ​ኪ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​አፈ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡
                                    ​በድ​ርሳ​ኑ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብል ፨  ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​የ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ዘተ​ሠገ​ወ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ወወ​ፅአ፡ ​እም​ከር​ሥኪ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​መር​ዓዊ፡
                                    ​ዘይ​ወፅ​እ፡ ​እም​ጽርሑ ፨  ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​የ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ዘወ​ፅአ፡ ​እም​ኔኪ፡ ​ኖላ​ዊ፡ ​ኄር፡ ​ዘበ​አማ​ን፡ ​ዘኃ​ሠሦ፡ ​ለበ​ግዕ፡ ​ግዱፍ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወተ​ሰመ​ይኪ፡ ​እመ፡ ​ወአ​መተ፡ ​በል​ደተ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨  ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​የ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ረከ​ብኪ፡ ​ሞገ​ሰ፡ ​በኀ​በ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​ጸል​ዪ፡ ​ወሰ​አሊ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡
                                    ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኃጣ​ውኢነ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3349LIT6024IntroMM">
                  <fo:inline>III-1-4) Fols 28va–29rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Introductory text and hymn to the Miracles of Mary, CAe 6024.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​በፈ​ቃደ፡ ​አቡ​ሁ፡ ​ወበ​ሥም​ረተ፡ ​ርእ​ሱ፡ አ ​መ፡ ​ርእ​ሶ፡ ​ይሰ​ቅል ፨ 
                                    ወ  (b)  ​አመ፡ ​ተዓ​ገሠ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ሐፃ​ውን​ተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​መስ​ቀል ፨  ​ሶበ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕኪ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ዘነ​ገሩ​ኪ፡ ​በቃ​ል። ​ዘው​ኅዘ፡ ​እም​አዕ​ይን<fo:inline>ት (!)</fo:inline>​ኪ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ውኂ​ዘ፡ ​ማይ፡ ​ዘይ​ፈለ​ፍል ፨ 
                                    ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ንዒ፡ ​በም​ሕረ​ት፡ ​ወሣ​ህል ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​እን​በለ፡ ​ሰብሳ ​ብ፡ ​ወሩ​ካቤ፡ ​በል ፨ 
                                    ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ኆኅ​ተ፡ ​ምሥ​ራቅ፡ ​ዘወ​ልደ፡ ​ኖሬ፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ዓፀ​ድ፡ ​ዘኤ​ስኬ​ድሬ ፨ 
                                    ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ሥር​ጉት፡ ​በወ​ራውሬ ፨
                                    <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline> ​እን​ተ፡ ​ወለ​ድኪ፡ ​ፈጣሬ ፨
                                    <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline> ​ዘም​ስለ፡ ​ዝማሬ ፨ 
                                    ​ንሰ​ግድ፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ለለ​ይት​ነበ​ብ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ተአ​ምር​ኪ፡ ​በሰ​ላም፡ ​ኪያ​ነ፡
                                    ​ባርኪ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3429LIT5673AkkonuColl">
                  <fo:inline>III-2) Fols 30ra–79vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3437LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl1">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-1) Fols 30ra–33vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3445LIT3586Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-1-1) Fols 30ra–33vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3586.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                         (fol. 30r)   (a) 
                                        ​በስ​መ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ ​ስ፡ ፩ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                        ቅ ​ድስ​ት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡  ​አም​ላክ፡  ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡
                                        ​ወም​ሕረተ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e3465PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን። 
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶ​ስ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡
                                        አ ​ሐቲ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዘሀ​ገረ፡ ​ጥልጥ ​ልያ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ደቅ​ስዮስ ፨  ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                        ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ጻድ​ቅ፡ ​ወኄር<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወፈ​ራሂ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዚአብ  (b)  ​ሔር፡ ​ወያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​እማ​ዕም​ቀ፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪x
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ፈድ​ፋደ፡  ​ወኢ​ያጸ​ርዕ፡ ​እም​አፉ፡ ​ዘክ​ሮ፡ ​ስማ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ገነ​ዩ፡ ​ወሰ​ገዱ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መር​ጡላ፡ ​በፍ​ርሃ​ት፡ ​ወበ​ረዓ​ድ፡ ​ወአ​ብደ​ሩ፡ ​ተቀ​ንዮ​ታ፡ ​እም​አእ​ላፍ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ወብ​ሩር ፨ 
                                        ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘር​እዩ፡ ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ወመ​ንክ​ረ፡ ​ዐቢ​የ፡ ​ወመ​ደን​ግፀ፡ ​ጥቀ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶስ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ሰአ​ልዎ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትሰ​ሃሎ​ሙ፡
                                        ​ወት​ሥረ​ይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አቶሙ ፨  ​ወአ​ክበ​ርዋ፡ ​ፈድ​ፋደ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e3526PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ  (b)  ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                            ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3544LIT5052SobaAshafa">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-1-2) Fol. 33vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘’ (ሶበ፡ አጽሐፈ፡ ደቅስዮስ፡ ተአምርኪ፡ ቅዱሰ፡), CAe 5052.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3554LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl2">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-2) Fols 33vb–37ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3562LIT3622Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-2-1) Fols 33vb–36vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3622.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                            ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡
                                            ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e3578PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡   (b)   ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                                ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ስም​ዑ፡ ​አበ​ውየ፡ ​ወአ​ኃው​የ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ንን​ግር​ክሙ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​በእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘነ​ገሩ​ነ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ሰማ​ዕት​የ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ወስ​ኩ፡
                                        ​ወኢ​ይነ​ትግ ፨ 
                                        ​ወይ​ቤሉ፡ ​ነበ​ረ፡ ​በም​ድረ፡ ​ሶር​ያ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ለብ​ሐዊ፡ ​ፈራ​ሄ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም  (b)  ​ላክ፡ ​እማ​ዕም​ቀ፡ ​ልቡ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወዘ​ንተ፡ ​ብሂ​ላ፡ ​ዓር​ገት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​በዓ​ቢይ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት ፨  ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅረ​ዝ፡
                                        ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለብ​ሐዊ፡ ​ወቦ​አ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨  ​ወኮ​ነ፡
                                        ​ሎቱ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አሰ​ፈወ​ቶ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከታ ፨  ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e3628PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                            ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3641LIT5885HymnMary">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-2-2) Fol. 36vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Oh my lady Mary, chalice of divine understanding’ (ኦእግዝእትየ፡ ማርያም፡ ጽዋዐ፡ ልቡና፡ መለኮታዊ።), CAe 5885.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3651LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza1">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-2-3) Fols 36vb–37ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3662LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl2">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-3) Fols 37ra–38ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3670LIT3588Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-3-1) Fols 37ra–37vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Mary: Miracle of a picture of Mary speaking to a worker, CAe 3588.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ፫ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                            ​ቅድ​ስት።  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በክ​ልኤ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብራ ፨
                                                <fo:inline id="d1e3692PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                                ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡ ፩ ​ገባ​ራዊ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ያወ​ትር፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ሰላ​መ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ወ  (b)  ​ይዌ​ድሳ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ሰር​ከ፡ ​ወነ​ግሀ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ቀ፡ ​መዓ​ልተ፡ ​ወነ​በረ ፨ 
                                        ​ከመ​ዝ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይኤ​ምኀ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ይቤ​ላ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​የ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወነ​ስሐ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘተ  (b)  ​ናገ​ራ፡ ​ወበ​እን​ተ፡ ​ድፍ​ረቱ ፨  ​ወባ​ሕቱ፡ ​ኮነ፡
                                        ​ያፈ​ቅራ፡ ​እም​ቀዲ​ሙ፡ ​ወወ​ሰከ፡ ​ዲበ ፨  ​መል​እክ​ታ፡ ​ፈድ​ፋደ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​አመ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡
                                        ​ወፈ​ለሰ፡ ​እም​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ኃላፊ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብራ ፤
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e3736PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                            ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3746LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza2">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-3-2) Fols 37ra–38ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3756LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl3">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-4) Fols 38ra–39rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3764LIT3589Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-4-1) Fols 38ra–39rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3589.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                            ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪፡ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡  ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e3780PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡ ፩ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዕብ​ራዊ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​አክ​ሚም፡ ​ዘያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ። ​እም​ሥር​ወ፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​ወኢ​ያጸ​ርዕ፡ ​እም​አፉ​ሁ፡   (b)   ​ዝክ​ረ፡ ​ስማ፡ ​በፍ​ርሃ​ት፡ ​ወበ​ረዓድ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ይሰ​ግድ፡ ​ላቲ፡ ​የኤ​ምኅ፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ክብ​ረ፡ ​ስማ ፨  ​ወካ​ህን። ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወይ​ትለ​አክ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን።
                                        ​በን​ጽሕ፡ ​ወበ​ቅድ​ስና፡ ​በጊ​ዜ፡ ​ዕጣ​ን፡ ​ወቍ​ርባን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ወሬ​ዛ፡ ​ኃያ​ለ፡ ​ወነ​በረ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይት​ለአ​ክ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያና፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወቱ፡ ​ወወ​ሰከ​ቶ፡ ​በዲ​በ፡ ​ዓመ​ታቲ​ሁ፡  ፻ ወ ፴  ​ዓመተ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ውቱ፡  ​፪፻ ወ ፴  ​ዓመት ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​ወፈ​ለሰ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡
                                        ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ዘለ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e3840PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ  (b)  ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3855LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza3">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-4-2) Fol. 39rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3865LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl4">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-5) Fols 39rb–40va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3873LIT3590Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-5-1) Fols 39rb–40va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The pious monk scribe who used to write St Mary's name in golden ink, CAe 3590.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ፭ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                            ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ድ ​ንግ​ል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                        ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡   (fol. 39v)   (a) 
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e3899PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​መነ​ኮስ፡ ​ዘይ​ነብ​ር፡ ​በደ​ብረ፡ ​ፊል​ጵስ​ዩስ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ድም​ያኖስ ፨ 
                                        ​ወያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​እም​ስር​ወ፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​ወይ​ትለ​አካ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ክሂ​ሎቱ ፨  ​ወይ​ትግ​ህ፡ ​መዓ​ልተ፡ ​ወሌ​ሊተ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡
                                        ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያና፡ ​ወጸ​ሐፌ፡ ​መጻ​ሕፍ​ት፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​መነ​ኮስ። ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ይ  (b)  ​ዜክ​ር፡ ​ስማ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዝ<fo:inline>[እ]</fo:inline>​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኢ​ይጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​በማ​የ፡ ​ሕመ​ት፡ ​አላ፡ ​ይጽ​ሕፍ፡ ​በቀ​ለመ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ወበ​ብሩ​ር፡ ​ወና​ዝረ፡ ​ወርድ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወይ​እዜ​ኒ፡ ​ነዓ፡ ​ምስ​ሌየ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አር​ኢከ፡ ​ስመ​ከ፡ ​ዘል​ኩዕ፡ ​ወሥ​ርግ​ው፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​አም​ደ፡ ​ወር​ቅ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨ 
                                        ​ኢት​ፍራ​ህ፡ ​መዊ​ተ፡ ​በዝ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ሐላፊ ፨ 
                                        ​ናሁ፡ ​አነ፡ ​እሁ​በከ፡ ​ሕይ​ወተ፡ ​ዘለ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ወፍ​ሥሐ፡ ​ዘኢየ  (b)  ​ኃልቅ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡
                                        ​ትቤ​ሎ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ወጽ​አት፡ ​ነፍ​ሱ፡ ​እም​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ወእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ፃዕ​ር፡ ​ወሕ​ማም፡ ​በሰ​ላም፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e3973PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ።</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3986LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza4">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-5-2) Fols 39rb–40va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e3996LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl5">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-6) Fols 40va–41vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4004LIT3591Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-6-1) Fols 40va–41vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The Muslim whom St Mary told to receive baptism; later, as bishop of Rome, he cut off his hand because of a carnal thought, CAe 3591.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                            ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                        ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e4022PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​እም​ጳጳ​ሳተ፡ ​ሮሜ፡ ​ዘይ​ብል​ዎ፡ ​አባ​ስ፡ ​ወኄ​ር፡ ​ብእ​ሲሁ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወፈ​ርሆ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡
                                        ​ወየ​ዓቅ​ብ፡ ​ነፍ​ሶ፡ ​እምዝ  (b)  ​ሙት፡ ​ወእ​ምሕ​ሊና፡ ​እኩይ ፨  ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​እም​በዓ​ላት፡
                                        ​ቀደ​ሰ፡ ​ቅዳ​ሴሃ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይመ​ጡ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ፡ ​እም​ሥጢ​ር፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨  ​ወል​ማይ​ሙ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ፡ ​ዕድ፡ ​ወአ​ንስ​ት፡ ​ጊዜ፡
                                        ​ይት​ሜጠ​ው፡ ​እም​ሥጢ​ር፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ይሰ​ግዱ፡ ​ወይ​ኤም​ኁ፡ ​እደ​ዊሁ፡ ​ወእ​ገሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለካ​ህን፡ ​ዘያ​ዌር​ቦሙ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወነ​ሥአ​ት፡ ​እዴ​ሁ፡ ​ምቱ​ረ፡ ​በእ​ዴሃ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ጣግ​ዓት፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ተመ​ትረ፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ሕያ​ወ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ቀዳ​ሚ፡ ​ወኢ​ተረ​ክበ፡
                                        ​አሰ​ረ፡ ​ምት  (fol. 41v)   (a)  ​ረቱ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ተሠ​ወረ​ት፡ ​እም​ኔሁ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​ቀሳ​ውስ​ት፡ ​ወዲ​ያቆ​ናት፡ ​አን​ከሩ፡ ​ወተ​ደሙ፡ ​ወዜ​ነው፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወአ​እኰ​ትዋ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ከሃ​ሊት፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ገቢ​ረ፡
                                        ​ተአ​ምራ​ት፡ ​ወመ​ንክ​ራት ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብራ ፨
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4077PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ።</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4090LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza5">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-6-2) Fols 41va–41vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4100LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl6">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-7) Fols 41vb–43rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4108LIT3592Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-7-1) Fols 41vb–43ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3592.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ<fo:inline>[ት]</fo:inline>​ነ፡
                                            ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                        ​አም​ላክ፡
                                         ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e4124PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​መነ​ኮስ፡ ኄ  (fol. 42r)   (a)  ​ር፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ይስ​ሐቅ፡ ​ወያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ኃይ​ሉ፡ ​ወእ​ምን​ዕሱ፡ ​ነበ​ረ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ደብ​ር፡ ​በመ​ዋዕ​ሊሁ፡ ​ለአ​ባ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ዘሀ​ገረ፡
                                        ​እስ​ክን​ድር​ያ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ዓቃ​ቤ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን ፨  ​ወመ​ራኁ​ትኒ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​እዴሁ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​ዓ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ወር​እየ፡ ​ስና፡ ​ዘክ​ሉል፡ ​በግ​ርማ፡ ​ወበ​ብር​ሃን ፨  ​ወድ​ቀ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡
                                        ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ከመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​በድ​ን፡ ​ወይ​እቲ​ሰ፡ ​አኃ​ዘቶ፡   (fol. 43r)   (a)   ​በእ​ዴሃ፡ ​ወነ​ሥአ​ቶ፡ ​ወተ​ሠወ​ረት፡ ​እም​ኔሁ ፨ 
                                        ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሥዕ​ል፡ ​ዘሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​ቅድ​ሜሁ፡ ​ወበ​ጊዜ​ሃ፡ ​ሖረ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​በዓቱ ፨  ​ወአ​ኀዘ፡ ​ሕማ​መ፡ ​ፈጸ​ንት፡ ​ወበ​ተፍ​ጻሜ​ተ፡
                                         ፫  ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ ፨  ​በከ​መ፡ ​አሰ​ፈወ​ቶ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብራ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        <fo:inline id="d1e4194PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4207LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza6">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-7-2) Fols 43ra–43rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4217LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl7">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-8) Fols 43rb–44va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4225LIT3593Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-8-1) Fols 43rb–44va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Mary: Miracle of the young girl called Mary, from Dafrā Māryām from Dǝfrā, a child who wanted to receive Communion, but was shut up in the
            house when her family went to church, CAe 3593.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ ወ ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                         ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፤ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e4241PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን። 

                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ፈራ​ሄ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ዘያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡

                                        ድ  (fol. 43v)   (a)  ​ንግ​ል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወሀ​ገሩ​ሰ፡ ​ድፍ​ራ፡ ​ወአ​ውሰ​በ፡ ​ብእ​ሲተ፡ ​ወወ​ለደ፡ ​እም​ኔሃ፡
                                         ፫  ​ውሉ​ደ፡  ፪  ​ተባ​ዕተ፡ ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ወለተ ፨ 
                                        ​ወይ​እቲ፡ ​ትን​ዕስ፡ ​ወስ​ማ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወሞ​ተት፡ ​እሞ​ሙ፡ ​ወነ​በሩ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​የኀ​ዝኑ፡ ​ወበ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ዘው​እቱ፡ ​በዓ​ለ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡ ​ዘእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ፈቀ​ዱ፡ ​ይሑ​ሩ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወት​ቤላ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡  ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡
                                         ፫  ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​እነ​ሥአ​ኪ፡ ​ምስ​ሌየ፡ ​ወት​ነብ​ሪ፡ ​ኀቤ​የ፡ ​ወት​ረ፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​ወአ​ዕረ​ፈት፡ ​አመ፡ ​ሣል​ስት፡
                                        ​ዕለት ፨ 
                                        ወ ፩  ​መም​ህር፡ ​ርእ​ያ፡ ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ወለ​ት፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትለ​ብስ ፨  ​ሜላተ ፨ 
                                        ​ወት​ተል​ዋ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ወመ  (fol. 44v)   (a)  ​ድኀ​ኒት ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4323PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4336LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza7">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-8-2) Fol. 44va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4347LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl8">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-9) Fols 44va–46rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4355LIT3594Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-9-1) Fols 44va–46ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3594.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድን​ግል፡  ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ ወ  (b)  ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e4375PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ሠዓ​ሊ፡ ​ወአ​ልቦ፡ ​ዘይ​ትማ​ሰሎ፡ ​ለገ​ቢረ፡ ​ሥዕ​ል፡ ​በው​እቱ፡ ​አዝ​ማን ፨ 
                                        ​ወያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                        ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ይገ​ብር፡ ​ሥዕ​ለ፡ ​ይሥ​ዕል፡ ​በተ​ጠና​ቅቆ፡ ​ወበ​ብዝ​ኅ፡ ​ጻሕቅ ፨  ​ወበ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​አፍ​ራን​ሳ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ሥዕ​ለ፡ ለ  (fol. 45r)   (a)  ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                        ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወር​እዮ​ሙ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​መን​ክረ፡ ​ወደ​ስዋ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                        ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሉ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡
                                        ​ከር​ስኪ፡ ​ወገ​ብሩ፡ ​በዓ​ለ፡ ​ሰብ​ዓ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሰ​መይ​ዋ፡ ​ለይ  (fol. 46r)   (a)  ​እቲ፡ ​ሥዕ​ል፡ ​ሥዕ​ለ፡ ​አድ​ኅኖ፡ ​ወአ​ልዕ​ሎ፡ ​እም​ድቀት ፨ 
                                        ​ወይ​እቲ፡ ​ሥዕ​ል፡ ​ሀለ​ወት፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ዮም፡ ​ስፍ​ሕተ፡
                                        ​እድ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​አሜ​ሃ፡ ​አኃ​ዘቶ፡ ​ለው​እቱ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ሠዓ​ሊ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ተዝ​ካረ፡ ​ለዘ፡ ​ይመ​ጽእ፡ ​ትው​ልድ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ወፍ​ቁር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4444PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4457LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza8">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-9-2) Fols 46ra–46rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4467LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl9">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-10) Fols 46rb–47ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4475LIT3595Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-10-1) Fols 46rb–47ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3595.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድን ​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                         ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ። ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e4491PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​ሥዕ​ላ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​ሕሙ​ማን፡ ​መን​ገለ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>  (fol. 46v)   (a)  ​ምሥ​ራቅ፡
                                        ​ዘለ​ለጽ​ባሑ፡ ​ይት​መኀ​ፀኑ፡ ​ባቲ፡ ​ሕሙ​ማን፡ ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ሕሙ​ም፡ ​ህየ፡ ​ዘነ​በረ፡ ​ጕን​ዱየ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​በሕ​ማሙ፡
                                        ​ወዘ​ልፈ፡ ​ይስ​እላ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወአ​ብጽ​ሐቶ፡ ​ካዕ​በ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ዮር​ዳኖ​ስ፡ ​ወአ​ጥመ​ቀቶ፡ ​ወአ​ዕረ​ገቶ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ዘይ​ት፡ ​ወኀ​በ፡ ​ወደ​ብረ፡ ​ጽዮ​ን፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ኀደ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አር​ዳኢሁ ፨ 
                                        ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​ኢት​ኅዝ​ን፡ ​ነዋ፡
                                        ​ፈጸ {ም} ​ኩ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ኵሎ፡
                                        ዘ {​ሰአ} ​ልከኒ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                         (fol. 47r)   (a)  ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅረ፡ ​በዐ​ለ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡ ​እነ​ሥአ​ከ፡ ​ኀቤየ ፨  ​ወተ​ፈሥ​ሐ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ሕሙ​ም፡ ​ወአ​ዕረ​ፈ፡ ​በሠ​ናይ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4564PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4577LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza9">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-10-2) Fol. 47ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4587LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl10">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-11) Fols 47rb–49rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4595LIT3596Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-11-1) Fols 47rb–49rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Mary: Miracle of the youth Zechariah, from Rome The young man who used to bring roses to the icon of St Mary The Virgin Mary and the youth Zachary (Zakāryās), CAe 3596.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e4614PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ወሬ​ዛ፡ ​ዘሠ​ናይ፡ ​አር​አያ​ሁ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​እም​ዘመ​ደ፡ ​ነገ​ሥት፡ ​ዘሀ​ገረ፡ ​ሮሜ ፨ 
                                        ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ቦአ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይጸሊ ፨  ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ነጸ​ረ፡ ​ሥዕ​ላ፡ ​ለእ​ግእ​ትነ፡
                                        ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ  (fol. 47v)   (a)  ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወአ​ደመ​ቶ፡ ​ፈድ​ፋደ፡ ​ወው​ዕየ፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​በፍ​ቅረ፡ ​ዚአ​ሃ፡
                                        ​ወሐ​ለየ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ምን​ተ፡ ​አም​ኃ፡ ​እሁ​ባ፡ ​ላቲ፡ ​ዘያ​ሠምራ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ትለ​አክ፡ ​ለእ​ግእ​ትነ፡
                                        ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወትየ ፨  ​ወከ​ማሁ፡ ​ይቤ​ሉ፡ ​ፈያ​ት፡
                                        ​ወአ​ስተ​ፋነ​ውዎ፡ ​ለዘ​ካር​ያስ፡ ​ወሖ​ረ፡ ​በሰ​ላም ፨  ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅረ​ዝ፡ ​ነስ​ሑ፡ ​እሙ​ንቱ፡ ​ፈያ​ት፡ ​ወኮ​ኑ፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ተ፡ ​ወተ​ልእ​ክዋ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎታ ፨  ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ  (b)  ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4692PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4705LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza10">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-11-2) Fol. 49rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4715LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl11">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-12) Fols 49rb–50rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4723LIT3597Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-12-1) Fols 49rb–50rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The two women who were attacked by robbers on their way to church, CAe 3597.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም  (fol. 49v)   (a)  ​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e4745PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ለዋ፡ ​ክል​ኤቲ፡ ​አን​ስት፡ ​አዕ​ማተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​ልሔ​ም፡ ​እም​አዋ​ልደ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ፡ ​ለአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ስማ፡ ​ዮል​ያና። ​ወስ​ማ፡ ​ለካ​ልዕ​ታ፡ ​በር​ባራ ፨ 
                                        ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይሐ​ውራ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ይስ​ግዱ፡ ​ለበ​ዓለ፡ ​ፍል​ሰታ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማርያ  (b)  ም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ሮስ​ማዱ​ር፡ ​ዓገ​ትዎ​ን፡ ​ፈያ​ት፡ ​ወነ​ሥኡ፡ ​ስን​ቆን ፨
                                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወቦ​አ፡ ​ፍር​ሃት፡ ​ወረ​ዓድ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አል​ባቢ​ሆሙ፡ ​እም​ድን​ጋፄ፡ ​ግር​ማሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                        ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ወወ​ሀብ​ዎን፡ ​ለዮ​ልያ​ና፡ ​ወለ​በር​ባራ፡ ​ንዋ​የ፡ ​ፍዳ፡ ​ምክ​ዕቢ​ተ፡ ​ህየ​ንተ፡ ​ዘነ​ሥኡ፡ ​ስን​ቆን፡ ​መሐ​ከቶ​ሙ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​መዝ​ገበ፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡ ​ወሚ​ጠት፡ ​አስ​ናኒ​ሆሙ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ህላ​ዌሆ​ሙ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ  (b)  ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4804PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4817LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza11">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-12-2) Fol. 50rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4827LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl12">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-13) Fols 50rb–51vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4835LIT3598Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-13-1) Fols 50rb–51va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3598.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡   (fol. 50v)   (a)   ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                            ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                            <fo:inline id="d1e4857PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ 
                                        ​ወበ ፩  ​እመ​ዋዕ​ል፡ ​ሖሩ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ሪፍ፡  ፫  ​ሰብ​እ፡
                                        ​ዓራ​ባው​ያን፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ምሉ​ዕ፡ ​ማየ፡ ​ተከ​ዚ፡ ​ጥቀ ፨  ​ወመ​ዋግ​ዲሁ፡ ​ያመ​ዓብ​ል፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ተከ​ዚ፡ ​ቦኡ፡
                                        ​ይጽ​ብቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ዲው፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይፈ​ጽሙ፡ ​መፍ​ቅዶ​ሙ፡ ​ወጸ​ንዓ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡ ​ማዕ​በል ፤ 
                                        ​ወስ​ዕኑ፡ ​ጸቢ​ተ፡ ​ወፈ​ቀደ፡ ​ያስ​ጥሞሙ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወኀ​በ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ት፡ ​ወነ​ገሮ​ሙ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ። ​ወቢ​ጹሰ፡ ​ቦቱ፡ ​ብዙ​ኅ፡ ​አባ​ግዕ፡ ​ወቀ​ረጸ፡ ​ፀጕ​ሮሙ፡ ​ዘአ​ብጽ​ሐ፡
                                        ኀ  (fol. 51v)   (a)  ​በ፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ት፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ንሥ​ኡ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ፀም​ረ፡ ​ወግ​በሩ፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​አል​ባሰ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡  ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ዘ፡ ​አድ​ኃነ​ተኒ፡ ​እም​ተሰ​ጥሞ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​ዑ፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ት፡ ​ነገ​ሮ፡ ​ስብ​ሕዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወወ​ደስ​ዋ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​መስ​ተ፡ ​ሣህ​ልት፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከታ ፨  ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4915PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4928LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza12">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-13-2) Fols 51va–51vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4938LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl13">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-14) Fols 51vb–53ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e4946LIT3599Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-14-1) Fols 51vb–52vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3599.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e4965PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ደብ​ር፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ጽር​ዕ፡   (fol. 52r)   (a)  
                                        ​ወኑ​ኁ፡ ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​መን​ፈቀ፡ ​ምዕ​ራፍ ፨  ​እም​ኢያ​ሪኮ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​ህየ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዘሕ​ንጽ​ት፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ወነ​በረ​ት፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትነ​ግሮ፡ ለ ፩  ​ቀሲ​ስ፡
                                        ​በሕ​ልም ፨  ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​ሕን​ጽ፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​በጽ​ንፈ፡ ​ኢያ​ሪኮ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወደ​ንገ​ፁ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​ድን​ጋፄ፡ ​ወለ​አኩ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ዓበ​ይተ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡ ​ተባ​ዕቶ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ንስ​ቶሙ፡ ​ወአ​ንከ​ሩ፡ ​ርእ​ዮሙ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡
                                        ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ዘኢ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​ወኢ​ሰምዑ ፨ 
                                        ​ወገ​ብሩ፡ ​በዓ​ለ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​በገ​ቢረ፡ ​ቍር​ባን፡ ​ወበ​ውሂ​በ፡ ​ምጽ​ዋት፡ ​በበ​ዓመ​ት፡ ​አመ፡
                                         ፳ ወ ፫  ​ለነ​ሐሲ፡  ​ወስ​መ፡
                                          (b)  
                                        ​ደብ​ሩሰ፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ዕቆ​ና፡ ​ወዝ​ንቱ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ተገ​ብረ፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ወላ​ዲቱ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5039PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5052LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza13">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-14-2) Fols 52vb–53ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5063LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl14">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-15) Fols 53ra–54va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5071LIT3600Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-15-1) Fols 53ra–54va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3600.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5087PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ቀሲ​ስ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ምስ​ር፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​በከ​ንሲ ፨ 
                                        ​ወይ​ነብ​ር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዘሕ​ንጽ​ት፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕት፡ ​መር​ቆሬ​ዎስ፡ ​ወዝ​ንቱ​ሰ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ኮነ፡
                                        ​መዋ​ዕሊ  (b)  ​ሁ፡  ፪  ​ዓመ​ተ፡ ​ዖራ፡  ፪ ​ሆን፡
                                        ​አዕ​ይን​ቲሁ፡ ​ወነ​በረ፡ ​ዓመ​የ፡ ​ፍጹ​መ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡
                                         ኢ ​ይሬኢ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ኃጥ​አ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ለአ​ዕይ​ንቲ​ሁ፡
                                        ​ወጠ​ነ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይግ​በር፡ ​ምህ​ላ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ኢየ​አም​ሮ፡  ፩ ፡ ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ቤተ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ሥዕ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪  ​ማር​ያም፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                       
                                        ​ወአ​ሠረ፡ ​ሀሊ​ብኒ፡ ​ውስ​ቴቶ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ንበ​ሩ፡ ​እደ​ዊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ቲሁ፡ ​ወተ​አምኁ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሖ​ሩ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሥዕ​ላ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                          (b)  
                                        ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                        ​አም​ላክ። ​ወሰ​ገዱ ፨  ​ላቲ፡  ​፩፩  ​አም​ጣነ፡ ​ክሂ​ሎቶ​ሙ፡
                                        ​ወቀ​ደሰ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ቀሲ​ስ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ ፤  ​በይ​እቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ወመ​ጠዎ​ሙ፡ ​እም​ሥጢ​ሩ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኔ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ለመ​ነኮ​ሳት ፨  ​ወነ​በረ፡ ​እም​ድኅረ ፡  ​ዝ፡  ፳  ​ዓመ​ተ፡
                                        ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይት​ለአ​ክ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​አእ​ረፈ፡ ​በሰ​ላም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5174PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                        <fo:inline>ኪዳነ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡   (fol. 54v)   (a)  
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5193LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza14">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-15-2) Fol. 54va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5203LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl15">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-16) Fols 54va–55vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5211LIT3601Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-16-1) Fols 54va–55vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3601.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                         ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                            ​ወላዲ ​ተ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብራ ፨
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5233PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ባዕ  (b)  ​ል፡ ​በደ​ሴተ፡ ​ቌላ​ስይ​ስ፡ ​ባዕ​ል፡ ​ጥቀ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሖ​ረ፡ ​ትር​ኵ፡ ​በሐ​መር፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይጽ​ብዖ​ሙ፡ ​ሰቍ​ዝ። ​ወተ​ራከ​ብዎ፡ ​በጽ​ንፈ፡ ​ባሕ​ር፡ ​ወነ​ደፍ​ዎ፡
                                        በ ፲ ወ ፩  ​አሕ​ፃ፡
                                        ​ወእ ም ​ሕፃ​ሰ፡  ፩  ​እም​ኔሆ​ሙ፡ ​ነደ​ፎ፡ ​ዓይ​ኖ፡ ​ወአ​ልጸ​ቀ፡
                                        ​ለመ​ዊት፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ፅቡረ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ይቤ​ሎሙ፡ ​ለሰ​ብኡ፡ ​አዕ​ትው​ኒ፡ ​ቤት​የ፡ ​ወአ​ተው​ዎ፡ ​ቤቶ፡
                                        ​ወአ​ሕፃ​ሰ፡  ፫  ​ዘው​ስተ፡ ​ዓይ​ኑ፡ ​ወሥ​ጋሁ፡ ​ወጽ​ኡ፡ ወ ፩  ​ዘው​ስተ፡
                                        ​ዓይ​ኑ፡ ​ኢወ​ጽአ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወገ​ብረ፡ ​ምጽ​ዋተ፡ ​በዙ​ኃ፡ ​ለነ​ዳያ​ን፡ ​ወለ​ምስ​ኪና​ን፡ ​ወለ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወኀ​ቤሃ ፨  ​ዘይ​ደሉ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​የት፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>​ብዓ​ተ፡ ​ልቡ፡ ​ተመ​ልሐ፡ ​ሐፅ፡ ​እም​ዓይ​ኑ፡ ​ወእ​ምዓ​ይነ፡ ​ምስ​ል፡ ​ዘሰ​ምዕ፡ ​በአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ሌሊት ፨ 
                                        ​ወገ​ብአ​ት፡ ​ዓይ​ኑ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ካል​ዕታ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡ ​ዓይ​ነ፡ ​ሥዕ​ል፡ ​አን​ከሩ፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዝእ  (b)  ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5323PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5338LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza15">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-16-2) Fol. 55vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5348LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl16">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-17) Fols 56ra–58ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5356LIT3602Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-17-1) Fols 56ra–57vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3602.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን ​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                            ወ ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5375PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ጽዒ​ድ፡ ​ዘት​ሰመ​ይ፡ ​በድ​ርማ​ን፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​አብ​ርሃ​ም፡ ​ወስ​መ፡ ​ብእ​ሲቱ፡ ​ጌራ፡
                                        ​አን​ስት ፨  ​ብዑ​ላን፡ ​ጥቀ፡ ​በን​ዋይ፡ ​ወፍ​ጹማ​ን፡ ​በም​ግባ​ረ፡ ​ሠናይ ፨ 
                                        ​ወቦ​ሙ፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ወለ​ት፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ስማ፡ ​ኤል​ሳቤ​ጥ፡ ​ወዘ​እን​በሌ​ሃሰ፡ ​አል​ቦሙ፡   (b)  
                                        ​ውሉድ ፨  ​ወይ​እቲ​ሰ፡ ​ወለ​ት፡ ​ሐመ​ት፡ ​በሕ​ማመ፡ ​በደ​ደ፡ ​ዘው​እቱ፡ ​ፈን​ፃፃ፡
                                        ​ወዖ​ራ፡  ፪ ​ሆን፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ቲሃ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​አቡ​ሃ፡ ​ወእ​ማ፡ ​ዑረ​ተ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ቲሃ፡ ​ለወ​ለቶ​ሙ፡ ​ኀዘ​ኑ፡ ​መሪ​ረ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ኃደ​ገ፡ ​ሐቢ​ዘ፡ ​ቍር​ባን፡ ​ወወ​ጽአ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሃ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ይር​አይ፡ ​ወረ​ከባ፡ ​ለወ​ለት፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​እማ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትሬኢ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​አን​ከረ፡ ​ወተ​ደመ፡ ​ወአ​እኰ​ቶ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ልዑ​ል፡ ​ወለ​ወላ​ዲቱ፡ ​ድን​ግል ፨ 
                                        ​ወጸ​ቢሖ፡ ​ተጋ​ብኡ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወነ​ጸሩ፡ ​ዘን  (b)  ​ተ፡
                                        ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ወአ​እኰ​ትዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፤  ​ወወ​ደስ​ዋ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5439PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5452LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza16">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-17-2) Fols 57vb–58ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5462LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl17">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-18) Fols 58ra–59va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5470LIT3603Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-18-1) Fols 58ra–59rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3603.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ማር​ያም። 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5486PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀለ ወ ​ት፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ነዳ​ይት፡ ​ዘሞ​ተ፡ ​ምታ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኃ​ደገ። ​ሠላ​ሰ፡ ​አዋ​ልደ፡ ​ለአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ስማ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወለ​ካል​ዕታ፡ ​ማር​ታ፡ ​ወለ​ሣል​ሲት፡ ​የዋ​ሒት ፨ 
                                        ​ወእ​ሞን​ሰ፡ ​ነዳ​ይት፡ ​ጥቀ፡
                                        ወ  (b)  ​አል​ባቲ፡ ​ሲሳ​የ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ዘት​ትመ​ጸወ​ት፡ ​እም​ሰብእ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ልህ​ቃ፡
                                        ​አዋ​ልዲ​ሃ፡ ​ወበ​ጽሐ፡ ​ለተ​ወሰ​ቦ፡ ​ኢፈ​ቀደ፡  ፩  ​እም​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ያው​ስቦ​ን፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡
                                        ​ንዴ​ቶን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በራ​እይ፡ ​ወአ​እኰ​ትዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወለ​ወላ​ዲቱ፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ተን​ባሊ​ት፡ ​ለው​ሉደ፡
                                        ​ሰብእ ፨  ​ወቀ​በር​ዋ፡ ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ወለ​ት፡ ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅረ፡ ​ንስ​ቲት፡ ​መዋ​ዕል፡ ​መጽ​አ፡ ​ቴዎ​ግ፡
                                        ​ፀራቢ ፨ 
                                        ​ወነ​ሥኦ​ን፡ ​ለእ​ላን​ቱ፡  ፪  (b)  ​ቲ፡ ​አዋ​ልዲ​ሃ፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ዋሰ​ቦን፡
                                        ​ለው​ሉዱ ፨  ​ወዝ​ንቱ፡ ​ፀራ​ቢ፡ ​ዘአ​ንገ​ደሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወለ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​ወለ​ዮሴ​ፍ፡ ​ወለ​ሰሎ​ሜ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ቦኡ፡ ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ፡
                                        ​ወዜ​ናሁ፡ ​ጽሑ​ፍ፡ ​በድ​ርሳ​ነ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                        ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘይ​ትነ​በብ፡ ​በዕ​ለተ፡ ​ቍስ​ቋም፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወልዳ ፨  ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5558PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ።</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5571LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza17">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-18-2) Fol. 59va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5581LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl18">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-19) Fols 59va–60va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5589LIT3604Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-19-1) Fols 59va–60va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3604.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ድ ​ንግ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5608PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ አ  (b)  ​ሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ለው፡ ​በአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡  ፪  ​አኃ​ው፡ ​ፍቁ​ራን፡ ​ወይ​ትፋ​ቀሩ፡ ​በበ​ይና​ቲሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወየ​አም​ሩ፡
                                        ​ጽሒ​ፈ፡ ​ወመ​ጽአ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​እም​ኔሆ​ሙ፡ ​ኀበ፡  ፩ 
                                        ​ወሰ​አለ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይጽ​ሐፍ፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ሀለ​ው፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡
                                        ​ጽሒ​ፈ፡ ​መጻ​ሕፍ​ት፡ ​፪ሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወድ​ቁ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኃጢ​አት ፨
                                  </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወዘ​ንተ፡ ​ብሁ​ላ፡ ​አድ​ኃነ​ቶ፡ ​እም​እዴ​ሆሙ፡ ​ወወ​ረደ፡ ​በበ​ንስ​ቲት፡ ​እም​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወገ​ብአ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ህላ​ዌሁ፡ ​ዘት​ካት ፨ 
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ነቅ​ሐ፡ ​እም​ንዋ​ሙ፡ ​አን​ከረ፡ ​እም​ራእ​ይ፡ ​ወነ​ገሮ፡ ​ለካ​ልዑ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሁ ፨  ​ወነ​ስሐ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡
                                        ​ንስሐ ፨  ወ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ድኃ​ነ፡ ​እም​ኃጕል<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​በስ​እለ​ታ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ወ  (fol. 60v)   (a)  ​ልዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡
                                            ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5685PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5698LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza18">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-19-2) Fol. 60va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5708LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl19">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-20) Fols 60va–61va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5716LIT3605Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-20-1) Fols 60va–61rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3605.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        

                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡   (b)   ​ምስ​ለ፡

                                        ​ገብራ ፨
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5737PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩ 
                                            ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​መስ​ተጋ​ድል፡ ​ፈድ​ፋደ፡ ​በከ​ዊነ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ስመ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡
                                            ​ጊዮ​ርጊ​ስ፡ ​ሐዲስ ፨  ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ሀሎ፡
                                            ​ተጽ​ዒሮ፡ ​እም​ብዝ​ኃ፡ ​ኵነ​ኔ፡ ​ኖመ፡ ​ወበ ፲ ወ ፩ 
                                            ​ሰዓ​ተ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​አመ፡  ፳ ወ ፩  ​ለወ​ርኃ፡
                                            ​ግን​ቦት፡ ​መጽ​አት፡ ​ኀቤ​ሁ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                            ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨</fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወበ​ርሃ​ት፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ፀሐ​ይ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​አን​በረ፡ ​እዴ​ሁ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ርእ​ሱ፡ ​ረከ​ቦ፡ ​በዘ​ሐይ​ወ፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ኃይ​ል፡ ​ዐቢ​ይ፡ ​ወተ​ፈሥ​ሐ፡
                                        ​ጥቀ ፨  ​ወነ​በረ፡  ፬  ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ኢይ​ጥዕ​ም፡
                                        ወ ኢ ​ይሰ​ቲ፡ ​እም​ብዝ​ኃ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ዘመ​ልአ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ልቡ፡
                                        ​እም  (b)  ​ጣዕ​መ፡ ​መዓ​ዛሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5805PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5818LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza19">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-20-2) Fols 61rb–61va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5829LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl20">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-21) Fols 61va–62vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5837LIT3606Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-21-1) Fols 61va–62vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3606.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት ​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                            ወ ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5856PRS12964Gorgoryos"/>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡ ​በአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ዘት​ሰመ​ይ፡ ​እል​ክሱ​ስ፡ ​አረ​ጋዊ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ከጢ​ር፡ ​ወይ​ነብ​ር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡
                                        ​ዘእ​ግዝ​እትነ ፨  ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡   (b)  
                                        ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ወባ​ቲ፡ ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዓቃ​ቤ፡ ​ዘእ​ኩይ፡ ​ግዑዙ ፨  ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡ ​ለቀ​ሲስ፡ ​አን​ተ፡
                                        ​ትነ​ብር፡ ​ዝየ፡ ​ወኢ​ታዕ​ርግ፡ ​ዕጣ​ነ፡ ​ወዘ​መጽ​አ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ትበ​ልዕ፡ ​እም​ኔነ፡ ​ሑር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​በጽ​ሐ፡ ​ኢክ​ህለ፡ ​ዓቃ​ቢ፡ ​ቀዊ​መ፡ ​በእ​ገሪ​ሁ። ​ወቀ​ሲስ፡ ​ጥዕ​የ፡ ​ወጸ​ንዓ፡ ​ወኢ​ተዓ​ውቀ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ነገ​ር፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​እም​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡
                                        ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ተና​ገረ፡ ​ዓቃ​ቢ፡ ​በቃ​ሉ፡ ​ወአ​ምነ፡ ​ዘበ​ጽሐ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ቀሲ​ስ፡ ​ነበ​ረ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይት​ለአ​ክ፡ ​ለመ​ርጡላ ፨ 
                                        ​ወዓ​ቃቢ​ኒ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​መፃ​ጕዓ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ሞቱ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ <fo:inline>ወበረምሕረተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ም  (b)  ​ስለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5913PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶስ</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5926LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza20">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-21-2) Fol. 62vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5936LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl21">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-22) Fols 62vb–64vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e5944LIT3607Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-22-1) Fols 62vb–64va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The story of the two brothers from Dalgā who were dyers, CAe 3607.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡  ​ቅድ​ስት፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ድን​ግል፡  ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                            ​ወላ​ዲተ  ​አም​ላክ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብራ ፨
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e5969PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ለው፡  ፪  አ  (fol. 63r)   (a)  ​ኃው፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ዘት​ሰመ​ይ፡ ​ደል​ጋ፡
                                        ​ወየ​አል​ሱ፡ ​አል​ባሰ፡ ​በቀ​ለመ፡ ​ኒል ፨ ፩  ​ቀሲ​ስ፡ ​ታግ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ወካ​ልኡ፡
                                        ​ዲያ​ቆን፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ነዚብ ፨  ​ወኄ​ራን፡ ​እሙ​ንቱ፡ ​ወቦ​ሙ፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡
                                        ወ ለ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዘበ​ጽሐ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዘእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወወ​ሀቦ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​ወጸ​ቢሖ፡ ​በጽ​ሐ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዘእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘአ​ቅደ​ምነ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡
                                        ​በእ​ንቲ​አሃ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ክር​ታስ፡ ​ወአ​ንበ​ብዋ፡ ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ክር​ታስ፡
                                          (fol. 64v)   (a)  ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ሀለ​ው፡ ​ህየ ፨  ​ወሰ​ብሕ<fo:inline>፡  (!)</fo:inline>​ዎ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወአ​እኵ​ትዋ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                        ​ዘአ​ድኃ​ነቶ፡ ​እም​ክሕ​ደት፡ ​ወገ​ብረ፡ ​እኁ​ሁ፡ ​በዓ​ለ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​በው​እቱ፡ ​ዕለት ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6045PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6058LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza21">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-22-2) Fols 64va–64vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6068LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl22">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-23) Fols 64vb–66rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6076LIT3608Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-23-1) Fols 64vb–66rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The stone-footed man from France, CAe 3608.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                            ​ወላ ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6095PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                        <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ዓለ​መ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​በብ​ሔረ፡ ​አፍ​ርን​ጊ፡ ​ዘዕ​ብን፡ ​እግሩ ፨ 
                                        ​ወው​እቱ​ሰ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ይ  (fol. 165r)   (a)  ​ከድ​ን፡ ​እግ​ሮ፡ ​በል​ብስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢያ​እም​ሮ፡ ​ሰብእ ፨ 
                                        ​ወይ​በኪ፡ ​ወያ​ስቆ​ቁ፡ ​መዓ​ልተ፡ ​ወሌ​ሊተ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ዕ<fo:inline>[////]</fo:inline>​ረፍት ፨  ​ወያ​ፈቅ​ር፡ ​ገይ​ሰ፡ ​ቤተ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ዘእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ዘሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​በይ​እቲ፡ ​ሀገር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወበ​ከይ​ኩ፡ ​ወበ​ጊዜ​ሃ፡ ​ተበ​ትከ፡ ​እግ​ርየ፡ ​ዘዕ​ብን ፨  ​ወሰ​ሚዖ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡
                                        ​አስ​ተዓ​ፀበ፡ ​ወሖ​ረ፡
                                          (fol. 66r)   (a)  ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡ ​ወሰ​ገደ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ሥዕ​ላ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወአ​እኰ​ታ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        ​በ፪  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ገባ​ሪተ፡ ​ተአ​ምራ​ት፡ ​ወመ​ንክ​ራት ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6172PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ አ  (b)  ​ሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6187LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza22">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-23-2) Fol. 66rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6197LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl23">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-24) Fols 66rb–67rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6205LIT3609Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-24-1) Fols 66rb–67rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3609.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                            ወ ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከታ ፨  ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6230PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡   (fol. 66v)   (a)  ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​መር​ቆሬ​ዎስ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለምጸ ፨ 
                                        ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ሖረ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ዘካ​ርያስ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ዮ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ገሠ​ጾ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሉ፡
                                        ​በት​ሕት​ና፡ ​ወበ​የው​ሃት ፨  ​ኦእ​ኁየ፡ ​ኢይ​ደል​ወከ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌከ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ደዌ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ያዕ​ትቶ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​እም​ኔከ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፍ፡ ​ሰመ​ዮ፡ ​ርኩስ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወአ​ስመ​ከ፡ ​ርእ​ሶ፡ ​በአ​ረፍ​ት፡ ​ዘው​ስቴ​ታ፡ ​ሥዕ​ል፡ ​ዘእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኖ​መ፡ ​ወር​እየ፡ ​በሕ​ልሙ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እዲ​ሃ፡ ​ለሥ​ዕል፡ ​ገሠ​ሠት፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ወነ​ቅሐ፡ ​ወረ​ከበ፡ ​ሥጋ​ሁ፡ ​ንጹ​ሐ፡ ​እም​ለምጹ ፨ 
                                        ​ወተ​ፈሥ​ሐ፡ ​ዐቢ​የ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሖ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወአ​እኰ​ታ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                          (b)   ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​ዘጸ​ገወቶ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6299PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ክ<fo:inline>[ር]</fo:inline>​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6315LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza23">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-24-2) Fol. 67rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6325LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl24">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-25) Fols 67va–68vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6333LIT3610Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-25-1) Fols 67va–68vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">A poor woman with a broken leg is healed by the icon of St Mary in the church of Ḥārat ar-Rūm, CAe 3610.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                            ወ ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6355PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ሐር​ተሎ​ም፡ ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ቴታ፡ ​ሥዕ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​ዘይ​ሰም​ይዋ፡ ​ረዳ​ኢት፡ ​ወአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ነዳ​ይት፡ ​እም​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ተሰ​ብረ​ት፡ ​እግ​ራ፡
                                          (b)   ​ወአ​ልባ​ቲ፡ ​ምን​ትኒ፡ ​እም​ንዋ​የ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትሁ​ብ፡ ​ለዓ​ቃቤ፡ ​ሥራ​ይ፡ ​ይፈ​ውሳ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወረ​ከባ፡ ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ስብ​ርት፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትቀ​ውም፡ ​ወይ​ቤላ፡ ​ምን​ተ፡ ​ኮን​ኪ፡ ​ወመ​ኑ፡ ​አሕ​የወ​ኪ፡ ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​መጽ​አት፡
                                        ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይበ​ርህ፡ ​ገጻ፡ ​እም​ፀሐ​ይ፡ ​ወፄና ፨
                                         (fol. 68v)   (a)  ​ዕጣ​ን፡ ​ምዑ​ዝ፡ ​ይወ​ጽእ፡ ​እም​አል​ባሲ​ሃ፡ ​ወቀ​ፀበ​ተኒ፡ ​በእ​ገሪ ፨ 
                                        ​ወት​ቤለ​ኒ፡ ​ተን​ሥኢ፡ ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​ተን​ሣእ​ኩ፡ ​ወቆ​ምኩ፡ ​በእ​ገርየ ፨  ​ወኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ርእ​ይዋ፡
                                        ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ዘሐ​ይወ​ት፡ ​እም​ደዌ​ሃ፡ ​አእ​ኰት​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወወ​ደስ​ዋ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6422PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​መ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6440LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza24">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-25-2) Fol. 68vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6450LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl25">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-26) Fols 68vb–72rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6458LIT3611Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-26-1) Fols 68vb–72ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3611.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡  ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                            ​ወላዲ ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6480PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ   (fol. 69r)   (a)   ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​እመ​ምኔ​ት፡ ​በደ​ብረ፡ ​ቀር​ሜሎ​ስ፡ ​ዘስ​ማ፡ ​ሶፍ​ያ፡ ​ወሠ​ናይ፡ ​ግዕዛ ፨ 
                                        ​ወት​ፈር​ሆ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወታ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ 
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ልባ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሀ​ለዋ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ደብ​ር፡ ​ብዙ​ኃት፡ ​ደና​ግል፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ይያ​ት፡ ​ወት​ሜህ​ሮን፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​እመ፡ ​ምኔ​ት፡ ​ሥር​ዓተ፡ ​ቀኖ​ና፡
                                        ​ዘመ​ነኮ​ሳት፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ልሕ​ቀ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ሕፃ​ን፡ ​መሀ​ርዎ፡ ​መዝ​ሙረ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ወአ​ንብ​ቦ፡ ​መጻ​ሕፍ​ት፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳት ። 
                                        ​ወመ​ልአ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሁ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ቅዱሰ ፨  ​ወአ​ፍቀ​ራ፡
                                        ለ እ ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ፈድ​ፋደ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​አእ​ረፈ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶ​ስ፡ ​አባ፡ ​ሳዊ​ሮስ፡ ​ሤም​ዎ፡
                                        ​ህየ​ንቴ​ሁ፡
                                        ​ለው  (fol. 72r)   (a)  ​እቱ፡ ​ወልድ ፨  ​ወነ​በረ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​መን​በረ፡ ​ኤጲ​ስ፡
                                        ​ቆጶ​ስ፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ኄራ፡ ​ወኖ​ላዌ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወቱ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​በሰ​ላም ፨
                                   </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6550PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6563LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza25">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-26-2) Fols 72ra–72rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6574LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl26">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-27) Fols 72rb–73rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6582LIT3612Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-27-1) Fols 72rb–73ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3612.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6598PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ባሮ​ክ፡ ​ጠዋ​ይ፡ ​ዘአ​ልቦ​ቱ፡ ​ምግ​ባረ፡ ​ሠናይ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ይጸ​ልዕዎ ፨  ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ያፈ​ቅራ፡ ​ለእግ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፨  (fol. 72v)   (a)  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በጥ​ቡዕ፡ ​ልብ፡ ​ወይ​ጸው​ም፡ ​ጾመ፡ ​ነሐ​ሴ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አሃ ፨ 
                                        ​እስ<fo:inline>ስ (!)</fo:inline>​ከ፡ ​ፍጻ​ሜሃ፡ ​ወአ​መ፡ ​በዓ​ላ፡ ​ይገ​ብር፡ ​ከብ​ካበ፡ ​ለነ​ዳያን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​ዑ፡ ​ቃሎ፡ ​ተዘ​ርው ፨ 
                                        ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​አፍ​ተነ፡ ​ርእ​ሶ፡ ​ለካ​ህን፡ ​ወሠ​ረቀ፡ ​ላዕ<fo:inline>ላ (!)</fo:inline>​ሁ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ወተ​መጠ​ወ፡ ​እም​ሥጢ​ር፡ ​ቅዱስ ፨ 
                                        ​ወአ​ዕረ​ፈ፡ ​ወተ​መጠ​ወት፡ ​ነፍ​ሶ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                        ​ማር​ያም  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወአ​ንበ​ረቶ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገነ​ተ፡
                                        ​ተፍሥ  (fol. 73r)   (a)  ​ሕት፡ ​ወለ ​እለ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>​ቀሰ​ፍዎ፡ ​ነስ​ሑ፡ ​በአ​ንብ​ዕ፡
                                        ​ወበ​ሰቆ​ቃው፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወልዳ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6687PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6697LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza26">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-27-2) Fols 73ra–73rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6707LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl27">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-28) Fols 73rb–74ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6715LIT3613Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-28-1) Fols 73rb–73vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The deacon's prayer that contained five times "Rejoice"!, CAe 3613.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6731PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ሮሜ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​አን​ስጣ​ስዮ​ስ፡ ​ፈራ​ሄ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ወያ​ፈቅ​ራ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወይ​ገይ​ስ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወያ​ቄር​ብ፡ ​ላቲ፡ ​አጶ​ርጌ፡
                                        ን  (fol. 73v)   (a)  ​ጹሐ፡ ​ወይ​ኤም​ኃ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብ​ል። ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦድ​ንግ​ል፡ ​ንጽ​ሕት፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅረ፡ ​ሕቀ፡ ​ሐመ፡ ​ወአ​ባሕ​ረረ፡ ​ነፍ​ሶ፡ ​መል​አከ፡ ​ሞት፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ርአ​የቶ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡
                                        ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                        ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​ኢት​ፍራ​ህ። ​ወኢ​ትደ​ንግ​ፅ፡ ​ወነ​ቅሐ፡ ​እም​ንዋ​ሙ፡ ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​ወተመ  (b)  ​ጠወ​ት፡ ​ነፍ​ሶ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6788PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6803LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza27">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-28-2) Fols 73vb–74ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6813LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl28">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-29) Fols 74ra–75ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6821LIT3614Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-29-1) Fols 74ra–75ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3614.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6840PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​በደ​ብረ፡ ​ቀል​ሞን፡ ​ዘሤ​መ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አፉ​ሁ፡ ​ወል​ቡ፡ ​ተአ​ምኆ​ተ፡ ​መል​አክ፡
                                        ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ሥዕ​ላ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                   ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ። ​ወው​እቱ​ሰ፡ ​ብእ  (b)  ​ሲ፡ ​ኢይ​ትሜ​ጦ፡ ​ቍር​ባነ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​በኢ​ጲፋ​ንያ፡ ​ወበ​ልደ​ት፡ ​ወበ​ፋሲ​ካ፡ ​ወአ​መ፡
                                        ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​በዓ​ላ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                        ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                        ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ነጸ​ርዎ፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ት፡ ​እኂ​ዞ፡ ​ተር​ሙሰ፡ ​ርኁ​ሰ፡ ​በማ​ይ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ፈቀ​ደ፡ ​ይብ​ላዕ፡ ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​አኃ​ዝዎ፡ ​ወሰ​ድዎ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ቤተ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወን​ድቅ፡ ​ዘተ​ሠጥ​ቀ፡ ​ተላ​ጸቀ፡ ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ቀዳ​ሚ፡ ​ወባ​ሕቱ፡ ​ንስ​ቲት፡ ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​ሙባ​አ፡ ​እድ​ተረ​ፈ፡ ለ<!--mut-->​ተዝ​ካር፡ ​ወዘ​ንተ፡
                                        ​ርእ​ዮሙ፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ት፡ ​አን​ከሩ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኢረ​ከብ​ዎ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ኃሠ​ሥዎ፡ ​ወኀ​ዘኑ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አቡ​ሆሙ፡ ​ይስ​ሐቅ፡ ​ዐቢ​የ፡ ​ኀዘነ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሰ​ሚዖ፡ ​ሊቀ፡ ​ጳጳ​ሳት፡ ​ተፈ​ሥሐ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ንድ​ቅ፡ ​ዘተ​ሠጥ​ቀ፡ ​ወሰ​ገደ፡ ​ላቲ፡ ​ወተ​ቀብ​ዓ፡ ​እም​ዘይ​ተ፡ ​ቀን​ዲል ፨ 
                                        ​ዘየ​ሐቱ ፨  ​ወተ​ሰም​ዓ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ነገ​ር፡ ​ኀበ፡
                                          (fol. 75r)   (a)  ​ኵሉ፡ ​አድ​ያመ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብራ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        <fo:inline id="d1e6904PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለም ፨  ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6920LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza28">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-29-2) Fol. 75ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6930LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl29">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-30) Fols 75ra–77ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e6938LIT3615Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-30-1) Fols 75ra–76vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Mary: The Story of the Cannibal of Qǝmr, CAe 3615.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም  (b)  ​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e6956PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ቅም​ር፡ ​ክቡ​ረ፡ ​ዘመ​ድ፡ ​በስ​ሞ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያና​ዊ፡
                                        ​ውእቱ ፨  ወ ዓ ​ቢይ፡ ​ወፍ​ዱል፡ ​እም​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ኵሉ፡
                                        ​ሰብእ ፨  ​ወኢ​ይበ​ልዕ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ላህ​ም፡ ​አላ፡ ​ይበ​ልዕ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ሰብ​እ። ​ወዘ​በል​ዓ፡ ​የዓ​ክል፡
                                         ፸ ወ ፰  ​ነፍስ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኃ​ልቁ፡ ​ፍቁ​ራኒ​ሁ፡ ​ወአ​እር​ክቲ​ሁ፡ ​ወአ​ዝማ​ዲሁ፡ ​ወመ​ገብ​ቱ፡ ​እለ​ኒ፡ ​ተር​ፉ፡ ​ጐዩ፡
                                        ከ  (fol. 75v)   (a) <fo:inline>ከ (!)</fo:inline>​መ፡ ​ኢይ​ብል​ዖሙ፡ ​ወተ​ርፈ፡ ​ባሕ​ቲቱ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ብእ​ሲቱ፡
                                        ወ ፪  ​ደቂቁ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​አስ​ተየ፡ ለ ፩  ​ነዳ​ይ፡ ​ፅሙ​ዕ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​አስ​ተየ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​አም​ጽኡ፡
                                        ​መዳ​ልወ፡ ​ወድ​ልዉ፡ ​ውእ​ተ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳተ፡ ​ዘበ​ልዓ ፨  ​ወው​እተ፡ ​ማየ፡ ​ዘአ​ስተ​የ፡
                                        ለ ፩  ​ነዳ​ይ፡ ​ጽሙ​ዕ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡  ፩  ​መድ​ሎት ፨ 
                                        ​ወኃ​የለ፡ ​ማይ፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​እሙ​ንቱ፡  ፸ ወ ፰  ​ነፍ​ሳት፡
                                        ​ወር​እዮ​ሙ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ተ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​አን​ከሩ፡
                                        ወ  (b)  ​ገብ​ሩ፡ ​ይባቢ ፨  ​እስ​መ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​በላ​ዔ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ድኅ​ነ፡ ​በስ​እለ​ታ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብራ ፨
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e7053PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7066LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza29">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-30-2) Fols 76vb–77ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7076LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl30">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-31) Fols 77ra–77vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7084LIT3692Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-31-1) Fols 77ra–77va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3692.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብራ ፨
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e7103PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ተብ​ህለ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ሀሎ፡  ፩  ​ሰራ​ቂ፡ ​ወቀ​ሣጢ፡ ​ንዋ​የ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​አሚረ ፨ 
                                        ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ዘይ​ቀስ​ጥ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​እኩ​የ፡ ​ልማ​ድ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወይ​ጸን​ሕዎ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ሔደ፡ ​ንዋ​የ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ማ  (b)  ​ርያ​ም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​በከ​መ፡
                                        ​ምላዱ ፨  ​ወአ​ኃዝ​ዎ፡ ​ለው​እቱ፡ ​ሰራ​ቂ፡ ​ወዘ​በጥ​ዎ፡ ​ወአ​ሠር​ዎ፡ ​በጋ​ጋ፡ ​ወበ​ሰና​ስል ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​አን​ሰ፡ ​እት​አመ​ና፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ዘአ​ምነ፡ ​በጸ​ሎታ፡ ​ይድ​ኅን፡ ​እም​ኵሉ፡ ​ኀዘ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ስተ​ርአ​የቶ​ሙ፡ ​ገሃ​ደ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ዘበ​ጥዎ፡ ​ወአ​ኃዝ​ዎ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይን​ሥኡ፡ ​መል​ክዖ ፨ 
                                        ​ወት​ቤሎ  (fol. 77v)   (a)  ​ሙ፡ ​ኅድ​ግዎ፡ ​ወኃ​ደግ​ዎ፡ ​በት​እዛ​ዘ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪
                                        ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወፈ​ትሕ​ዎ፡ ​እማ​ዕሠ​ሩ፡ ​ወአ​ንከ​ሩ፡
                                        ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​እም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ዚአሃ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ <fo:inline>ጸሎታ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e7175PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7188LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza30">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-31-2) Fols 77va–77vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7198LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl31">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-32) Fols 77vb–78vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7206LIT3617Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-32-1) Fols 77vb–78va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The pregnant woman who was caught by the tide while going to the church of St Michael, CAe 3617.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከታ ፤  ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e7225PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ፅን​ስት፡ ​ወአ​ልጸ​ቀት፡ ​ለወ​ሊድ ፨ 
                                        ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ተሐ​ውር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያኑ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱስ፡ ​ሚካኤ  (fol. 78r)   (a)  ​ል፡ ​ለገ​ቢረ፡ ​በዓ​ል፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ብዙ​ኅ፡
                                        ​ሰብእ ፨  ​ሰም​ዑ፡ ​ድም​ፀ፡ ​ማዕ​በለ፡ ​ባሕ​ር፡ ​እም​ርኁ​ቅ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​የሐ​ውር፡ ​መጠ​ነ፡
                                         ፫  ​ምዕ​ራፍ፡ ​ወፈ​ርሁ፡ ​ወጐዩ ፨  ​ወተ​ርፈ​ት፡ ​ባሕ​ቲታ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ስዕ​ነት፡
                                        ​ረዊ​ጸ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወተ​መይ​ጡ፡ ​ኀቤሃ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​ወተ​ስእ​ልዋ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ኃደ​ግዋ ።  ​ወዜ​ነወ​ቶሙ፡ ​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ባቲ፡ ​ወተ​ፈሥ​ሑ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡
                                        ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወአ​እኰ​ትዋ፡
                                        ​ለእግ  (fol. 78v)   (a)  ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ገባ​ሪተ፡
                                        ​ተአ​ምራ​ት፡ ​ወመ​ንክ​ራት፡ ​ወሰ​መየ​ቶ፡ ​ለው​እቱ፡ ​ሕፃ​ን፡ ​አብ​ሮስ​ኪሮ​ስፋ ር ​ስ፡ ​ዘው​እቱ፡ ​እደ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ገሰ​ሰቶ፡ ​ብሂ​ል፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e7293PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7306LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza31">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-32-2) Fols 78va–78vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7317LIT5673AkkonuColl#AkkColl32">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-33) Fols 78vb–79vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracles of Mary: ʾAkko-nu bǝʾsi collection, CAe 5673.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7325LIT3618Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-33-1) Fols 78vb–79va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">St Mary gives a thirsty dog water to drink from her shoe, CAe 3618.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድንግ<fo:inline>፡ (!)</fo:inline>​ል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                        ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e7349PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ለዋ፡ ​አን​ስት፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline> ​ማር  (fol. 79r)   (a)  ​ያም፡ 
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ቦአ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ልባ፡ ​ወመ​ጽአ፡ ​ከል​ብ፡ ​ፅሙ​ዕ፡ ​ወሰ​ደዳ​ሁ፡ ​ውእ​ቶን፡ ​አን​ስት ፨ 
                                        ​ወእ​ግዝ​እት​ነሰ፡ ​አስተ<fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline>​አፀ​በት፡ ​ወአ​ንከ​ረት፡ ​ወበ​ከየ​ት፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ርእ​የት፡ ​ድም​ፀ፡ ​ዚአሁ ። 
                                        ​ወይ​ቤላ​ሃ፡ ​አን​ስት፡ ​አን​ቲኑ፡ ​ትም​ሕረ​ዮ፡ ​ፈድ​ፋደ፡ ​እምኔ<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>፡ ​አኮ​ኑ፡ ​ይብ​ሉ፡ ​ይት​ወለ​ድ፡ ​እም​ኔኪ፡
                                        ​ክር<fo:inline>&lt;...&gt;</fo:inline>​ቶስ ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወት​ቤላ፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ​ለም​ንት፡ ​አን​ተጊ፡ ​ግም​ዔኪ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ተበ​ትኮ፡ ​ማህ​የብ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኢ​ትረ​ክቢ፡ ​ማየ ፨  ​ወአ​ውሥ​አታ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                        በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ወት​ቤላ፡ ​ማይ​ሰ፡
                                        ​አኮ፡ ​ዘይ​ወጽ​እ፡ ​እማ​ዕም​ቅ፡ ​አላ፡ ​እም​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክ፡
                                          (fol. 79v)   (a)  
                                        ​ዘአ​ሰት​ዮ፡ ​ለዝ፡ ​ከል​ብ፡ ​ፅሙ​ዕ፡ ​ይሁ​በነ፡ ​እም​ላዕሉ ፨  ​ወዘ​ንተ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ተና​ገረ​ት፡
                                        ​ኃደ​ረ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌየ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​አብ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e7421PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡ ።</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                        ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7431LIT4274AkkonuB#Stanza32">
                  <fo:inline>III-2-33-2) Fols 79va–79vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Was he not a man?’ (አኮኑ፡ ብእሲ፡), CAe 4274.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7443LIT3665Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-3) Fols 79vb–81va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The people of an Egyptian town set fierce dogs on the Holy Family, CAe 3665.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን ​ግል፡
                                        ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7462PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ነገ​ር፡ ​ወለ​ደቶ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወአ​ዘዘ፡ ​ሄሮ​ድስ፡ ​ዕል​ው፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይቅ​ትሉ፡
                                    ​ሕፃ​ናተ፡ ዘ ፪  ​ዓመ​ት፡
                                      (fol. 80r)   (a)  ​ወዘ​ይን​ዕስሂ ፨  ​ወሰ​ሚዓ፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡
                                    ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​አጕ​የየ​ቶ፡ ​ለወ​ልዳ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ጊዜ፡
                                    ​ቀት​ር፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​አን​በረ​ቶ፡ ​ለሕ​ፃን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ክፍ​ለ፡ ​ቈና​ጽል፡ ​ለይ​ኩኑ፡ ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​የት፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ሥራ​ዊሆ​ሙ፡
                                    ​ወድ​ምሳ​ሴሆ​ሙ፡ ​ለሰ​ብአ፡ ​ዘቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ሰበ​ሐቶ፡ ​ለአ​ምላ​ከ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ሰበ​ሐቶ፡
                                    ማ  (fol. 81v)   (a)  ​ርያ​ም፡ ​እኅ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ስጥ​መተ፡ ​ፈር​ዖን፡ ​ወሰ​ራዊ​ቱ፡ ​በባ​ሕረ፡ ​ኤር​ትራ ፨ 
                                    ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ዮም፡ ​በድ​ምሳሴ ፨ 
                                    ​ወኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​እሉ፡ ​ርእ​ይዋ፡ ​ለይ​እቲ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡ ​ያነ​ክሩ ፨  ​ወይ​ነግ​ሩ፡ ​ዕበ​የ፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡
                                    ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡  ​ማር​ያም፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወልዳ ፨ 
                                    ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7523PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7533LIT3587Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-4) Fols 81vb–82rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Mary: Miracle of a poor monk whom Mary gave a garment, CAe 3587.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን ​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                        ​ወላ ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብራ ፨
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7555PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ተብ​ህለ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ሀሎ፡  ፩  ​መነ​ኮስ፡ ​ነዳ​ይ፡ ​ዘአ​ልቦ​ቱ፡ ​ሲሳ​ይ፡ ​ወል​ብስ፡ ​ወይ​ትአ​መና፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡
                                    ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                    ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወይ​ብል፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​በጊ​ዜ፡ ​ጸሎ​ቱ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                    ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                    (fol. 82r)   (a)  
                                    ​አዝ​ዚ፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ዘእ​በል​ዕ፡ ​ወዘ​እለ​ብስ፡ ​ወዘ​ንተ፡ ​ብሂ​ሎ፡ ​ኖመ፡ ​ወበ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​እም​ለያ​ልይ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​መን​ፈቀ፡ ​ሌሊ​ት፡ ​አስ​ተር​አየ​ቶ፡ ​በራ​እይ፡
                                    ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                    ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወረ​ከበ፡ ​ውእ​ተ፡ ​ልብ​ሰ፡ ​ወተ​ፈሥ​ሐ፡ ​ዐቢ​የ፡ ​ፍሥ​ሐ፡ ​ወአ​እኰ​ታ፡ ​ለእ  (b)  ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                    ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                    ​መዝ​ገበ፡ ​ሣህ​ል፡ ​ወኵ​ሎሙ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ርእ​ዩ፡ ​ወሰ​ምዑ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​አን​ከሩ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ዐቢ​የ፡ ​ስብ​ሐተ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ፈድ​ፈዱ፡ ​አክ​ብሮ​ተ፡ ​ስማ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡
                                    ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ተ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7635PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓለ
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7645LIT3633Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-5) Fols 84ra–84va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3633.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ኤ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከታ ፤  ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7669PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወበ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ይቤ​ላ፡  ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​ለእ​ሙ፡ ​ድን​ግል፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​አይ፡ ​ኀዘ​ን፡
                                    ​የዓ​ቢ፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​ኀዘ​ናት፡ ​ዘረ​ከበ​ኪ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አየ ፨  ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ኦእ​ግዚ​እየ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡ ​እሉ፡  ፭  ​ኃዘ​ናት፡ ​የዓ​ብዩ፡
                                     ፩  ​እም​ኔሆ​ሙ፡ ​ሶበ፡ ​ነበ​የ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አከ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​መቅ​ደስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይቀ​ትሉ​ከ፡ ​አይ​ሁድ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወይ​ቤላ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ለወ​ላዲ​ቱ፡ ​ዘዘ​ከረ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ሕማ​ማተ ፤  ​ወኀ​ዘና​ተ፡
                                    ​ዘረ​ከበ​ኪ፡ ​በእ​ንቲ​አየ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብ​ል፡ ​አቡ​ነ፡ ​ዘበ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ወሰ​ላመ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤል ፨ 
                                    አ  (fol. 84v)   (a)  ​ነ፡ ​እሰ​ሪ፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ኃጢ​አቶ፡ ​ወአ​ርሶ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨ 
                                    ​አነ፡ ​ወአ​ንቲ፡ ​ንመ​ጽእ፡ ​ኅቡረ ፨  ​እም​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ይሙ​ት፡ በ ፫  ​ዕለት ፨ 
                                    ​ወዘ​ንተ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይት​ናገ​ራ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ለወ​ላዲ​ቱ፡ ​ሰም​ዓ፡ ​ደቅ​ስዮ​ስ፡ ​ወጸ​ሐፈ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያን​ብብ​ዋ፡ ​መሃ​ይም​ናን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7736PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7755LIT5172MiracleIncense">
                  <fo:inline>III-6) Fols 84va–85rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Mary: A priest is warned by an angel not to rush when incensing the icon of St Mary, CAe 5172.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​በ፪​ኤ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                        ወ ​ላዲ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡   (b)   ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7779PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​በአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​እነ​ዘ፡ ​የዓ​ውድ፡ ​ካህ​ን፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​የዓ​ጥን፡ ​ካህ​ን፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወበ​ጽሐ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሥዕ​ለ፡
                                    ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ኤ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​አም​ኃ፡ ​ወወ​ሀባ፡ ​ሰላመ ፨ 
                                    ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​ኢት​ጐጕ​ዕ፡ ​ወገ​ብረ፡ ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​ወገ​ሰሰ፡ ​ዓም​ደ፡ ​በእ​ዴሁ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይኤ​ምኃ፡ ​ለሥ​ዕለ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ኤ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                   ​ወሰ​ምዓ​ት፡ ​ኢላ​ርያ፡ ​ወለ​ተ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​ዘይ​ኑን፡ ​ወጐ​የት፡
                                      (b)  
                                    ​እም​አቡ​ሃ፡ ​ወበ​ጽሐ​ት፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​አስ​ቄጥ​ስ፡ ​ወመ​ነኮ​ሳት፡ ​በህየ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ዘዞ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​መኳ​ንን​ተ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​የሀ​ቡ፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​ለደ​ብረ፡ ​አስ​ቄጥ​ስ፡ ​ለመ​ፍቀ​ደ፡ ​መነ​ኮሳ​ት፡ ​ወለ​አብ​ያተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያናት ፨ 
                                    ​ወፈ​ጺሞ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ተዝ​ካረ፡ ​ሠና​የ። ​ወአ​ዕረ​ፈ፡ ​በሰ​ላም፡ ​ወቦ​አ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7836PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7846LIT5342MiracleWaybela">
                  <fo:inline>III-7) Fols 85rb–86rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Mary: St Mary appears to the gabaz of her church in Waybǝlā and tells him about the fall of Badlāy, CAe 5342.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ አ  (fol. 85v)   (a)  ​ምላክ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7868PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ተአ​ምር፡ ​ዘከ​ሠተ​ት፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ሞቱ፡ ​ለበ​ድላይ ፨ 
                                    ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​በም​ድረ፡ ​እጉ​ባ፡ ​ዘተ​ሐን​ጸት፡ ​በስ​መ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ ፨ 
                                    ​ወን​ጉሥ​ኒ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​በም​ድረ፡ ​እጉ​ባ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​የኀ​ዝን፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​ኀዘነ ፨ 
                                    ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ዘቀ​ተል​ዎሙ፡ ​ተን​ባላ​ት፡ ​ለክ​ርስ​ቲያን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​ለም​ንት፡ ​የኀ​ዝን፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ዓላ​ዊ፡ ​አነ፡ ​እቀ​ትሎ፡ ​ለዓ​ላዊ ፨ 
                                    ​ወበ​ከመ፡ ​ትቤ​ሎ፡ ​ለቀ​ሲስ፡ ​ወለ​ዲያ​ቆን፡ ​ቀተ​ለቶ፡ ​ለበ​ድላ​ይ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​ኃጕ​ል፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ሠራ​ዊቱ፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​ዋሕድ ፨ 
                                    ​ወን​ጉሥ፡ ​እም​ኢአ​ምኖ​ሙ፡ ​ለቀ​ሲስ፡ ​ወለ​ዲያ​ቆን፡ ​ለእ​መ፡ ​ኢያ​ቅደ​ሙ፡ ​ነጊ​ሮቶ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​በጽ​ሐ፡ ​ቃሎ​ሙ፡
                                    ​አምኖ  (b)  ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ንከ​ረ፡ ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እትነ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7922PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨  ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e7941LIT3655Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-8) Fols 86rb–86vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The daughter of the rich man from Caesarea who could not deliver her baby, CAe 3655.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት ​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡  ​በ፪​ኤማ​ርያ​ም፡
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡  ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e7960PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​እም​ዓበ​ይተ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ቂሳ​ርያ ፨  ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​አቡ​ሃ፡ ​ባዕ​ለ፡ ​በህ​ቁ፡
                                    ​በወ​ርቅ፡ ​ወበ​ብሩ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​ንዋ​የ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡   (fol. 86v)   (a)   ​ኃላፊ ፨ 
                                    ​ወይ​እቲ​ሰ፡ ​ኮነ​ት፡ ​ፅን​ስተ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​በጽ​ሐ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወሊ​ዶታ፡ ​ተዓ​ስረ፡ ​ማኅ​ፀና፡ ​ወበ​ጽሐ​ት፡
                                    ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ለሞት ፨  ​ወአ​በዊ​ሃ፡ ​ፆር​ዋ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ዓራ​ት፡ ​ወወ​ሰድ​ዋ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያነ፡
                                    ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ኤ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወተ​ፈሥ​ሑ፡ ​አዝ​ማዲ​ሃ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​ፍሥሐ ፨  ​ወሰ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ወለ​ወላ​ዲቱ፡
                                    ​ድንግ   (b)  ​ል፡ ​ሰአ​ሊተ፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡ ​ለው​ሉደ፡ ​እጓ​ለ፡ ​እመ​ሕያው ፨  ​ወገ​ብሩ፡ ​ምጽ​ዋተ፡ ​ለነ​ዳያ​ን፡
                                    ​ወለ​ምስ​ኪናን ፨  ​ወወ​ሀቡ፡ ​ለቤ​ተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወር​ቀ፡ ​ወብ​ሩረ፡ ​በስ​ማ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ኤ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8023PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8043LIT3670Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-9) Fols 86vb–87vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The miraculous spring of Meḫḍāb, CAe 3670.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት ​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ​፪ኤ​ማር​ያም፡
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡  ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ አ  (fol. 87r)   (a)  ​ሜን።
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ዘገ​በረ​ቶ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​አመ፡ ፰ ​ለወ​ርኃ፡ ​ሰኔ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ምሕ​ፃብ፡ ​ዘዕ​ውቅ​ት፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ነቅ​ዓ፡ ​ማይ፡ ​ቡሩክ ፨ 
                                    ​ዘአ​ንቅ​ዓ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ወላ​ዲቱ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ኤ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​ፈጣ​ሪ፡ ​በጊ​ዜ፡ ​ተመ​ይጠ​ቶሙ፡ ​እም​ብሔ​ረ፡ ​ግብ​ጽ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ዮሴ​ፍ፡ ​ጻድቅ ፤
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወእ​ምህ  (fol. 87v)   (a)  ​የ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​መጥ​ርያ፡ ​ወእ​ምህ​የ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ምሕ​ፃብ፡ ​ዘአ​ንቅዓ ፤ 
                                    ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​እሙ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወይ​እቲ፡ ​ትነ​ብር፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት። ​ይመ​ጽኡ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሃ፡ ​ኵሎ​ሙ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​እም​ኵሉ፡ ​ሀገ​ር፡
                                    ​ወእ​ምኵ​ሉ፡ ​ዘመድ ፨  ​ወይ​ተነ​ብሉ፡ ​በእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ኤ፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ወይ​ትባ​ረኩ፡ ​እም​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያና፡ ​ወእም ነ ​ቅዓ፡
                                    ​ማይ፡ ​ቡሩክ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ም  (b)  ​ስለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8123PRS13026KenfaM">​ክን​ፈ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን።  ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8139LIT3708Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-10) Fols 87vb–88va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The faded icon of St Mary that the mother-in-law wanted to discard, CAe 3708.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት ​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በ፪  ​ማር​ያም፡
                                        ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ አ ​ምላ​ክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8158PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ሐማ​ታ፡ ​ወታ​ፈቅ​ራ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ኤ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ወሥ​ዕላ​ኒ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ውስ​ቴታ፡
                                    ​ወት​ትአ​መን፡ ​ባቲ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወት​ትአ​መኆ፡
                                    ​ለሥዕ  (fol. 88r)   (a)  ​ል፡ ​ወት​ኰስ​ትር፡ ​ኵሎ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                    ​ዘው​ስተ፡ ​ቤታ፡ ​ወተ​ሐቱ፡ ​ማኅ​ቶተ፡ ​ወኢ​ይጠ​ፍዕ፡ ​ማኅ​ቶት ፤  ​ኀበ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ሥዕ​ላ፡
                                    ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​መለ​ኮት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወአ​ስቆ​ቀወ​ት፡ ​ወኢ​ያን​ተገ​ት፡ ​እም​አፉ​ሃ፡ ​ሰላ​መ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትብ​ል፡ ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡
                                    ​ኦም​ልእ​ተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምስ​ሌኪ ፨  ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡
                                    ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ ፨  ​ወይ​እዜ​ኒ፡ ​ገበ​ሩ፡ ​ተዝ​ካራ፡
                                    ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ጥዕ​ምተ፡ ​ስም፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨  ​ኦአ​ኃው​የ፡
                                    ​አእም  (fol. 88v)   (a)  ​ሩ፡ ​ወጠ​ይቁ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትረ​ድእ፡ ​ለኵ​ሉ፡ ​ዘተ​አመ​ነ፡ ​በጸ​ሎታ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​ይዕ​ቀቦ፡ ​ለፍ​ቁራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8231PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8244LIT3709Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-11) Fols 88va–89ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">The woman from Cairo whose children all died, CAe 3709.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ 
                                    በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8269PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወሀ​ለወ​ት፡ ​አሐ​ቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​በደ​ወለ፡ ​ቃህ​ራ፡ ​ወወ​ለደ​ት፡ ፯ ​ውሉ​ደ፡ ​ወሞ​ቱ፡ ​ኵሎሙ ፨ 
                                    ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ሰአ​ለት፡ ​ወበ​ከየ​ት፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡   (b)   ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    ​ከመ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ተሀ​ባ፡ ​ውሉደ ፨ 
                                    ​ወአ​ስተ​ርአ​የታ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​በሕ​ልም፡ ​ወም​ስሌ​ሃ፡  ፫  ​ደቂ​ቅ፡
                                    ወ ፩  ​በአ​ምሳ​ለ፡ ​ወሬ​ዛ፡ ወ ፪  ​በአ​ምሳ​ለ፡ ​ሕፃ​ናት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወሞ​ተት፡ ​እሞ​ሙ፡ ​ወቆ​ሙ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​መቃ​ብራ፡ ​ወገ​ብሩ፡ ​ተዝ​ካራ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ትቤ​ላ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ኤ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ጥዕ​ምተ፡ ​ስም ፨ 
                                    ​ዕበ​ይ፡ ​ወክ​ብር፡ ​ለወ​ልድ፡ ​ዘኃ​ደረ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ማኅ​ፀና፡ ​ወተ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​እም​ኔሃ ፨ 
                                    ​አኰ​ቴት፡ ​ለመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ለዘ​አን​ጽሐ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8338PRS13026KenfaM">​ክን​ፈ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8354LIT5154MiracleDemons">
                  <fo:inline>III-12) Fols 89ra–90ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Mary: An abbot in Scete sees first a multitude of demons, then a multitude of saints, CAe 5154.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝእ ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡  ​በ፪ ​ማር​ያም፡
                                        ​ወላዲ ​ተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡   (b)   ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8378PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወአ​ሐተ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ወፅ​አ፡ ​መም​ህረ፡ ​አስ​ቄጥ​ስ፡ ​ገዳመ ፨  ​ወር​እየ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃነ፡
                                    ​መና​ፍስ​ተ፡ ​አጋ​ንን​ት፡ ​ዘአ​ልቦ፡ ​ኍል​ቍ፡ ​ደን​ገፀ፡ ​ወጐ​የ፡ ​ወገ​ብአ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሥዕ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ኤ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                    ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ርድ​እኒ፡ ​ወአ​ድኅ​ንኒ ፨  ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​እደ፡ ​ብር​ሃና​ዌ፡ ​ወባ​ቲ፡
                                    ​ማዕ​ተብ፡ ​ወት​ቤሎ፡ ​ኢት​ፍራ​ህ፡ ​ወኢ​ትደ​ንግ​ፅ፡ ​ፃዕ፡ ​ወዕ​ተብ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሆሙ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወነ​በረ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወቱ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ያፈ​ቅራ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                    በ ፪ ​ኤ፡
                                      (fol. 90r)   (a) 
                                    ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ጥዕ​ምተ፡ ​ስም፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ ፨ 
                                    ​ወያ​ነብ​ብ፡ ​ውዳ​ሴሃ፡ ​ለለ​ዕለቱ ፨  ​ወይ​ገብ​ር፡ ​ተዝ​ካራ፡ ​ለለ​በዓ​ላ፡ ​ወይ​ትለ​አካ፡
                                    ​ወይ​ትመ​ኃፀ​ን፡ ​ኀቤ​ሃ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ፈጸ​መ፡  ፴  ​ዓመት ፨ 
                                    ​ወእ​ምድ​ኅሬ​ሁ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ፡ ​በሰ​ላም፡ ​ወአ​ብአ​ቶ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገነ​ተ፡ ​ትፍ​ሥሕት ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8442PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8452LIT3650Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-13) Fols 90ra–90va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3650.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8461LIT3646Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>III-14) Fols 90va–91vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">, CAe 3646.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሃ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ 
                                    በ ፪ ​ኤ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡ 
                                    ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                    ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8483PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                    ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ማር​ቆስ፡ ​ዘነ​ግሠ፡ ​በሮ​ምያ፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ሞተ፡ ​አቡ​ሁ፡ ​ንጉ​ሥ፡
                                    ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ገብ​ረ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ ፨  ​ወበ​መዋ​ዕሊ​ሁ፡ ​ረት​ዓ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ተ፡
                                      (b)  
                                    ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወአ​ፈድ​ፈደ፡ ​ገቢ​ረ፡ ​ሠና​ይ፡ ​ጥበ​በ፡ ​ወአ​እም​ሮ፡ ​እም​እለ፡ ​ቀደ​ምዎ፡ ​ነገ​ሥት ፨ 
                                    ​ወነ​ግሠ፡  ፭  ​ዓመ​ተ፡ ​ወድ​ንግ​ል፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወኢ​ነሥ​አ፡ ​ብእ​ሲተ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ወወ​ፅአ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​እም​ሥዕላ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ለድ​ንግ​ል፡
                                     ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡ ​ናሁ፡ ​ተወ​ክፈ፡ ​ሥዕ​ለተ​ከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይፈ​ጽም፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ዘሰ​አል​ከ፡ ​ሑር፡
                                    ​ኦማ​ርቆስ ፨  ​ወሰ​ሚዖ፡ ​ሰገ​ደ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ሥዕ​ላ፡ ​ወወ​ፅአ፡ ​እም​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወሖ​ረ፡
                                    ​ኀበ፡ ​ደብ​ር፡ ​ዘስ​ሙ፡ ​ቶር​ማቅ ፨ 
                                    ​ወበ​ህየ፡ ​ፈጸ​መ፡ ​ገድ​ሎ፡ መ  (b)  ​ንክ​ረ፡ ​ወመ​ድም​መ፡ ​ለሰ​ሚዕ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​ጸሎ​ታ፡ ​ወበ​ረከ​ታ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ራ፡
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e8542PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡
                                    ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡ ​ወአ​ሜን ፨  ​ለይ​ኩን፡ ​ለይ​ኩን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8566LIT2382Taamme">
                  <fo:inline>IV) Fols 92ra–104vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Miracles of Jesus’ (ተኣምረ፡ ኢየሱስ፡), CAe 2382.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8574LIT6012MJSalome">
                  <fo:inline>IV-1) Fols 92ra–93ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: Salome praises Jesus, CAe 6012.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨
    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
        
        ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e8593PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
        
        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​ዓት፡ ​ሰሎ​ሜ፡ ​መወ​ልዲ​ት፡ ​ነገ​ሮ፡ ​ለሕ​ፃን፡ ​ሰብ​ሐት፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ትብል ፨ 
        ​ኦዘ​ይነ​ብር፡ ​በየ​ማኑ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለከ ፨  ​ኦዘ​ይፀ​ውር​ዎ፡ ​ኪሩ​ቤል፡
        ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለከ ፨  ​ኦዘ​አን​በረ፡ ​መን​በሮ፡ ​መል​ዕል​ተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ወመ​ከየ​ዶ፡ ​መት​ሕተ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡
        ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ኦዘ​ሠም​ረ፡ ​ለር​እሱ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
         (b)   ​ከመ፡ ​ይሣ​ሃል፡ ​አግ​ብር​ቲሁ፡
    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
        
        ​ኦዘ​ይሴ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ነፍ​ስ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ኦቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ዘመ​ጻእ​ከ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​በሥ​ምረ​ተ፡ ​አቡ​ከ፡
        ከ  (fol. 93r)   (a)  ​መ፡ ​ታድ​ኅን፡ ​ነገ​ደ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል፡ ​ወኵ​ሎ፡ ​አሕ​ዛበ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለከ ፨ 
        ​ኦዘ​ትሰ​ሪ፡ ​ጌጋ​የ፡ ​ወት​ደመ​ስስ፡ ​አበሳ ፤  ​ወተ​ኃድ​ግ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ለከ ፨ 
        ​ለከ፡ ​ይደ​ሉ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ወክ​ብር፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አቡ​ከ፡ ​ኄር፡ ​ወመን ​ፈስ ​ከ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ማኅ​የዊ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
        <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፤
    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8654LIT6013MJPresentation">
                  <fo:inline>IV-2) Fols 93ra–94rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: The presentation of Jesus at the temple, CAe 6013.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምር፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​በአ​ቱ፡  ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡
                                        ​ወአ​ምላ ​ክነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​መቅ​ደስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በጸ​ጋ፡ ​ረድ​ኤቱ፡ ​ይዕ​ቀቦ፡ ​ለፍ​ቁሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e8673PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡   (b)  ፵  ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ልደ​ቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡
                                         ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​ዘጾ​ረቶ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወላ​ዲቱ፡ ​ወዮ​ሴፍ፡ ​ፀራ​ቢ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያብ​እዎ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​መቅ​ደስ ፤ 
                                            ​በከ​መ፡ ​ተሠ​ርዓ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሕገ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ወአ​ምጽ​ኡ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሁ፡ ​ዕጕ​ለ፡ ​ርግ​ብ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ይቤ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ሕግ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​ዖ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይት​ናገ​ር፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ኀዘ​ነ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​ኀዘነ ፨ 
                                        ​ወተ​መይ​ጠ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሐራ​ሁ፡ ​ወዜ  (b)  ​ነዎ​ሙ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዘሰ​ምዓ፡ ​ዜና​ሁ፡ ​ለዘ​ተወ​ልደ፡ ​ሕፃን ፨ 
                                        ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​አን​ሰ፡ ​ኢያ​ረም​ም፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​ወጻ​ድቃ​ን፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​እቀ​ትሎ​ሙ፡ ​ወአ​ጠፍ​ዕ፡ ​እም​ድር፡ ​ዝክ​ሮሙ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ኦ ​አማ​ኑኤ​ል፡  ​ዘተ​ወለ​ድከ፡ ​እም​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ድን​ግል፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ተቤ​ዝዎ፡ ​እሞ​ት፡ ​ወእ​ምኃ​ጕል፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e8731PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8745LIT6014MJTetmena">
                  <fo:inline>IV-3) Fols 94rb–95va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: The stolen cows of Ṭǝṭmǝnā, a neighbour of the Holy Family, CAe 6014.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመድ ​ኃኒ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡   (fol. 94v)   (a)   ​ወስ​እለ​ተ፡ ​እሙ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e8767PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሀ​ሎ፡  ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘቦ​ቱ፡ ​ብዙ​ኅ፡ ​አል​ህም​ት፡ ​ወመ​ፍቀ​ሬ፡ ​ምጽ​ዋት፡ ​ውእቱ ፨ 
                                        ​ወይ​ሴፎ፡ ​ምጽ​አተ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒቶ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​ወመ​ጽኡ፡ ​ፈያ​ት፡ ​እም​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ቍድ​ስ፡ ​ላዕ​ላይ፡
                                        ​ወሠ​ረቁ፡ ​እም​ነ፡ ​አል​ህም​ቲሁ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃ፡ ​ለው​እቱ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ጥጥ​ምና ፤  ​ወየ​ኃድ​ር፡ ​ጎረ​ቤቱ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ሀሎ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወይ​ቤሎ  (fol. 95v)   (a)  ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ኀደ​ጉ፡ ​ለክ​ሙ፡ ​ኃጣ​ዊክ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​መ፡ ​አመ​ንክ​ሙ፡ ​ብየ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​አም​ኑ፡ ​ቦቱ ፨  ​ወር​እዩ፡ ​ስብ​ሐተ፡ ​መን​ክራ​ቲሁ ፨ 
                                        ​ጥጥ​ምና​ሂ፡ ​አግ​ብአ፡ ​አል​ህም​ቲሁ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይት​ፌሣሕ ፨  ​ወጸ​ንዓ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ቱ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወአ​ተወ፡ ​ቤቶ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​የአ​ኵት፡ ​ወይ​ሴብሕ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e8818PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8837LIT6015MJFisher">
                  <fo:inline>IV-4) Fols 95vb–96vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: The fisher of the lake Tiberias whose fish were stolen, CAe 6015.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡  ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡
                                        ​ወመ​ድኃ ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​ዘገ​ብረ፡ ​በብ​ሔረ፡ ​ጥብ​ርያ​ዶስ፡
                                        ​አመ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ወላ​ዲቱ፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ ​ወም​ስለ፡ ​ዮሴ​ፍ፡ ​በና​ዝሬት ፤
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e8859PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወአ​ሜሃ፡ ​ሖረ፡ ​ጥብ​ርያ​ዶስ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ዮሴ​ፍ፡ ​ወለ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​መፍ​ቀዶ​ሙ፡ ​በህየ ፨ 
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ቦኡ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ጥብ​ርያ​ዶስ፡ ​ኃደ​ጎሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ወኀ​በ፡ ​ጥብ​ርያ​ዶስ፡ ​ሖረ ፨ 
                                        ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ይቀ​ውም፡   (fol. 96r)   (a)   ​መጽ​አ፡ ​አሕ​ማር፡ ​ወበ​ጽሐ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​መር​ሶ፡ ​ወወ​ፅአ፡
                                         ፩  ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​እም​እለ፡ ​አሕ​ማር፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወቆ​መ፡ ​ማእ​ከለ፡ ​ወይ​ቤ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​እብ​ለከ፡ ​ኦዓ​ሣ፡ ​ዘተ​ሰረ​ቀ፡ ​ተመ​የጥ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሀገ​ሩ፡ ​ለዘ​አሥ​ገረ​ከ፡ ​ወቀ​ንፁ፡ ​ዓሣ​ተ፡
                                        ​ሐመ​ር፡ ​ወቦ​ኡ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ሐመ​ሩ፡ ​ለዝ​ኩ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡
                                          (b)   ​ዘተ​ሰር​ቁ፡ ​እም​ኔሁ ፨  ​ውእ​ቱሰ፡ ​ኃጥ​አ፡ ​ሕሊ​ናሁ፡ ​እም​ብዝ​ኃ፡
                                        ​አን​ክሮ፡ ​ወተ​ደሙ፡ ​አብ​ያጺ​ሁ፡ ​መሠ​ግራን ፤  ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡
                                        ​ወሬ​ዛ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​መድ​ኅነ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ውእቱ ፨  ​ወቦ​ኡ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሁ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡
                                        ​ጥብ​ርያ​ዶስ፡ ​መካ​ኑ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​የኃ​ድር፡ ​ወር​እዩ፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ገጹ፡ ​ወሣ​ዕሳ​አ፡ ​አፉ​ሁ፡ ​ወአ​ምኑ፡ ​ቦቱ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e8909PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፤
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e8925LIT6016MJCalf">
                  <fo:inline>IV-5) Fols 96vb–98ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: The stolen calf, CAe 6016.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                        ​በእን  (fol. 97r)   (a)  ​ተ፡ ​ዕጐ​ልት፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ተሰ​ርቀ​ት፡ ​እም​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ገሊላ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e8947PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​የሐ​ውር፡ ​አሐ​ተ፡ ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​ሰራ​ቂ፡ ​ዘሰ​ረቀ፡ ​ዕጐ​ልተ፡ ​እም​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ፍል​ስጥ​ዔም ፨ 
                                        ​ወረ​ከቦ፡ ​በዓ​ለ፡ ​ዕጐ​ልት፡ ​ለሰ​ራቂ፡ ​ወአ​ኀዞ፡ ​ወተ​በአ​ሱ፡  ፪ ​ሆሙ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡
                                        ​ይብ​ሉ፡ ​ዝዘ​ዚአ​የ፡ ​ውእቱ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ይዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡
                                        ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​የሐ​ውር፡ ​ይቤ፡  ፩  ​ለካ​ልኡ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወአ​ምነ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡
                                          (fol. 98r)   (a)   ​ቤቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ሕያ​ው፡ ​ቀዳ​ማዊ ፤  ​ወሰ​አሎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡
                                        ​ያብ​ሖ፡ ​ይኩ​ን፡ ​ሎቱ፡ ​ረድአ ፨  ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡
                                        ​ኢይ​ክል፡ ​መኑ​ሂ፡ ​ዘይ​ትቀ​ነይ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም፡ ​ይኩ​ነኒ፡ ​ረድአ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e8994PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9013LIT6017MJLion">
                  <fo:inline>IV-6) Fols 98ra–99va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: Jesus saves Joseph from a lion, CAe 6017.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡  ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​ይመ​ግቦ፡ ​ለፍ​ቁሩ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e9032PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ክ  (b)  ​ርስ​ቶስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                   </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​የሐ​ውር፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​እም​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ጥብ​ርያ​ዶስ፡ ​ወይ​ፈቅ​ድ፡ ​ይዕ​ርግ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ወም​ስሌ​ሁ፡ ​ፀራ​ቢ፡
                                        ​ዮሴፍ ፨  ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​የኃ​ልፍ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ገሊ​ላ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​ዮሴ​ፍ፡ ​አን​በሳ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይጸ​ንሕ፡ ​በፍ​ኖት፡ ​እስ​መ፡
                                        ​ይቀ​ድሞ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ርእ​ዮ፡ ​ፈር​ሃ፡ ​ዓቢ​የ፡ ​ፍር​ሃተ፡
                                        ​ወተ​ወለ​ጠ፡ ​ርእ​የተ፡ ​ገጹ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ይቤ​ሎ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ለአ​ንበ​ሳ፡ ​ሑር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡ ​እም​ሕዋ​ረ፡ ​ፍኖት ፨ 
                                        ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​ሮፀ፡ ​አን​በሳ፡ ​ወቦ​አ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡ ​ፍጡነ ፨  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​አኀ​ዞ፡ ​ለዮ​ሴፍ፡
                                        ​እዴ​ሁ፡ ​ወአ​ዕረ​ጎ፡ ​መል​ዕል​ተ፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ታቦ​ር፡ ​ወአ​ርአ​ዮ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​በህ​የ፡ ​ዘኢ​ርእ​የ፡ ​ቀዲሙ ፨ 
                                        ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​ተመ​ይጠ፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ናዝ​ሬት።
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወካ​ዕበ፡ ​ያር​እዮ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ስብ​ሐቲ​ሁ፡ ​ለገ  (fol. 99v)   (a)  ​ብሩ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e9075PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ አ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9088LIT6019MJAdulterous">
                  <fo:inline>IV-7) Fols 99va–101ava: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: The adulterous woman, CAe 6019.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​ፍት​ሕ፡ ​ዘገ​ብረ፡
                                        ​በብ​እሲ​ት፡ ​ዘማ​ዊት ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​ሀሎ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​በአ​ሐቲ፡ ​ዕለት ፨  ​ተጋ​ብኡ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሁ፡
                                        ​ሊቃ​ነ፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​ወጸ​ሐፍ​ቶሙ፡ ​ወሐ​ራሆሙ ፨  ​ወይ​ቤል​ዎ፡
                                         ን ​ሕነ፡ ​ነአ​ምር፡ ​ከመ፡ ​እም​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ተፈ​ኖከ ፨ 
                                        ​ወኵሉ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> (b)   ​ዘት​ገብ​ር፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወዓ​ቀሙ፡ ​ቅድ​ሜሁ፡ ​ብእ​ሲተ ፨  ​ወይ​ቤል​ዎ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​ዛቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡
                                        ​ዘመ​ወት ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወይ​ቤላ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ዑቂ፡ ​ርእ​ስኪ፡ ​ወኢ​ተዓ​ብሲ፡ ​ዳግ​መ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ኢይ​ርከ​ብኪ፡ ​ኵነ​ኔ፡ ​ዘአ​ልቦ​ቱ፡ ​መል​ክዕ ፨ 
                                        ​አን​ሰ፡ ​ኃደ​ጉ፡ ​ለኪ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተኪ ፨  ​ወወ​ፅአ​ት፡ ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ብእ​ሲት፡ ​ወቦ​አት፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​ወነ​ገረ​ት፡ ​ለሰ​ብእ፡ ​ዜና​ሁ፡
                                        ​በእ​ንቲ​አሃ ፨  ​ወአ​ምኑ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃን፡ ​በእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወሰ​ብሕ​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9170LIT3941Miracle">
                  <fo:inline>IV-8) Fols 101avb–101bvb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: Healing of the blind man by Jesus, CAe 3941.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃኒ ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ዘገ​ብረ፡ ​ለብ​እሲ፡
                                        ​ዕው​ር፡ ​ወጽ​ሙም፡ ​ወበ​ሐም፡ ​በሀ​ገረ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ከማ​ሁ፡ ​ይግ​በር፡ ​ትእ​ምር​ተ፡ ​ሠና​ይቱ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e9189PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወእ​ንዘ፡ ​የኃ​ልፍ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ሀገ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ፨  ​ርእ​የ፡
                                        ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘዕ​ውሩ፡ ​ተወ​ልደ፡ ​እም<fo:inline>ክ (!)</fo:inline>​ርሠ፡ ​እሙ፡ ​ዕው​ር፡ ​ወበ​ሐም ፨  ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ሰም​ዓ፡
                                        ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ጸር​ሐ፡ ​ወከ​ልሐ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ክሂ​ሎቱ ፨  ​ወይ​ቤሎ፡
                                        ​ስም  (fol. 101br)   (a)  ​ዖን፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እየ፡ ​ብፁ​ዕ፡ ​ዘአ​እመ​ረ፡ ​ዘየ​ኃሥ​ሥ፡ ​ዝዕ​ውር፡ ​ወበ​ሐም፡
                                        ​ወይ​ትዌ​ከፍ፡ ​ቃሎ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ቀር​በ፡ ​ኀቤ​ሁ፡ ​አን​በረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​እዴ​ሁ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ቲሁ፡ ​ወር​እየ ፨ 
                                        ​ወዓ​ዲ፡ ​አን​በረ፡ ​እም​እዘ​ኒሁ፡ ​ወሰ​ምዓ፡ ​ሶቤሃ ፨  ​ወአ​ሜሃ፡ ​ኮነ፡
                                         ፩  ​እም​እለ፡ ​ይስ​ብኩ፡ ​በስ​ሙ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡
                                        ​ኢየሱ  (b)  ​ስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶስ ፨  ​ወበ​እዲ​ሁ፡ ​ለዝ​ንቱ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​አም​ኑ፡ ​ብዙ​ኃን፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ፡ ​ወሖ​ሩ፡ ​ፈለ​ገ፡ ​ዮር​ዳኖ​ስ፡
                                        ​ወተ​ጠም​ቁ፡ ​በእ​ደ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​መጥ​ምቅ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9250LIT6020MJCrucifixion">
                  <fo:inline>IV-9) Fols 101bvb–103ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: The crucifixion Miracle of Jesus: The Passion, the Crucifixion, the death, and the burial of Jesus, CAe 6020.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡  ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡
                                        ​ወመ​ድኃ ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e9269PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወበ​ዕለ​ተ፡ ​አር​ብ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​አመ፡ ​ይስ​ቅል​ዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡  ​ወእ​ምዝ፡ ​አም​ጽኡ፡ ​ልብ​ሰ፡
                                        ​ሜላ  (fol. 102r)   (a)  ​ት፡ ​እም​አል​ባሰ፡ ​ነገ​ሥት፡ ​ወአ​ልበ​ስዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ ፨ 
                                        ​ወዓ​ዲ፡ ​አል​በስ​ዎ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌሁ፡ ​ልብ​ሰ፡ ​አሮ​ን፡ ​ወወ​ደዩ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ርእ​ሱ፡ ​አክ​ሉለ፡ ​ዘሦክ ፨  ​ወሖ​ሩ፡ ​ኀበ፡
                                        ​መካ​ን፡ ​ዘሀ​ለወ፡ ​ውስ​ቴቱ፡ ​ታቦ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዕ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወሰ​ቀሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡  ፪  ​ፈያ​ተ፡ ​ስሙ፡
                                        ለ ፩  ​ጥጦ​ስ፡ ​ለዝ​ንቱ፡ ​ሰቀ​ልዎ፡ ​በየ​ማኑ ፨  ​ወስ​መ፡
                                        ​ካል​ኡ፡ ​ዳር​ክስ፡ ​ወለ​ዝ፡ ​ሰቀ​ልዎ፡ ​በፀ​ጋሙ ፨  ​ወሶ​ቤሃ፡ ​ነሥ​ኡ፡ ​እም​ኔሁ፡ ​አል​ባሲ​ሁ፡
                                        ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡ ​ወተ​ዓፀ​ዉ፡ ​ሐራ፡ ​ላዕ  (fol. 103r)   (a)  ​ሌሁ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ይት​ፈጸ​ም፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ዳዊ​ት፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ዘይ​ቤ፡ ​ተካ​ፊሉ፡
                                        ​አል​ባስ​የ፡ ​ለር​እሶ​ሙ፡ ​ወተ​ዓፀ​ዉ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ዓራ​ዝየ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​ወም​ሕረ​ቱ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e9326PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                        ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨ ፨ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9346LIT6021MJApparitions">
                  <fo:inline>IV-10) Fols 103ra–104vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: Apparitions of Jesus after the ascension, CAe 6021.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ተአ​ምሪ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚእ<fo:inline>ዘ (!)</fo:inline>​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡
                                        ​ወአ​ምላ ​ክነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በረ​ከቱ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e9366PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                            ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ለ<fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፡
                                        <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፡
                                        <fo:inline> (!)</fo:inline>፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9390LIT6021MJApparitions#Apparition1">
                  <fo:inline>IV-10-1) Fols 103ra–103vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: Apparitions of Jesus after the ascension, CAe 6021.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወበ​ሳኒ​ታ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ባቲ፡ ​ተን​ሥአ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ 
                                        ​እምው  (b)  ​ስተ፡ ​መቃ​ብር፡ ​ወፅ​አ፡ ​ዜና፡ ​ትን​ሣኤ​ሁ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ኵላ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ወም​ድረ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ፡
                                        ​ወገ​ሊላ ፨  ​ወበ​ይእ​ቲ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​ተራ​ከቦ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡
                                        ለ ፪  ​ዕደው ፨  ​ወእ​ሙን​ቱ፡ ​ቀለ​ዮጳ፡
                                        ​ወኒ​ቆዲ​ሞስ፡ ​በው​ስተ፡ ​ፍኖ​ት፡ ​ማእ​ከለ፡ ​ኢየ​ሩሳ​ሌም፡ ​ወገ​ምዋስ ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወቀ​ንዑ፡ ​ላዕ​ለ፡ ​ምግ​ባሩ፡ ​ረበ​ናት፡ ​ወሊ​ቃነ፡ ​ካህ​ናት፡ ​ወቀ​ተል​ዎ፡ ​ወመ​ጠወ፡ <fo:inline>[...]</fo:inline> ​ነፍ​ሶ፡ ​ወቀ​በር​ዎ፡ ​ትማ​ልም። ​ወሠ​ሉስ፡ ​ዕለ​ት፡
                                        ​እም​አመ፡ ​ተቀ​ብረ ፨  ​ወሖ​ረ፡ ​እም​ኀቤ​ነ፡ ​አን​ስት፡ ​ዘኮ​ና፡ ​ይት​ለአ​ካሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡
                                         ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡  ​ወዜ​ነዋ​ነ፡ ​መድ​መመ፡ ​ነገ​ረ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይብላ ፨ 
                                        ​እስ​መ፡ ​ትማ​ልም፡ ​ሖር​ነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​መቃ​ብር ፨  ​ወረ​ከብ​ነ፡ ​ህየ፡
                                        ​መላ​እክተ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ወእ​ሙን​ቱ፡ ​አብ​ሰሩነ ፨  ​ትን​ሣኤ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡
                                         ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​እም​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መቃ​ብር ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​የሀ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ሌነ፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9464LIT6021MJApparitions#Apparition2">
                  <fo:inline>IV-10-2) Fols 104ra–104va: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: Apparitions of Jesus after the ascension, CAe 6021.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            ​ወሶ​በ፡ ​ተፈ​ጸመ፡ ፵ ​ዕለ​ት፡ ​እም​ድኅ​ረ፡ ​ትንሣ ​ኤሁ፡ ​እም​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መቃ​ብር ፨ 
                                            ​አስ​ተር​አዮ​ሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ኢ ​የሱ​ስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​ለአ​ርዳ​ኢሁ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡
                                            ​ተጋ​ብኡ<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline>
                                            ​ኵል​ክሙ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ደብ​ረ፡ ​ዘይት ፨  ​ወተ​ጋብ​ኡ፡ ​ህየ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ይቤ​ሎሙ። ​ወአ​ስተ​ርአ​ዮሙ፡
                                            ​ከመ፡  ፩  ​እም​ኔሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​አዓ​ርግ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት​የ፡ ​ወክ​ብር​የ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​አቡ​የ፡
                                            ​ወአ​ቡክሙ ፨
                                      </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​እስ​መ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ብየ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​አብ፡ ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት ፨  ​ወይ​ወር​ድ፡ ​ላዕ​ሌክ​ሙ፡
                                            ​ከመ፡ ​ርደ​ተ፡ ​ፀሐ​ይ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ወለ​እመ፡ ​ነበ​ረ፡ ​ምስ​ሌክ​ሙ፡ ​ይሜ​ህረ​ክሙ፡ ​ኵሎ፡ ​ዘት​ፈቅዱ ፨ 
                                            ​ወበ​ሀል​ዎቱ፡ ​ውስ​ቴት​ክሙ፡ ​ትገ​ብሩ፡ ​ተአ​ምራ​ተ፡ ​ዓበ​ይተ፡ ​ወእ​ፌን​ዎ፡ ​ኀቤ​ክሙ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ይት​ፈለ​ጥ፡ ​እም​ኔየ፡
                                            ​ወእ​ምአ  (fol. 104v)   (a)  ​ብ።
                                         </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                            
                                            ​ሣህ​ሉ፡ ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e9515PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>
                                            ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜ​ን፡
                                        </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9525LIT6021MJApparitions#Apparition3">
                  <fo:inline>IV-10-3) Fols 104va–104vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Miracle of Jesus: Apparitions of Jesus after the ascension, CAe 6021.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e9537LIT1631Homily">
                  <fo:inline>V) Fols 105ra–117rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Homily by the blessed Yāʿqob, bishop of Śǝrug on the Angel and the Thief’ (ድርሳን፡ ቃሉ፡ ዘቅዱስ፡ ወብጹዕ፡ ያዕቆብ፡ ኤጲስ፡ ቆጶስ፡ ዘሥሩግ፡ በእንተ፡ መልአክ፡ ወፈያታዊ፡), CAe 1631.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡  ​ወተ​ስፋ​የ፡ ​ወእ​ግዝ ​እት​የ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ትስ ​አል፡ ​ሊተ ፨  ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡
                                ወ ​ብፁ​ዕ፡ ​ያዕ​ቆብ፡ ​ኤጲ ​ስ፡ ​ቆጶ​ስ፡ ​ዘሥ​ሩግ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​ወፈ​ያታዊ ፨ 
                                ​ርድ​አኒ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡ ​ወል​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ሕያው ፨  ​ወአ​ብር​ህ፡ ​አዕ​ይን​ተ፡ ​አል​ባብ​የ፡ ​ከመ፡
                                ​እክ​ሥት<fo:inline>[፡]</fo:inline> ​ምሥ​ጢራ​ተ፡ ​ምን​ክራ​ቲከ ፨  ​ወአ​ጽን​ዓኒ፡
                                ከ ​መ፡ ​እግ​በር፡ ​ትእ​ዛዘ​ከ፡ ​ብከ፡ ​ጸን​ዓ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ጴ ​ጥሮ​ስ፡ ​ወሖ​ረ፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ማይ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​አኮ፡ ​ከመ​ዝ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ዳእ​ሙ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ኃጢ​አት​ነ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​ለከ፡ ​ዕረ​ፍተ። ​እም​ይእ​ዜሰ፡ ​ተመ​የጥ፡ ​ወግ​ባእ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ተግ​ባር​ከ፡ ​ይኄ​ይስ​ከ፡
                                ​እም​ዘ፡ ​ተዓ​ቅብ፡ ​ገነተ ፤  ​ለቡ፡ ​እን​ከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ቃል፡ ​ዘአ​ዘዘ​ከ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ትዕ​ቅባ፡ ​ለገ​ነት ፨ 
                                ​ውእ​ቱኬ፡ ​ዘጸ​ሐፈ፡ ​ሊተ፡ ​ዘን​ተ፡ ​መጽ​ሐፈ፡ ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ዘአ​ውረ​ሰነ፡ ​መን​ግሥ​ቶ፡ ​ሰማ​ያዊተ ፨ 
                                ​ዘሎ​ቱ፡ ክ  (b)  ​ብር፡ ​ወስ​ብሐ​ት፡ ​ወመ​ንግ​ሥት፡ ​ወኃ​ይል፡ ​ይእ​ዜኒ፡ ​ወዘ​ልፈ​ኒ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​አዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                     <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                
                                ​በረ​ከተ፡ ​ጸጋ​ሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡  ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡  ​የሃ​ሉ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡
                                ​ገብ​ሩ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e9605PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡
                                    ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                                ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​አሜን ፨  ​ወአ​ሜን ፤ 
                                ​ለይ​ኩን ፤  ​ለይ​ኩን ፨ ፨ ፨
                            </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true" font-family="Ludolfus" space-after="3mm" id="">
                  <fo:inline>VI) Fol. 117rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true"/>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Colophon</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block font-family="Ludolfus">
                              <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">The colophon states that this manuscript was commissioned by
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e9638PRS12911KidanaK">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline> who donated it to a church identified as
                                    Madḫāne ʿĀlam.
                                </fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em"> ​ዝመ​ጽሐ​ፍ፡ ዘ<fo:inline id="d1e9645PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ዘአ​ጽሐ​ፎ፡ ​በን ​ዋዩ፡ ​ወወ​ሀቦ፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኔ፡ ​ዓለም
                                 ።  ​ከመ፡ ​ይኩ​ኖ፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኒተ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ወነ​ፍስ፡ ​በዝ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ወበ​ዘይ​መጽ​እ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                ​አሜን ፨</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Colophon</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block font-family="Ludolfus">
                              <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">The colophon states that this manuscript was commissioned by
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e9638PRS12911KidanaK">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline> who donated it to a church identified as
                                    Madḫāne ʿĀlam.
                                </fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em"> ​ዝመ​ጽሐ​ፍ፡ ዘ<fo:inline id="d1e9645PRS12911KidanaK">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​ዘአ​ጽሐ​ፎ፡ ​በን ​ዋዩ፡ ​ወወ​ሀቦ፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኔ፡ ​ዓለም
                                 ።  ​ከመ፡ ​ይኩ​ኖ፡ ​ለመ​ድኃ​ኒተ፡ ​ሥጋ፡ ​ወነ​ፍስ፡ ​በዝ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​ወበ​ዘይ​መጽ​እ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡
                                ​አሜን ፨</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         space-before="2mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 5r: Amharic list of objects, mainly liturgical vessels and books belonging to a
                                        church identified as
                                        Madḫāne ʿĀlam, given by <fo:inline id="d1e10410PRS12911KidanaK">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>,
                                        ending with a condemnation. Among the objects is also a drawing on parchment.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">
                              <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኍል​ቈ፡ ​ንዋ​የ፡ ​ቅድ​ሳት፡ ​ዘመ​ድኃ​ኔ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                              <fo:inline id="d1e10417PRS12911KidanaK">​አባ፡  ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline> ​የሰ​ጡ፡
                                    ፫ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ፫ ​ጽና፡ ፩ ​ናስ፡ ​የደ​ም፡ ​ጽዋ፡
                                    ፩ ​ጠር​ሙስ፡ ፩ ​ቃጭ​ል፡ ፩ ​የና​ስ፡ ​ማብ​ርያ፡
                                    ፩ ​የፍ​ም፡ ​መጫ​ርያ፡ ​መረ​ዋት፡
                                    ፩ ​ጁህ፡ ​በር​ኖስ፡ ፩ ​ማኅ​ፈድ፡ ፩  ​ወን​ጌል፡ 
                                        ፩  ​ቅዳ​ሴ፡  ፩  ​ተአ​ምረ፡
                                            ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም ፡ ፩ ​መዝ​ገብ፡
                                        ፩ ​የብ​ራና፡ ​ሥዕ​ል፡
                                    ፪ ​ቤት፡ ​ያሹ​ሩት፡ ​በድ​ሙሩ፡ ​፳፩ ​ነው፡
                                    ​ይህ​ነን፡ ​የተ​ጻፈ​ውን፡ ​የሸ​ጠና፡ ​የሰ​ረቀ፡ ​የፋ​ቀ፡ ​በሥ​ልጣ​ነ፡ ​ጴጥሮ ስ ፡ ​ወጳ​ውሎ​ስ፡
                                    ​ውጉ​ዘ፡ ​ይኩ​ንx x x
                                    </fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 5r: An additional list of objects written in the same hand as additional note 1, separated from
                                        additional note 1 by a fine line.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus">​በ፯ ​ወቄ​ት፡ ​ከ፫ ​ድሪ​ም፡ ​የጕ​ልላ​ት፡ ​መስ​ቀል፡ ​የተ​ሰራ፡ ​ቍጽ​ሩ፡
                                    ​፲፱ ​ነው፡ ​ከቃ​ቤት፡ ​አለ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 7r: Note written in pale black ink in the upper inner corner of the folio, stating that this manuscript belonged to
                                        <fo:inline id="d1e10459INS0101MadhaneAlam">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//INS0101MadhaneAlam">Madḫāne ʿĀlam</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ተአ​ምረ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ዘቅ​ዱስ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e10464INS0101MadhaneAlam">​መድ​ኃኔ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         space-before="2mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 1r: Pen trial in black ink.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፈቲ​ነ፡ ​ብርዕ</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 1v: Pen trial in black ink.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፈቲ​ነብ​ርዕ</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 105r: Indication for liturgical reading in the upper margin written by the main hand.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘዓ​ርብ፡ ዘ ፱  ​ሰዓ​ት፡ ​ድር​ሳን ፨</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 8rb, 80rab, 110ra: Scribal corrections occur regularly interlineally or in the margins.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 58ra, 70va, 74vb: Scribal corrections occur rarely over erasures.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>6)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 45va, 90vb, 106ra: Rarely, erroneous characters are marked by dashes above and below.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>7)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 78ra: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                                        is added in a later hand in the space left for the rubricated name of Mary.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>8)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 122v: Note in pencil.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block/>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>9)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 1r: A white sticker, with the name of <fo:inline id="d1e10562PRS5782JuelJen">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡
                                            ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>) printed on it, and the signature
                                        ‘Ms. Aeth. d. 20 = Arch. O’ written in pencil, is  glued
                                        on fol. 1r. Another sticker with the signature ‘Ms 5’ printed on
                                        it is glued below it.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>10)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 1r: The title of the manuscript in transliteration is written in pencil.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block/>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>11)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 123r: Written in pencil.</fo:block>
                        <fo:block/>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>12)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 1r, 44v, 69v, 96v, 123v: Stamps.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                      The book is bound in wooden boards covered with reddish-brown blind-tooled leather. The front and back board are decorated with red velvet inlays.
                                      The boards are cut to the same size as the bookblock and present external shallow bevels.
                                    
                                      Full reddish brown leather cover.
                                      The turn-ins have been trimmed out and at the corners they form butt mitres.
                                      An additional leather patch has been added along the inner margin of the boards to fill the gap between the turn-ins.
                                      The cover shows a fine blind-tooled decoration, identical on both sides of the cover. The turn-ins and the edges are decorated as well.
                                      The decoration consists of seven concentric frames surrounding a central rectangular panel featuring a Latin cross.
                                      Frames composed by the repetition of single tools, enclosed between triple straight lines,
                                      alternate with empty ones.
                                      Proceeding from the outer to the inner frame, the repeating decoration motifs are criss-cross (two variants),
                                        wavy line, and straight strapwork elements.
                                      The cross is formed by curved dotted lines between single straight lines.
                                      At the ends of the arms of the cross there are corni-form motifs and three double circles.
                                      Double circles are also stamped at the intersections of the triple straight lines.
                                      Triple straight lines delimit six areas within the central panel.
                                      In the areas at the foot of the cross, the triple fillets form two triangles surmounted by five double circles.
                                      Just above, two grids are impressed.
                                      In the areas at the top, the straight lines cross each other to form two 6-pointed stars.
                                      Triple straight lines decorate the turn-ins where they form concentric frames, and the spine where they cross each other diagonally.
                                      Double circles decorate the edges of the boards.
                                    
                                      Slit-braid endbands are present.
                                    4
                                  Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern. Two S-plied threads are used.
                                  The sewing starts from the first quire where, for each pair of sewing stations, there is one length of thread in the centre-fold,
                                  while in the rest of the quires there are two.
                                
                                  The spine is formed by two overlapping layers of leather. The endbands are sewn through the first layer so that
                                  the tie-downs are hidden under the second layer.
                                </fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
            <fo:block>17 quires. I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (fols 1–6)</fo:inline> – X<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 70–77)</fo:inline> – XI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (fols 78–83)</fo:inline> – XII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 84–91)</fo:inline> – XIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 92–99)</fo:inline> – XIV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 101a–107)</fo:inline> – XV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 108–115)</fo:inline> – XVI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6 (fols 116–121)</fo:inline> – B<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">2 (fols 122–123)</fo:inline>II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 7–14)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">6+1 (s.l. 6/fols 15–21)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 22–29)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 30–37)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 38–45)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 46–53)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 54–61)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 62–69)</fo:inline> – </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 1va–117vb: 2
                                    columns (20 written lines)</fo:block>
                        <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">text area
                                            190 × 172mm (fol. 46r)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling pattern</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 1va–117vb: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
               <fo:table>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
                  <fo:table-body>
                     <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->
                              <fo:inline>Fine and regular handwriting. Regularly spaced characters.</fo:inline>
                              <fo:block>Ink: Black, red.</fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                    Incipits (one word to one or several lines, consecutive or alternating with black lines in different groupings);
                                    captions of miniatures; holy names (<fo:inline id="d1e9958PRS6819Mary">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline>, <fo:inline id="d1e9960PRS4377Gabriel">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS4377Gabriel">Gabriel</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline>,
                                    rarely <fo:inline id="d1e9962PRS5684JesusCh">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline>); the names of individuals related to the production of
                                    the manuscript (<fo:inline id="d1e9964PRS12911KidanaK">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline>,
                                    <fo:inline id="d1e9966PRS13031WaldaA">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS13031WaldaA">Walda ʾAbib</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline>, <fo:inline id="d1e9969PRS12964Gorgoryos">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12964Gorgoryos">Gorgoryos</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline>
                                 <fo:inline id="d1e9971PRS13026KenfaM">
                                    <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS13026KenfaM">Kǝnfa Mikāʾel</fo:basic-link>
                                 </fo:inline>); numerals; text dividers; elements of punctuation signs.
                                </fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                                provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                                start-indent="cm">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block hyphenate="true">አ, ​አሜ for ​አሜን (e.g. on fols 9rb, 13ra, 93ra, 96vb);</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block hyphenate="true">​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ for ​ሰላ​ም፡ ​ለኪ፡ (e.g. on fol. 29rb);</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block hyphenate="true">​ዓለ for ​ዓለመ, ​ዓለም (e.g. on fol. 103ra).</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                     <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline>Hand 2:</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->
                              <fo:inline>Hand of additional notes 1 and 2.</fo:inline>
                              <fo:block>Ink: Black.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-body>
               </fo:table>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
            <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm">The manuscript contains twenty framed miniatures in the Second Gondarine Style
                   that appear to have been executed by the same hand. The style of the miniatures bears comparison with that of firmly dated manuscripts
                   such as MS London, British Library, Or. 607 and MS London, British Library, Or. 646 suggesting that they were executed around the
                    mid-eighteenth century. The first and last pairs of miniatures of the manuscript function
                   as double-page openings. The Passion cycle at the end of the manuscript anachronistically opens with a representation of the Good Thief
                   at the Garden of paradise which functions as an explicit to the preceding homily. Interestingly, there is some attempt to differentiate
                   between the different donors who appear in some of the illustrations.
                 </fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>12)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 3v–4r: <fo:inline> The Trinity on the verso is framed
                      by an octagon and surrounded by the Tetramorph arranged in the
                      Angel, Eagle, Ox and Lion order. On the recto, the Twenty-Four Elders from the Book of Revelation,
                      bearing censers and crosses, turn their gaze towards the opposite page.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ሥሉ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ካህ​ናተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>13)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 5v: <fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e10073PRS4585Georgeo">St George</fo:inline> on horseback
spearing a dragon.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ጊዮ​ርጊስ</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>14)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 6r: <fo:inline>The Virgin <fo:inline id="d1e10093PRS6819Mary">Mary</fo:inline>
and Child <fo:inline id="d1e10096PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:inline>
 flanked by two angels. The main patron of the manuscript,
<fo:inline id="d1e10104PRS12911KidanaK">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>, is in proskynesis before them.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ሚካ​ኤል፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ፍቁ​ር፡ ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ከመ፡ ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e10111PRS12911KidanaK">​አባ፡  ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>15)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 19v: <fo:inline>The Covenant of Mercy
showing <fo:inline id="d1e10127PRS6819Mary">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e10129PRS5684JesusCh">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> under a canopy.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>16)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 20r: <fo:inline>The Dormition of <fo:inline id="d1e10144PRS6819Mary">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አዕ​ረፈ​ት፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>17)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 20r: <fo:inline>The Assumption of <fo:inline id="d1e10158PRS6819Mary">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፍል​ሰታ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>18)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 29v: <fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e10169PRS6819Mary">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>nursing the child
<fo:inline id="d1e10173PRS5684JesusCh">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> in the company of two figures (Joseph and Salome?).
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​አጥ​በወ​ቶ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>19)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 82v: <fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e10186PRS1246AbibBu">Abuna ʾAbib</fo:inline> casts himself from a tree
on to a cluster of blades. His namesake, <fo:inline id="d1e10192PRS1246AbibBu">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS1246AbibBu">Bulā</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>, is in proskynesis
beneath him.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              <fo:inline id="d1e10195PRS1246AbibBu">​አቡ​ነ፡ ​አቢ​ብ፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e10202PRS13031WaldaA">​ወል​ደ፡ ​አቢ​ብ፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>20)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 83r: <fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline id="d1e10213PRS9162TaklaHa">ʾAbuna Takla Hāymānot</fo:inline> in prayer.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              <fo:inline id="d1e10219PRS9162TaklaHa">​አቡ​ነ፡ ​ተክ​ለ፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት።</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>21)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 117v: <fo:inline>The Cherub and the Thief before the Garden of Paradise.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ገነ​ት፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዓቃ​ቤ፡ ​ገነ​ት፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ፈያ​ታይ፡ ​ዘየ​ማን፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>22)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 118r: <fo:inline>The Flagellation of
<fo:inline id="d1e10255PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus</fo:inline>.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ቀሠ​ፍዎ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እነ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>23)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 118v: <fo:inline>The Mocking of
<fo:inline id="d1e10270PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus</fo:inline>. A patron of the manuscript,
<fo:inline id="d1e10274PRS12964Gorgoryos">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12964Gorgoryos">Gorgoryos</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>, is in proskynesis in a
separate register beneath him. His white beard distinguishes him as older than the other donors.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ኵር​ዓተ፡ ​ርእ​ሱ፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e10281PRS12964Gorgoryos">​ጎር​ጎር​ዮስ፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>24)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 119r: <fo:inline>The Crucifixion of
<fo:inline id="d1e10293PRS5684JesusCh">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>.
The main patron of the manuscript, <fo:inline id="d1e10296PRS12911KidanaK">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>,
embraces the base of the cross which is flanked by
<fo:inline id="d1e10298PRS6819Mary">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e10300PRS5695John">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5695John">John</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>.

<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ተማ​ኅፀ​ነ፡ <fo:inline id="d1e10304PRS12911KidanaK">​አባ፡  ​ኪዳ​ነ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>25)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 119v: <fo:inline>The Entombment of
<fo:inline id="d1e10318PRS5684JesusCh">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዘከ​መ፡ ​ወደ​ይዎ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​መቃ​ብር፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>26)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 120r: <fo:inline>The Descent into Hell of
<fo:inline id="d1e10333PRS5684JesusCh">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> with <fo:inline id="d1e10335PRS1386Adam">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS1386Adam">Adam</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> and <fo:inline id="d1e10337PRS3926Eve">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS3926Eve">Eve</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ትን​ሣኤ፡</fo:inline>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                              <fo:inline id="d1e10344PRS1386Adam">​አዳ​ም፡</fo:inline>
                              <fo:inline id="d1e10347PRS3926Eve">​ሔዋ​ን፡</fo:inline>
                           </fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>27)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 120v: <fo:inline>The Ascension of
<fo:inline id="d1e10360PRS5684JesusCh">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> with <fo:inline id="d1e10362PRS6819Mary">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>, the Apostles, and numerous angels.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ዕር​ገት፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>28)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 121r: <fo:inline>Pentecost with <fo:inline id="d1e10376PRS6819Mary">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> and the Apostles.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ጰራ​ቅሊ​ጦስ፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>29)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fols 121v–122r: <fo:inline>The Second Coming of <fo:inline id="d1e10391PRS5684JesusCh">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5684JesusCh">Jesus Christ</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> with
<fo:inline id="d1e10393PRS6819Mary">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS6819Mary">St Mary</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> interceding on behalf of a group of souls.
<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ምጽ​አት፡</fo:inline>
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
               <fo:block>Small tears repaired on fols 18, 38, 85.
                                    </fo:block>
               <fo:block/>
               <fo:block/>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                                    There are slight traces of use, such as wear along the spine. Additionally, there are dirt stains in the lower margins
                                    up to fols 105r, , occasional ink smudges, e.g. on 71v;
                                    and stains, e.g. on fols 109–117.
                                    Furthermore, there is evidence of water damage, which has caused the wrinkling of the parchment and left imprints
                                    from the dyed leather covers on the first and last leaves.
                                </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                        
                            Taking into account the handwriting and miniatures, the manuscript can be dated to the
                            <fo:inline>eighteenth century</fo:inline>.
                            Several persons are mentioned in supplication formulas throughout the manuscript:
                            <fo:inline id="d1e10678PRS12911KidanaK">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline> and, less often,  <fo:inline id="d1e10680PRS12964Gorgoryos">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12964Gorgoryos">Gorgoryos</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline> and
                            <fo:inline id="d1e10682PRS13026KenfaM">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS13026KenfaM">Kǝnfa Mikāʾel</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline>.
           <!--I had created <persName ref="PRS13031WaldaA"/> before looking at the miniatures, he must be mentioned somewhere.
                            But I did not find him again in the text :(-->
                                <fo:inline id="d1e10687PRS12911KidanaK">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline> is also mentioned in the colophon
                            as the patron
                                and donor of the manuscript.
                                Miniatures depict <fo:inline id="d1e10692PRS12911KidanaK">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12911KidanaK">Kidāna Krǝstos</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <!--(<ref target="#d"/>)-->,
                            <fo:inline id="d1e10696PRS13031WaldaA">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS13031WaldaA">Walda ʾAbib</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <!--(<ref target="#d"/>)-->
                            and <fo:inline id="d1e10701PRS12964Gorgoryos">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS12964Gorgoryos">Gorgoryos</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <!--(<ref target="#d"/>)--> in the pose of donors.
                            The colophon and inventory state that the manuscript was part
                            of the property of a church dedicated to the Saviour of
                            the World (Madḫāne ʿĀlam). However, it is difficult to determine to which church these notes refer to, since many Ethiopian
                            and Eritrean
                            churches are named in his honour - including <fo:inline id="d1e10711INS0101MadhaneAlam">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//INS0101MadhaneAlam">Madḫāne ʿĀlam</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline>, from where the manuscript was
                            likely taken in 1868, and Gondar Madḫāne ʿĀlam, from where
                            <fo:inline id="d1e10713PRS9430Tewodros">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS9430Tewodros">Tewodros II</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline> took many manuscripts for his own capital.
                        
                        <!--Juel-Jensen states that this manuscript later belonged to M.G. Wall. I cannot find any evidence of this in the manuscript
                        (but also cannot read the pencil note at the end completely)-->
                        The manuscript must have come into the possession of the church of
                            <fo:inline id="d1e10720INS0101MadhaneAlam">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//INS0101MadhaneAlam">Madḫāne ʿĀlam</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline> at a
                            certain time in its history from where it was looted in
                            1868 and brought to England. It is unknown
                            how and when the manuscript came into the possession of <fo:inline id="d1e10722PRS5782JuelJen">
                     <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:basic-link>
                  </fo:inline>.
                    </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                      page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethd20">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethd20</fo:basic-link>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="BDLaethe30"
                      text-align="center"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid"
                      space-before="3mm">
               <fo:block font-weight="800">Bodleian Aeth. e. 30</fo:block>
               <fo:block>(<fo:inline>Juel-Jensen 10</fo:inline>)</fo:block>
               <fo:block/>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block text-align="center" space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Psalter</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm" space-after="3mm">Parchment codex, 174×113×63 mm, 140 fols, 18 quires. , 1800–1850.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Main Contents</fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11108LIT2701Dawit">
                  <fo:inline>I) Fols 1r–136vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Psalter (ዳዊት፡), incomplete, CAe 2701.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11115LIT2000Mazmur">
                  <fo:inline>I-1) Fols 1r–107r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Psalms of David’ (መዝሙረ፡ ዳዊት፡), CAe 2000.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ተግ​ሣጽ፡ ​ለኵ​ሉ፡ ​እጓ​ለ፡ ​እመ​ሕያ​ው።
                                     ​ፍካ​ሬ፡ ​ዘጻ​ድቃ​ን፡ ​ወዘ​ኃጥ​አን፡ ​መዝ​ሙር፡ ​ዘዳ​ዊት።
                                    ፩ ​ብፁ​ዕ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ዘኢ​ሖረ፡ ​በም​ክረ፡ ​ረሲ​ዓን።
                                     ​ወዘ​ኢቆ​መ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ኃጥ​አን።
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​አሜ​ሃ፡ ​ወድ​ቀ፡ ​በኃ​ይለ፡  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር።
                                    ​ወአ​ንሰ፡ ​ነሣ​እኩ፡ ​ዘእ​ምላ​ዕሌ​ሁ፡ ​ሰይ​ፈ።
                                     ​ወመ​ተር​ኩ፡ ​ርእ​ሶ፡ ​ለጎ​ልያ​ድ።
                                     ​ወአ​ሰሰ​ልኩ፡ ​ጽዕ​ለተ፡ ​እም​ደቂ​ቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል።
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11154LIT1828Mahale">
                  <fo:inline>I-2) Fols 107r–118r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11160LIT1828Mahale#Moses1">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-1) Fols 107r–108r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ዘቀ​ዳሚ​ት፡ ​ሕግ።
                                             ​፩። ​ንሴ​ብሕ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​ዘተ​ሰብ​ሐ።
                                        ​ፈረ​ሰ፡ ​ወመ​ስተ​ፅዕ​ነ፡ ​ወረ​ወ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ባሕ​ር።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወአ​ስተ​ጋብ​አ፡  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​ላዕ​ሌሆ​ሙ፡ ​ማየ፡ ​ባሕ​ር።
                                         ​ወደ​ቂቀ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ልሰ፡ ​ኃለ​ፉ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​የብ​ስ፡ ​በማ​ዕከ​ለ፡ 
                                        ​ማይ​ሰ፡ ​ሎመ፡ ​አረ​ፍት፡ ​በይ​ምን፡ ​ወአ​ረፍ​ት፡ ​በጽ​ግም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11198LIT1828Mahale#Moses2">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-2) Fols 108r–109r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘዳ​ግም፡ ​ሕግ።
                                         ​፪።  ​አጽ​ምዕ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ወእ​ንግ​ርከ።
                                         ​ወት​ስማ​ዕ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ቃል፡ ​አፉ​የ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወአ​ምዕ​ዑኒ፡ ​በአ​ማል​ክቲ​ሆሙ።
                                         ​ወአ​ነ፡ ​አቀ​ንዖ​ሙ፡ ​በዘ​ኢኮ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብ።
                                         ​ወአ​ምዕ​ዖሙ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ፡ ​በዘ​ኢይ​ሌብ​ዉ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11229LIT1828Mahale#Moses3">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-3) Fols 109r–110v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​ዘሣ​ልስ፡ ​ሕግ።
                                         ፫  ​እስ​መ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ትነ​ድድ፡ ​እመ​ዐት​የ።
                                         ​ወታ​ውዒ፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ታሕ​ተ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ይት​ቤቀ​ል፡ ​ወይ​ትፈ​ደይ፡ ​በቀ​ለ፡ ​ለፀ​ሩ፡
                                         ​ወይ​ትቤ​ቀሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለፀ​ላእ​ቱ።
                                         ​ወያ​ነጽ​ሕ፡  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​ምድ​ረ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝቡ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11264LIT1828Mahale#Hannah">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-4) Fols 110v–111v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሐና፡ ​እመ፡ ​ሳሙ​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                             ​፬፡  ​ጸን​ዓ፡ ​ልብ​የ፡ በ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ።
                                         ​ወተ​ለዓ​ለ፡ ​ቀር​ንየ፡ ​በአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ንየ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወው​እቱ፡ ​ጻድ​ቅ፡ ​ይኴ​ንን፡ ​እስ​ከ፡ ​አጽ​ናፈ፡ ​ምድ​ር።
                                         ​ወይ​ሁቦ​ሙ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ለነ​ገሥ​ትነ።
                                         ​ወያ​ሌዕ​ል፡ ​ቀር​ነ፡ ​መሢ​ሑ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11298LIT1828Mahale#Hezekiah">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-5) Fols 111v–112r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሕዝ​ቅያ​ስ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ይሁ​ዳ።
                                         ​፭፡  ​አን​ሰ፡ ​እቤ፡ ​በኑ​ኃ፡ ​መዋ​ዕል​የ።
                                         ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አና​ቅጸ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል፡ ​ኀደ​ጉ፡ ​ዘተ​ረፈ፡ ​ዓመ​ትየ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​እነ​ግር፡ ​ጽድ​ቀከ፡ ​በዳ​ኅና​የ።
                                         ​ወት​ረ፡ ​እሴ​ብሐ​ከ፡ ​ወእ​ዜም​ር፡ ​ለከ።
                                         ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት​የ። ​በቅ​ድመ፡ ​ቤተ፡  ​እግዚ
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11334LIT1828Mahale#Manasseh">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-6) Fols 112r–113r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ምና​ሴ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                         ​፮፡  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አኃ​ዜ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።
                                         ​አም​ላኮ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​በዊ​ነ። ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ይስ​ሐቅ፡ 
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​እሴ​ብሐ​ከ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ጊዜ፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​መዋ​ዕለ፡ ​ሐይ​ወት
                                        ​እስ​መ፡ ​ኪያ​ከ፡ ​ይሴ​ብሑ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ኃይ​ለ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት።   (fol. 113r) 
                                        ​ወለ​ከ፡ ​ሰብ​ሐት፡ ​ለዓ​ለመ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11374LIT1828Mahale#Jonah">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-7) Fol. 113r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዮና​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                             ​፯፡  ​ጸራ​ኅኩ፡ ​በም​ንዳ​ቤየ፡ ​ኀበ፡  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ አ
                                        ​ወሰ​ምዓ​ኒ፡ <fo:inline>በወለተ፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ከር​ሠ፡ ​ሲኦ​ል።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​እስ​ከ፡ ​ዓቀ​ቡ፡ ​ከን​ቶ፡ ​ወሐ​ሰተ፡ ​ገደ​ፉ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎሙ።
                                         ​አን​ሰ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ሰብ​ሐት፡ ​በተ​ጋን​ዮ፡ ​እሠ​ውዕ፡ ​ለከ።
                                         ​መጠ​ነ፡ ​ጸለ​ይኩ፡ ​በሕ​ይወ​ትየ፡ ​አዓ​ሥዮ፡ ለ ​እግ​ዚአ
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11418LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths1">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-8) Fols 113r–114r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዳን​ኤል፡ ​ነቢ​ይ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​ዘእ​ምአ
                                             ፰  ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ።
                                          ​እኵ​ት፡ ​ወስ​ቡሕ፡ ​ስም​ከ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                         ​ይት​ኃፈ​ሩ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ትእ​ግል​ቶሙ፡ ​ወይ​ትቀ​ጥቅ​ጥ።
                                          ​ወያ​እም​ሩ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​አን​ተ፡  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​አም​ላክ፡ ባ
                                         ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ወበ​ኵሉ፡ ​ዓለ​ም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11462LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths2">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-9) Fols 114r–114v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ሠለ​ስቱ፡ ​ደቂ​ቅ።
                                             ​፱፡  ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡  ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡  ​አም​ላከ፡ ​አበ​ዊነ።
                                          ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም።
                                         ​ቡሩ​ክ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​በመ​ልዕ​ልተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት።
                                         ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወክ​ቡር​ኒ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11497LIT1828Mahale#ThreeYouths3">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-10) Fols 114v–115r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ኀበ፡ ​ባረ​ኩ፡ ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወአ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል። ​ለእ​ግዚአ
                                            ​፲ይ  ​ባር​ክዎ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ግብ​ረ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ለእ ​ግዚ ​አብ​ሔር።
                                          ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ይባ​ርክ​ዎ፡ ​አና​ንያ፡ ​ወአ​ዛር​ያ፡ ​ወሚ​ሳኤ​ል፡ ​ለእ<fo:inline>[​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር።]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ንባ​ርኮ፡ ​ለአ​ብ፡ ​ወወ​ልድ፡ ​ወመ​ንፈ​ስ፡ ​ቅዱ​ስ።
                                         ​ስቡ​ሕኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ወል​ዑል​ኒ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ለዓ​ለም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11537LIT1828Mahale#Habakkuk">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-11) Fols 115r–116v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እን​ባቆ​ም፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                         ​፲፩  ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​ሰማ​ዕኩ፡ ​ድም​ፀከ፡ ​ወፈ​ራህ​ኩ።
                                         ​ርኢ​ኩ፡ ​ግብ​ረከ፡ ​ወአ​ንከ​ርኩ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላኪ​የ፡ ​ወኃ​ይል​የ።
                                         ​ዘይ​ሠር​ዖን፡ ​ለእ​ገር​የ፡ ​ወለ​ፍጻ​ሜየ።   (fol. 116v) 
                                        ​ወዲ​በ፡ ​ልዑ​ላት፡ ​ያጼ​ዕነ​ኒ። ​ከመ፡ ​እማ​ዕ፡ ​በመ​ኃልዪ
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11574LIT1828Mahale#Isaiah">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-12) Fols 116v–117r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ኢሳ​ይያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                         ​፲፪  ​በሌ​ሊት፡ ​ትገ​ይስ፡ ​መን​ፈስ​የ፡ ​ኀቤ​ከ፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡ ​አም<fo:inline>[​ላኪ​የ።]</fo:inline>
                                        ​እስ​መ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡ ​ትእ​ዛዝ​ከ፡ ​በዲ​በ፡ ​ምድ​ር።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ሑር፡ ​ሕዝ​ብየ፡ ​ወባ​እ፡ ​ቤተ​ከ።  ​ወዕ​ፁ፡ ​ኆኅ​ተከ።
                                         ​ወተ​ኃባ​እ፡ ​ሕዳ​ጠ፡ ​ምዕ​ረ።
                                         ​እስ​ከ፡ ​የኃ​ልፍ፡ ​መዐ​ዓቱ፡ ለ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔር ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11611LIT1828Mahale#Mary">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-13) Fols 117r–117v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​እግ​ዝእ​ትነ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ።
                                         ​፲፫፡  ​ተዓ​ብዮ፡ ​ነፍ​ስየ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር።
                                         ​ወት​ትኃ​ሠይ፡ ​መን​ፈስ​የ፡ ​በአ​ምላ​ኪየ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ንየ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ወተ​ወክ​ፎ፡ ​ለእ​ስራ​ኤል፡ ​ቍል​ዔሁ።
                                         ​ወተ​ዘከ​ረ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡ ​ዘይ​ቤሎ​ሙ፡ ​ለአ​በዊ​ነ።   (fol. 117v) 
                                        ​ለአ​ብር​ሃም፡ ​ወለ​ዘር​ኡ፡ ​እስ<fo:inline>ለ (!)</fo:inline>፡ ​ለዓ​ለም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11648LIT1828Mahale#Zachariah">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-14) Fol. 117v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ዘካ​ርያ​ስ፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                         ​፲፬  ​ይት​ባረ​ክ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​አም​ላከ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል።
                                         ​ዘተ​ሠሃ​ለኒ፡ ​ወገ​ብረ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ተ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝበ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ለዘ​ሐወ​ጸነ፡ ​እም​አር​ያም። ​ወሠ​ረቀ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ያር​እዮ​ሙ፡ 
                                        ​ለእ​ለ፡ ​ይነ​ብሩ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ጽል​መት፡ ​ወጽ​ላሎ​ተ፡ ​ሞት።
                                         ​ከመ፡ ​ያር​ትዕ፡ ​እገ​ረነ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ፍኖ​ተ፡ ​ሰላ​ም።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11682LIT1828Mahale#Simeon">
                  <fo:inline>I-2-15) Fols 117v–118r: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">Book of Odes (መሓልየ፡ ነቢያት፡), CAe 1828.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​፲፭ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ስም​ዖን፡ ​ነቢ​ይ።
                                        ​ይእ​ዜ፡ ​ትሥ​ዕሮ፡ ​ለገ​ብር​ከ። ​በሰ​ላም፡ ​እግ​ዚኦ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ዘአ​ስተ​ዳሎ​ከ፡ ​ቅድ​መ፡ ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሕዝ​ብከ።
                                         ​ከመ፡ ​ትክ​ሥት፡ ​ብር​ሃነ፡ ​ለአ​ሕዛ​ብ።
                                         ​ወክ​ብረ፡ ​ለሕ​ዝብ​ከ፡ ​እስ​ራኤ​ል።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11712LIT2362Songof">
                  <fo:inline>I-3) Fols 118r–123v: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Song of Songs’ (መሓልየ፡ መሓልይ፡), CAe 2362.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​መኀ​ልየ፡ ​መኀ​ልይ፡ ​ዝው​እቱ፡ ​ዘሰ​ሎሞ​ን።
                                     ​፩፡  ​ይስ​ዕመ​ኒ፡ ​በስ​ዕመ​ተ፡ ​አፉ​ሁ።
                                     ​አዳ​ም፡ ​አጥ​ባት​ኪ፡ ​እም​ወይ​ን።
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይነ​ብር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገነ​ት፡ ​ካል​አን፡ <fo:inline>ረይዎ (!)</fo:inline>።
                                     ​ቃለ​ከ፡ ​አስ​ምዓ​ኒ።
                                     ​ጕይ፡ ​አን​ተ፡ ​ወል​ድ፡ ​እኁ​የ፡ ​ወተ​መሰ​ላ፡ ​ለወይ
                                    ​ወእ​መ፡ ​አኮ፡ ​ከመ፡ ​ወሬ​ዛ፡ ​ኃይ​ል፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አድ​ባረ፡ 
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11758LIT2509Weddas">
                  <fo:inline>I-4) Fols 124ra–133ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11764LIT2509Weddas#Monday">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-1) Fols 124ra–124vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሰ​ኑይ፡ ​ፈቀ​ደ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ፡ ​ያግ​ዕዞ፡ ​ለአ​ዳም፡ ኅ ​ዙነ፡ ​ወት​ኩዘ፡ ​ልብ፡ ​ወያ​ግብ​ኦ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ዘት​ካት፡ ​መንበ ​ሩ።
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት። ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​በሥ​ጋ፡ ​እም​ድንግ ​ል፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ዘር​ዓ፡ ​ብእ​ሲ፡ ​ወአ​ድኃ​ነነ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወረ​ሰይ​ካ፡ ​ለሔ​ዋን፡ ​አግ​ዓዚ​ተ፡ ​እም​ፃዕ​ረ፡ ​ሞት፡ ​ወወ​ሀብ​ከነ፡ ​መን​ፈሰ፡ ​ልደ​ት፡ ​ባረ​ክና​ከ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ቲከ።
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11790LIT2509Weddas#Tuesday">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-2) Fols 124vb–126rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሠ​ሉስ። ​አክ​ሊለ፡ ​ምክ​ህነ፡ ​ወቀ​ዳሚ​ተ፡  ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትነ፡ ​ወመ​ሠረ​ት፡
                                        ​ንጽ​ሕነ፡ ​ኮነ፡ በ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ወለ​ደት፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ዘእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር፡ ​ቃለ፡ ​ዘኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ትነ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ይሰ​ፍሑ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሆ​ሙ፡ ​ወይ​ብሉ፡ ​ዝን​ቱ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ንጉ​ሠ፡ ​ስብ​ሐት፡ ​መጽ​አ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ፡ ​ዓለ​ም፡ ​በዕ​በየ፡ ​ሣህ​ሉ።
                                        ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅድ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11816LIT2509Weddas#Wednesday">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-3) Fols 126rb–128ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘረ​ቡዕ። ​ኵሉ፡ ​ሠራ​ዊተ፡ ​ሰማ​ያት፡ ​ይብ​ሉ፡  ​ብፅ​ዕት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡
                                        ​ሰማ​ይ፡ ​ዳግ​ሚት፡ ​ዲበ፡ ​ምድ​ር፡ ​ኆኅ​ተ፡ ​ምሥ​ራቅ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  (fol. 126v)   (a)   ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ከብ​ካብ፡ ​ንጹ​ሕ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወአ​ንሶ​ሰወ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​እስ​መ፡ ​መሐ​ሪ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​መፍ​ቀሬ፡ ​ሰብ​እ፡ ​አድ​ኃነ፡ ​ነፍ​ሳቲ​ነ፡ ​በም​ጽአ​ቱ፡  ​ቅዱ​ስ። ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11846LIT2509Weddas#Thursday">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-4) Fols 128ra–130ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሐ​ሙሰ።  ​ዕፀ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ርእ​የ፡ ​ሙሴ፡ ​በነ​ደ፡ ​እሳ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ገዳ​ም፡ ​ወአ​ዕጹ​ቂሃ፡ ​ኢት​ውዒ፡ ​ትመ​ስል፡
                                         ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ርኵ​ስ፡
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ወኮ​ነ፡ ​ሰብ​አ፡ ​ከማ​ነ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ኃጢ​አት፡ ​ባሕ​ቲታ፡ ​ወተ​ወል​ዳ፡ ​በቤ​ተ፡ ​ልሔ​ም፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ሰበ​ኩ፡ ​ነቢ​ያት፡ ​አድ​ኃነ​ነ፡ ​ወቤ​ዜወ​ነ፡ ​ወረ​ሰየ​ነ፡ ​ሕዝ​በ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ።
                                        ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅድ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11875LIT2509Weddas#Friday">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-5) Fols 130ra–131rb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘዓ​ርብ።  ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡ ​እም​አን​ስት፡ ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ፡ ኦ ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ዘእ​ንበ​ለ፡ ​ርኵ​ስ፡ ​ሠረ​ቀ፡ ​ለነ፡
                                        ​እም​ኔኪ፡ ​ፀሐ​የ፡ ​ጽድ​ቅ። ​ወአ​ቅረ​በነ፡ ​ታሕ​ተ፡ ​ክነ​ፊሁ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​በእ​ንተ​ዝ፡ ​ንዌ​ድስ​ኪ፡ ​በከ​መ፡ ​ገብ​ርኤ​ል፡ ​መል​አክ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ንብ​ል፡ ​ቡር​ክት፡ ​አን​ቲ፡  ​ማር​ያም፡  ​ወቡ​ሩክ፡ ​ፍሬ፡ ​ከር​ሥኪ።
                                        ​ተፈ​ሥሒ፡ ​ኦምል<fo:inline>[ዕ]</fo:inline>​ተ፡ ​ጸጋ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ ​ምስ​ሌኪ። ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11904LIT2509Weddas#Saturday">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-6) Fols 131rb–132ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘቀ​ዳሚ​ት፡ ​ሰን​በት።  ​ንጽ​ሕት፡ <fo:inline>ወብርዘት፡ (!)</fo:inline> ​ወቅ​ድስ​ት፡
                                        ​በኵ​ሉ፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ሐቀ​ፈቶ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​እ፡ ​በእ​ራኅ። ​ወኵ​ሉ፡ ​ፍጥ​ረት፡ ​ይት​ፌሥ​ሑ፡ ​ምስ​ሌሃ፡ ​እን​ዘ፡ ​ይጸ​ርሑ፡ ​ወይ​ብሉ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ኄር፡ ​መድ​ኃኒ​ነ፡ ​ይም​ሐረ​ነ፡ ​ወይ​ሣሃ​ለነ፡ ​ይሥ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ​ነ። ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅ።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11929LIT2509Weddas#Sunday">
                  <fo:inline>I-4-7) Fols 132ra–133ra: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Praise of Mary’ (ውዳሴ፡ ማርያም), CAe 2509.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ዘሰ​ንበ​ት፡ ​ክር​ስቲ<fo:inline>[​ያን፡]</fo:inline>
                                        ​ተሰ​መይ​ኪ፡ ​ፍቅ​ርተ፡ ​ኦቡ​ርክ​ት፡ ​እም​አን​ስት። ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ውእ  (b)  ​ቱ፡ ​ዳግ​ሚት፡ ​ቀመ​ር፡ ​እን​ተ፡ ​ትሰ​መይ፡ ​ቅድ​ስተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን፡ ​ወው​ስቴ​ታ፡ ​ጽላ​ተ፡ ​ኪዳ​ን፡
                                        ፲ ​ቃላ​ት፡ ​እለ፡ ​ተጽ​ሕፉ፡ ​በአ​ፃብ​ዒሁ፡ ​ለእ​ግዚ​አብ​ሔር።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        
                                        ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ኀበ፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ፡
                                        ​ያጽ​ንዓ​ነ፡ ​በር​ትዕ​ት፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አሚ​ነ፡ ​ዚአ​ሁ። ​ይጸ​ግወ​ነ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡
                                        ​ወም​ሕረ​ቶ፡ ​ይስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አተ​ነ፡ ​በብ​ዝኃ፡ ​ምሕ​ረቱ። ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት።
                                    </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block hyphenate="true"
                         font-family="Ludolfus"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         id="d1e11954LIT1113Anqasa">
                  <fo:inline>I-5) Fols 133ra–136vb: <fo:inline xml:lang="en" hyphenate="true">‘Gate of Light’ (አንቀጸ፡ ብርሃን፡), incomplete, CAe 1113.</fo:inline>
                  </fo:inline>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">The text ends abruptly due to material loss.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Incipit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    ​ውዳ​ሴ፡ ​ወግ​ናይ፡ ​እሙ፡   ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​ወብ​ፅዕ​ት፡  ​ስብ​ሕት፡ ​ወቡ​ርክ​ት፡ ​ክብ  (b)  ​ርት፡ ​ወል​ዕል​ት፡ ​አን​ቀጸ፡ ​ብር​ሃን፡
                                    ​ማዓ​ርገ፡ ​ሕይ​ወት፡ ​ወማ​ኅደ​ረ፡ ​መለ​ኮት፡ ​ቅድ​ስተ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን። ​አን​ቲ፡ ​ውእ​ቱ፡ ​ኦእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​ማር​ያም፡ ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ተሰ​መይ​ኪ፡
                                    ​ሥም​ረተ፡ ​አብ፡
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block start-indent="10mm">Explicit: <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                    
                                    ​አን​ቲ፡ ​በአ​ማን፡ ​ዘኮ​ንኪ፡ ​ምክ​ህ፡ ​ለዘ​ምደ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን፡ ​ወብ​ኪ፡ ​ቅሩ​ባነ፡ ​ኮነ፡ ​እም​ድር፡ ​ለማ​ኅደ​ር፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​አር​ያም፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​ተሠ​ግዎ​ቱ፡
                                    ​ለወ​ልደ፡ ​አም​ላክ፡ ​አም​ኔኪ፡ ​ስዕ​ለት፡ ​ለነ​ፍሳ​ቲነ፡ ​ሕይ​ወተ፡ ​ኦጸ​ጋዊ​ተ፡ ​ምሕ​ረት፡ ​ለእ​ለ፡ የ
                                </fo:inline>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         space-before="2mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Additional notes</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. ir: 
                                        Note mentioning the angels, the martyrs, the <fo:inline id="d1e12550PRS12016Evangelists">Four Living Beasts</fo:inline>,
                                        the <fo:inline id="d1e12553PRS12519TwentyFour">Twenty-Four Heavenly Priests</fo:inline>, the fifteen prophets, the twelve apostles,
                                        the four evangelists, the <fo:inline id="d1e12556PRS11432FathersNicae">318 Fathers</fo:inline>, and <fo:inline id="d1e12559PRS5741Johnthe">John the Baptist</fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ት፡ ​ሃይ​ማኖ​ት። ​ወጸ​ሐፍ፡ ​አስ​ማቲ​ሆሙ፡ ​ምስ​ለ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ወሰ​ማዕ​ት፡ ​በጸ​ሎታ፡ ​ለእ​ግዝ​እት​ነ፡ ​ወላ​ዲተ፡ ​አም​ላክ። ​በሊ​ቀ፡ ​መላ​እክ​ት፡ ​ወበ​ገዜ​ናዊ፡ ​ትፍ​ሥሕ​ት፡
                                        ​በሱ​ራፌ​ል፡ ​ወበ​ኪሩ​ቤል። ​ወበ፬ ​እን​ስሳ። ​ወበ​፳ወ፬ ​ካህ​ናተ፡ ​ሰማ​ይ። ​ወበ​ጸሎ​ቶሙ፡ ​ለቅ​ዱሳ​ን፡ ​ወመ​ላእ​ክት። ​በ፲​ወ፭ ​ነቢ​ያት። ​፲ወ፪ ​ሐዋ​ርያ​ት። ​ወበ፬ ​ወን​ጌላ​ውያ​ን።
                                        ​ወበ​፫፻​፲ወ፰ ​ማኅ<fo:inline>[በ]</fo:inline>​ረ፡ ​ቅዱ​ሳን። ​ወበ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ዮሐ​ንስ፡ ​መጥ​ምቅ። ​ድን​ግል፡ ​ወካ​ህን፡ ወ
                                    </fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. iiv: 
                                        Note written in the same hand as additional note 1, prescribing the reading of the ‘Prayer of penance’ (perhaps <fo:inline>
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT4523Prayer">“Prayer of the penance over the water” (ጸሎተ፡ ንስሓ፡), CAe 4523</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline>)
                                        and containing formulas concerning the remission of sins.
                                    </fo:block>
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">
                                        ​ታን​ብብ፡ ​ጸሎ​ተ፡ ​ንስ​ሐ። ​ወት​ብል፡ ​እግ​ዚእ​ነ፡ ​ወአ​ምላ​ክነ፡ ​ወመ​ድኃ​ኒነ፡ ​ኢየ​ሱስ፡ ​ክር​ስቶ​ስ። ​ንስ​እለ​ከ፡ ​ወና​ስተ​በቍ​ዓከ፡ ​በእ​ንተ፡ ​እሉ፡ ​አግ​ብር​ቲከ፡
                                        ​አበ​ዊነ፡ ​ወአ​ኃዊ​ነ፡ ​እለ፡ ​ቆሙ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ክር​ስቲ​ያን​ከ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ ​እለ፡ ​ሀለ​ዉ፡ ​ውስ​ተ፡ ​ቤተ፡ ​ጸሎ​ት፡ ​ወይ​ኩኑ፡ ​ፍቱ​ሐነ፡ ​በአ​ፈ፡ ​መን​ፈስ፡
                                        ​ቅዱ​ስ፡ ​ወበ​አፈ፡ ​ዚአ​የኒ፡ ​አነ፡ ​ገብ​ርከ፡ ​ኃጥ​እ። ​እገ​ሌ። ​ባር​ኮሙ፡ ​ወስ​ረይ፡ ​ኃጢ​አቶ​ሙ፡ ​ዘገ​ብሩ፡ ​በአ​እም​ሮ፡ ​እመ​ሂ፡ ​በቃ​ል።
                                        ​አው፡ ​በም​ግባ​ር፡ ​ወእ​መሂ፡ ​በሕ​ሊና። ​ፍት​ሖሙ፡ ​እግ​ዚአ
                                    </fo:inline>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         space-before="2mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Varia</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>A white sticker is glued to the inner side of the front board. The name of <fo:inline id="d1e12597PRS5782JuelJen">
                              <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu//PRS5782JuelJen">Bent Juel-Jensen</fo:basic-link>
                           </fo:inline> is printed on it
                                        (<fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ቤን​ት፡ ​ዩው​ል፡ ​የን​ሰን።</fo:inline>) and the signature ‘MS. Aeth. e. 30’ is written in pencil.
                                        An additional sticker, with the signature ‘Ms 10’ on it, is glued below it.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. ir: Recent note written in pencil and barely legible, containing minimal descriptive information on the manuscript
                                            (subject of the miniatures, shelfmark, contents, age).</fo:block>
                        <fo:block/>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>3)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 1r, 1v, 2v: Some words are poorly written in green ink and mostly effaced at the side of the text.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fol. 17r: Writings in a blue pen, in a poor hand, on the upper and lower margin of the text area.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Psalms are all numbered, except for Ps 87 (fols 62v, ). Ps 138 is erroneously indicated as 137 (99v).
                                        The midpoint of the Psalms of David is indicated with the word <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መን​ፈቁ፡</fo:inline>, encircled in red ink,
                                        on 55r.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Binding</fo:block>
                                  The book is bound in wooden boards covered with reddish-brown tooled leather
                                  and enclosed in a textile chemise.
                                
                                  The boards are cut to the same size as the bookblock and present external shallow bevels. The grain runs vertically.


                                
                                      Reddish-brown upper and lower leather cover, the back is missing.
                                      The turn-ins have been trimmed out and at the corners form butt mitres. The two edges are then sewn together.
                                      The cover shows a faint blind tooled decoration, identical on both sides of the cover. The turn-ins are decorated as well.
                                      The decoration consists in three concentric frames surrounding a central rectangular panel featuring a Latin cross.
                                      Frames composed by the repetition of single hand tools enclosed between double straight lines
                                      alternate with empty ones. The outer frame presents a criss-cross motif while in the inner
                                      frame wavy lines form an interlaced motif. The arms of the cross are formed by the repetition of
                                      X-Form between possibly single straight lines. Double circles are printed at
                                      the intersections of the double straight lines and at the end of the arms of the cross.
                                      The turn-ins are decorated with single straight lines crossing each other.
                                      The book is wrapped in a protective flower-printed cotton chemise with a long stripe extending from the tailcap
                                      to cover the three edges of the codex.
                                    4
                                      Chainstitch sewing on four sewing stations (two pairs); periodic fold pattern. Two Z-plied threads are used.
                                      The sewing starts from the first quire where for each pair of sewing stations, there is one length of thread in the centre-fold,
                                      while in the rest of the quires there are two.
                                      The notches cut in the upper and lower cover in correspondence with the board attachment sites indicate that the
                                      attachment has been repaired removing only the back cover.
                                
                                      The rows of holes close to the head and tail of the quires could indicate the former presence of endbands or quire tackets.
                                
                                      A red leaf tab marker is inserted in the upper outer corner of fol. 66.
                                </fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Quire structure</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-after="3mm">
                                         Undecorated quire marks are written in the upper inner margin of the first folio of each quire. Some of them are nearly illegible.
                                     </fo:block>
            <fo:block>18 quires. A<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">3 (s.l. 3 added/fols i–iii)</fo:inline> – IX<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 65–72)</fo:inline> – X<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 73–80)</fo:inline> – XI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 81–88)</fo:inline> – XII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 89–96)</fo:inline> – XIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (fols 97–106)</fo:inline> – XIV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (fols 107–116)</fo:inline> – XV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (fols 117–126)</fo:inline> – XVI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">10 (fols 127–136)</fo:inline> – B<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">0+1 (s.l. 1, two stubs before 1/fols 137–137)</fo:inline>I<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 1–8)</fo:inline> – II<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 9–16)</fo:inline> – III<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 17–24)</fo:inline> – IV<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 25–32)</fo:inline> – V<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 33–40)</fo:inline> – VI<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 41–48)</fo:inline> – VII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 49–56)</fo:inline> – VIII<fo:inline font-size="7pt" vertical-align="text-top">8 (fols 57–64)</fo:inline> – </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Layout</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>1)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 1ra–123v: 1
                                    column (24 written lines)</fo:block>
                        <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">text area
                                            128 × 91mm (fol. 33r)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-after="3mm">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>2)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 124ra–136vb: 2
                                    columns (24–25 written lines)</fo:block>
                        <fo:block start-indent="10mm" space-before="3mm" space-after="3mm">text area
                                            125 × 87mm (fol. 127r)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic" space-after="3mm">Ruling pattern</fo:block>
               <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>4)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 1ra–123v: Ruling pattern: 1A-1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>5)</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>Fols 124ra–136vb: Ruling pattern: 1A-1A-1A1A/0-0/0-0/C.</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Palaeography</fo:block>
               <fo:table>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="1" column-width="15%"/>
                  <fo:table-column column-number="2" column-width="85%"/>
                  <fo:table-body>
                     <fo:table-row space-after="2mm">
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline>Hand 1:</fo:inline>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                        <fo:table-cell>
                           <fo:block hyphenate="true"><!-- {fo:tei2fo($handnote/tei:seg[@type='script'])}{' '}-->
                              <fo:inline>
                                  Fine handwriting, sometimes uneven in size and thickness (e.g. on fols 23r, 24r, 29r).
                                </fo:inline>
                              <fo:block>Ink: Black, red</fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Rubrication: 
                                   Several groups of lines on the incipit pages, alternating with black lines; numbers and titles of the psalms and of the
                                    canticles; incipits and numbers of the songs; holy names; the word <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​መን​ፈቁ፡</fo:inline> indicating the midpoint of the
                                    Psalms of David; name, number, and traditional interpretation of the Hebrew letters in Ps 118;
                                    some letters, alternating with black letters, of the first word of each line (generally <fo:inline font-family="Ludolfus" letter-spacing="0.5pt" font-size="0.9em">​ይባ​ርክ​ዎ፡</fo:inline>)
                                    of the Third song of the Three Youths; elements of the punctuation signs, text dividers, and numerals, included quire marks.
                                </fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Abbreviations: <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="6mm"
                                                provisional-label-separation="6mm"
                                                start-indent="cm">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline>1)</fo:inline>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​እግ, ​እግዚ or ​እግ​ዚአ for ​እግ​ዚአ​ብሔ​ር፡ (e.g. Fol. 115r)
                                    </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline>2)</fo:inline>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ስ for ​ስቡ​ሕ፡ (e.g. Fol. 115r)
                                    </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline>3)</fo:inline>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅድ፡ or ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅ፡ for ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ (e.g. Fols 126rb, 128ra, 130ra)
                                    </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline>4)</fo:inline>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block hyphenate="true">
                                        ​ወ፡ ​ሣ፡ ​ይ፡ ​ሰ፡ ​ለ፡ ​ቅ፡ for ​ወል​ድኪ፡ ​ሣህ​ሎ፡ ​ይክ​ፍለ​ነ፡ ​ሰአ​ሊ፡ ​ለነ፡ ​ቅድ​ስት፡ (e.g. Fols 134ra, 136va)
                                    </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:table-cell>
                     </fo:table-row>
                  </fo:table-body>
               </fo:table>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block font-style="italic"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      space-before="2mm"
                      page-break-inside="avoid"
                      page-break-after="avoid">Decoration</fo:block>
            <fo:block margin-top="3mm" margin-bottom="3mm">The manuscript contains four framed miniatures that were executed by the same hand and that
                       are comparable to one executed about a century later than the text
                       and opening headpiece (<fo:basic-link internal-destination="bm_2017HeldmanYared">
                  <fo:inline id="d1e12465bm_2017HeldmanYared">
                     <inline xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Format">Heldman and Shelemay 2017</inline>,  88</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>).</fo:block>
            <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="1em"
                           provisional-distance-between-starts="2em">
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>37)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. iv: <fo:inline> A portrait of <fo:inline id="d1e12479 PRS3417David">David</fo:inline> with a sword.
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>38)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. iir: <fo:inline> David beheading Goliath.
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>39)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. iiir: <fo:inline> David playing the harp .
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>40)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 137r: <fo:inline> St Michael slaying a demon.
                        </fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>41)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 1r: <fo:inline>Bichrome interlace band topped by abstract and irregularly arranged floral motifs.</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>42)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 71v: <fo:inline>Bichrome chevron band.</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
               <fo:list-item space-after="2mm">
                  <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                     <fo:block>43)</fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-label>
                  <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                     <fo:block>Fol. 107r: <fo:inline>Bichrome band filled with flower elements and hourglass motifs.</fo:inline>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:list-item-body>
               </fo:list-item>
            </fo:list-block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Other details</fo:block>
               <fo:block/>
               <fo:block/>
               <fo:block/>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">Condition</fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                                  Humidity appears to have damaged the parchment, especially towards the end of the manuscript.
                                  Some folios are slightly stained with dirt, e.g. on fols 25v, 36v, 93v, , or wax, e.g. on 108r, 114r, 117v, .
                                    The text is occasionally barely legible, e.g. on 13v, 14r, 96r.
                                    Some letters have been washed away and poorly rewritten in a secondary hand on fol. 24v.
                                    Traces of intensive use.
                                    <!-- It might be a sewing guard, that is, a strip of parchment (cut from another manuscript?) sewn through and used to give strength to the sewing.
                                        Further photographs would be necessary (EDS 04.02.2022) See collation and request for further actions for the stubs after f.136. (EDS 14.03.2024)-->
                                </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm">
               <fo:block font-style="italic"
                         space-after="3mm"
                         page-break-inside="avoid"
                         page-break-after="avoid">History</fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:inline>1800–1850</fo:inline>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before="2mm"
                      space-after="3mm"
                      margin-bottom="16.25pt"
                      page-break-before="avoid">URL: <fo:basic-link external-destination="https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethe30">https://betamasaheft.eu/BDLaethe30</fo:basic-link>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block-container>
         <!--  break  after Catalogue -->
         <fo:block page-break-after="always"/>
      </fo:flow>
